// Generated from Luther's "Activity Library: U6 to U16" (Claude Docs, October
// 2026) — 476 sourced activities, games and rule options by age. Regenerate
// rather than hand-edit: the drill ids are derived from each item's `key`, so
// editing a name here would orphan the drill a session plan points at.
// Decoded once by `ActivityLibrary.shared`.
import Foundation

extension ActivityLibrary {
    static let embeddedJSON = #####"""
{"version":1,"tabs":[{"age":"U6","title":"Activity Library: U6 and Under","guidance":["**Sources.** \"Mini\" is FIBA's [Mini-Basketball coaches manual](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-wabc-coaching-manual-mini-basketball-eng.pdf); its [Chinese edition](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-wabc-coaching-manual-mini-basketball-chn.pdf) has the same page numbers. \"Start Coaching\" is FIBA's [Start Coaching practice plans](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-wabc-start-coaching-eng-practice-plans.pdf). \"Jr. NBA\" is the [Rookie practice plans](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/), which carry videos for some activities.","**Chinese names.** A Chinese name is shown only where FIBA's Chinese edition gives one, so coaches can find the page. Some of those names are poor translations; see the Sources and checks tab.","**Age guidance.** FIBA's youngest band is ages 5 to 7. It asks for games and guided discovery, with running, jumping, changing direction, throwing and catching ahead of technique (Mini p.2).","**Equipment.** FIBA gives a size 3 ball and a 1.83 m basket for U6 (Mini p.33). China's 小篮球规则 (Mini-Basketball Rules) allow baskets of 1.80 m or lower for kindergarten children.","**Running it.** Set each activity as a challenge and keep it short. FIBA says no activity should run too long (Mini p.10).","**Sorting.** The split between this tab and the U7 tab is mine, not FIBA's. The simpler activities are here. Those with named stops and pivots, a set defender or two skills in a row are on the U7 tab.","**Under 5.** No source opened lists activities for children under 5. For them, use only the Block 1 rows. That is a judgment, not a sourced rule.","**Stronger groups.** FIBA says to coach to each player's level, not the age label (Mini p.5). A strong U6 group can borrow from the U7 tab."],"titleZh":"活动库：U6及以下","guidanceZh":["**资料来源。** “Mini”指FIBA的[《小篮球教练员手册》](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-wabc-coaching-manual-mini-basketball-eng.pdf)；其[中文版](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-wabc-coaching-manual-mini-basketball-chn.pdf)页码与英文版相同。“Start Coaching”指FIBA的[Start Coaching训练课计划](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-wabc-start-coaching-eng-practice-plans.pdf)。“Jr. NBA”指[Rookie训练课计划](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/)，其中部分活动配有视频。","**中文名称。** 只有FIBA中文版给出了中文名称的活动才标注该名称，方便教练查到对应页面。其中有些名称翻译得不好，详见“来源与核对”页。","**年龄指导。** FIBA最低的年龄段是5到7岁。这一阶段要求以游戏和引导式探索为主，把跑、跳、变向、投掷和接球放在技术之前（Mini 第2页）。","**器材。** FIBA规定U6使用3号球、篮筐高度1.83米（Mini 第33页）。中国《小篮球规则》允许幼儿园儿童使用1.80米或更低的篮筐。","**组织方式。** 把每个活动设计成一个挑战，并保持简短。FIBA指出，任何活动都不宜进行太久（Mini 第10页）。","**分类说明。** 本页与U7页的划分出自本库编者，不是FIBA的。较简单的活动放在本页；需要指定急停和转身方式、安排固定防守人，或连续完成两项技术的活动放在U7页。","**5岁以下。** 查阅过的资料中，没有一份列出适合5岁以下儿童的活动。对这个年龄只使用第1板块（常规与小游戏）的条目。这是编者的判断，不是有出处的规定。","**能力较强的队伍。** FIBA强调要按每名队员的实际水平执教，而不是按年龄标签（Mini 第5页）。能力强的U6队伍可以借用U7页的活动。"]},{"age":"U7","title":"Activity Library: U7","guidance":["**Same FIBA band.** U7 players are still inside FIBA's 5 to 7 band, so games come first here too (Mini p.2). Source names are explained on the U6 and under tab.","**Ball.** Size 4 fits two sources: FIBA's [Dos and Don'ts](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-mini-basketball-mini-basketball-dos-and-donts-eng.pdf) for ages 6 to 7, and China's 小篮球规则 (Mini-Basketball Rules) for age 8 and under. FIBA's manual instead names a softer size 5 for U8 (Mini p.33).","**Basket.** FIBA gives 6 to 8 feet (1.83 to 2.43 m) for ages 5 to 7 (Mini p.2; metres from p.33). China's rules give 2.35 m for ages 7 to 8.","**Teaching.** FIBA's method: start the game fast, stop after 4 to 5 minutes to ask questions, then change a rule. Technical points go in those pauses (Mini p.8–9).","**Defence.** FIBA asks only that a defender stay in front of the opponent. It cautions against teaching defensive footwork early (Mini p.30)."],"titleZh":"活动库：U7","guidanceZh":["**同属FIBA一个年龄段。** U7队员仍在FIBA的5到7岁年龄段内，所以这里同样以游戏为先（Mini 第2页）。资料来源名称的说明见“U6及以下”页。","**用球。** 4号球符合两份资料：FIBA的[《注意事项》（Dos and Don'ts）](https://assets.fiba.basketball/image/upload/documents-corporate-mini-basketball-mini-basketball-dos-and-donts-eng.pdf)针对6到7岁，中国《小篮球规则》针对8岁及以下。而FIBA手册对U8给出的是较软的5号球（Mini 第33页）。","**篮筐。** FIBA给出5到7岁的篮筐高度为6到8英尺（1.83到2.43米）（Mini 第2页；米制数据见第33页）。中国规则对7到8岁规定为2.35米。","**教学方法。** FIBA的做法：让比赛快速开始，进行4到5分钟后暂停提问，然后改一条规则。技术要点就在这些暂停时讲（Mini 第8–9页）。","**防守。** FIBA只要求防守队员站在对手前面，并提醒不要过早教防守脚步（Mini 第30页）。"]},{"age":"U8","title":"Activity Library: U8","guidance":["**Age bands from here.** China's national competitions (U8, U10, U12) and most sources group players in two-year bands (Zhejiang's provincial league, with U7, U8 and U9 groups, is an exception), and no activity source opened is split by single years, so the tabs after U7 run U8 (age 8), U10 (ages 9–10), U12 (11–12), U14 (13–14) and U16 (15–16). Each tab adds to the ones before it. A group that is ahead can borrow from the next tab; FIBA says to coach to each player's level, not the age label (Mini p.5).","**What FIBA asks at 8–9.** Coordination, mobility and fitness still matter more than basketball-specific skills. Dribbling, passing, shooting and defending come in through games, \"without rigorous 'drilling'\" (Mini p.4).","**Where the rows come from.** Most new rows are from the Jr. NBA Rookie plans. Jr. NBA says its levels go by skill, not age; the Positive Coaching Alliance, which helped write the curriculum, describes Rookie as \"typically ages 8 and under\". Others are from USA Basketball's Introductory Level (its Fundamentals stage is about ages 6–9), Switzerland's J+S-Kids lessons for ages 8–10, FIBA, and the French federation's Bouge au basket sheets for primary pupils.","**Ball and basket.** The sources disagree. FIBA: a softer size 5 ball at U8 and no basket height given (Mini p.33). China's 2017 小篮球规则 (Mini-Basketball Rules): size 4 and 2.35 m for ages 7–8. NBA and USA Basketball: size 5 and 8 ft (2.44 m) for ages 7–8. German federation: size 4, 2.05–2.60 m ([Miniregeln](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf)). A Yanqing district explainer published for the 2026 national finals gives 2.60 m for U8 ([report](https://peking.bjd.com.cn/content/s6a72f464e4b0e45f3fd5a7c7.html)); it does not say the finals used it, and no CBA document confirming that height was found.","**Competition in China.** The 2026 中国小篮球 (China Mini-Basketball) national finals had a U8 mixed division playing four 6-minute quarters, and every player needed skill level 3 in the CBA's 篮球技能等级 (Basketball Skill Level) system ([Xinhua](https://www.news.cn/sports/20260518/662850cdc7e84c01b9cef24222e80151/c.html); [China Sports Daily via Sina](https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml)). Under-10s may enter the test at any level from 1 to 4 ([CBA measures, report](https://www.sport.gov.cn/n20001280/n20067662/n20067613/c28355010/content.html)). The test is a timed course; level 1 includes a low backward defensive slide and a bounce pass into a net, and each error adds 2 seconds ([launch report](https://t.m.youth.cn/transfer/index/url/sports.youth.cn/ssjj/202407/t20240715_15382084.htm)). The full item list for each level is not in any public text found. Changzhou's 2026 city rules play U8 as full-court 4 on 4 on a 12 × 15 m court ([regulations](https://tyj.changzhou.gov.cn/html/tyj/2026/FMAJJNIC_0706/25449.html)).","**Activity length.** FIBA's Start Coaching workbook: each activity runs 5–10 minutes, and no player should wait more than 20–30 seconds before being involved (Coach Workbook p.26). FIBA's Level 1 coaching course gives 7–10 minutes as a suggested maximum before a change of activity or a break ([WABC Level 1, 2.1.5](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=235)).","**Session length.** For ages 7–8 the [NBA and USA Basketball guidelines](https://youthguidelines.nba.com/) recommend one practice a week of 30–60 minutes, at most 3 hours of organised basketball a week, at least 2 rest days a week and at most 4 months a year. A 90-minute session is above that.","**Specialising.** The same guidelines say: \"Delay specialization in basketball until at least age 14.\" USA Basketball's Introductory Level asks for basketball once or twice a week plus daily activity in other sports. Training to be elite does not change this advice in any source opened.","**Defence.** Player-to-player only, one defender on the ball (FIBA \"No Double Team\", Mini p.34), and no taking the ball from a player's hands. FIBA stresses staying in front of the opponent over defensive footwork (Mini p.30); the Jr. NBA rows on this tab do teach a stance and slides.","**Injury-prevention warm-up.** No basketball programme for this age was found. FIFA 11+ Kids is a football warm-up for ages 7–12 with trial evidence; it is listed at the end of Block 1 as an option."],"titleZh":"活动库：U8","guidanceZh":["**从这里开始按年龄段划分。** 中国的全国比赛（U8、U10、U12）和大多数资料都按两岁一个年龄段分组（浙江省联赛设U7、U8、U9组，是个例外），而查阅过的活动资料没有一份按单个年龄划分，所以U7之后各页分为U8（8岁）、U10（9–10岁）、U12（11–12岁）、U14（13–14岁）和U16（15–16岁）。每一页都在前面各页的基础上增加内容。水平领先的队伍可以借用下一页的活动；FIBA强调要按每名队员的实际水平执教，而不是按年龄标签（Mini 第5页）。","**FIBA对8–9岁的要求。** 协调性、灵活性和体能仍然比篮球专项技术更重要。运球、传球、投篮和防守通过游戏引入，“不做严格的‘机械训练’”（Mini 第4页）。","**条目来源。** 大部分新增条目来自Jr. NBA Rookie训练课计划。Jr. NBA表示其级别按技术水平而非年龄划分；参与编写该课程的Positive Coaching Alliance（积极执教联盟）称Rookie级“通常适合8岁及以下”。其他条目来自USA Basketball的入门级（Introductory Level，其基础阶段约为6–9岁）、瑞士J+S-Kids针对8–10岁的课程、FIBA，以及法国篮协面向小学生的Bouge au basket活动卡。","**用球和篮筐。** 各资料说法不一。FIBA：U8用较软的5号球，未给出篮筐高度（Mini 第33页）。中国2017年《小篮球规则》：7–8岁用4号球、篮筐2.35米。NBA与USA Basketball：7–8岁用5号球、篮筐8英尺（2.44米）。德国篮协：4号球，篮筐2.05–2.60米（[Miniregeln](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf)）。延庆区为2026年全国总决赛发布的一篇解读文章给出U8篮筐高度为2.60米（[报道](https://peking.bjd.com.cn/content/s6a72f464e4b0e45f3fd5a7c7.html)）；文章并未说明总决赛实际采用了这一高度，也没有找到确认该高度的中国篮协文件。","**中国的比赛。** 2026年中国小篮球全国总决赛设U8混合组，比赛分四节、每节6分钟，每名队员须达到中国篮协篮球技能等级3级（[新华社](https://www.news.cn/sports/20260518/662850cdc7e84c01b9cef24222e80151/c.html)；[中国体育报，经新浪转载](https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml)）。10岁以下可从1到4级中任一级别开始参加测试（[中国篮协办法，报道](https://www.sport.gov.cn/n20001280/n20067662/n20067613/c28355010/content.html)）。测试是计时的闯关路线；1级包括低姿后退防守滑步和击地传球入网，每出现一次失误加2秒（[启动报道](https://t.m.youth.cn/transfer/index/url/sports.youth.cn/ssjj/202407/t20240715_15382084.htm)）。各级别的完整测试项目没有在任何公开文本中找到。常州市2026年比赛规程规定U8为全场4对4，场地12×15米（[规程](https://tyj.changzhou.gov.cn/html/tyj/2026/FMAJJNIC_0706/25449.html)）。","**单个活动时长。** FIBA Start Coaching手册：每个活动进行5–10分钟，任何队员等待参与的时间都不应超过20–30秒（Coach Workbook 第26页）。FIBA一级教练员课程建议，一个活动最长7–10分钟，之后就应换活动或休息（[WABC一级，2.1.5](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=235)）。","**训练课时长。** 对7–8岁，[NBA与USA Basketball指南](https://youthguidelines.nba.com/)建议每周训练一次、每次30–60分钟，每周有组织的篮球活动最多3小时，每周至少休息2天，每年最多4个月。90分钟的训练课超出了这一范围。","**专项化。** 同一指南指出：“篮球专项化至少推迟到14岁。”USA Basketball的入门级要求每周打一到两次篮球，并且每天参加其他运动。查阅过的资料中，没有一份因为以精英为培养目标而改变这一建议。","**防守。** 只用人盯人，持球人只能由一人防守（FIBA“禁止包夹”规则，Mini 第34页），且不能从持球队员手中抢球。FIBA强调站在对手前面，而不是防守脚步（Mini 第30页）；不过本页的Jr. NBA条目确实会教防守姿势和滑步。","**预防损伤的热身。** 没有找到适合这个年龄的篮球热身方案。FIFA 11+ Kids是面向7–12岁的足球热身方案，有对照试验证据；它作为可选项列在第1板块（常规与小游戏）末尾。"]},{"age":"U10","title":"Activity Library: U10","guidance":["**Who.** Ages 9 and 10, China's U10 category. Everything on the U8 tab still applies.","**What FIBA asks.** At 8–9, motor abilities remain more important than basketball specifics, and dribbling, passing, shooting and defending come in without rigorous drilling (Mini p.4). From 10, more emphasis on fundamentals, contested activities followed by a return to uncontested ones, no specialist roles, and \"Often 'small sided' games such as 3 on 3 and 4 on 4 are better for children at this age\" (Mini p.5). The German federation's 2016 coaching guide, in its U10 section, puts it as \"Techniktraining ist Spieltraining\" (technique training is game training), with many ball contacts and decisions for everyone ([DBB guide, 2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) p.6–7).","**Where the rows come from.** Most new rows are from the Jr. NBA Starter plans, which the Positive Coaching Alliance describes as \"typically ages 9-11\". Others are from FIBA, from Switzerland's J+S-Kids lessons (ages 8–10) and from the Swiss Federal Office of Sport's Basketball at School material (ages 6–15).","**Ball and basket.** FIBA: 8 ft (2.43 m) at U10 (Mini p.33). China's 2017 rules: size 5 and 2.60 m for ages 9–10; a Yanqing district explainer published for the 2026 national finals gives 2.75 m for U10; it does not say the finals used it, and no CBA document confirms it. NBA and USA Basketball, ages 9–11: size 6 and 9 ft. German federation U10: size 5 (lighter models allowed) and 2.60 m. Research: boys aged 9–11 made more dribbles, passes and catches, and shot more accurately, with a 440 g ball than with the 485 g regulation ball of the same size (Arias 2012); children aged 9–12 made more shots at an 8 ft basket than at 10 ft, most clearly the 9–10-year-olds (Chase 1994).","**Competition in China.** The 2026 national finals had U10 boys and U10 mixed divisions, four 6-minute quarters, and required skill level 4. Applicants over 10 may start the skill test at level 5, and above level 5 must go up one level at a time. Changzhou's 2026 city rules play U10 as full-court 4 on 4, 12 × 15 m, 2.6 m basket, size 5 ball.","**Session length.** For ages 9–11 the [NBA and USA Basketball guidelines](https://youthguidelines.nba.com/) recommend two practices a week of 45–75 minutes, at most 5 hours of organised basketball a week, at least 2 rest days a week and at most 5 months a year. Basketball England's U10 session is 60 minutes, starting with 15 minutes of fun games ([Playbook](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7138/the-pdf-playbook.pdf) p.25). A 90-minute session is above both.","**Training and games.** USA Basketball (Learning to Train, about ages 8–12) recommends 70% training to 30% competition. Canada Basketball (Learn to Train, girls 8–11, boys 9–12) recommends 75:25 and warns that \"Too many competitions waste valuable training time\" ([ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) p.36–38). Canada also says everyone should play every position at this stage.","**No screens.** The CBA's 2026 U12 camp plan says no on-ball screens under 12 (media report); Germany's mini rules ban screens and hand-offs up to U12; Ireland bans ball screens at U11. There are no screening activities on this tab.","**Injury-prevention warm-up.** The FIFA 11+ Kids option on the U8 tab covers ages 7–12."],"titleZh":"活动库：U10","guidanceZh":["**适用对象。** 9岁和10岁，即中国的U10组别。U8页的所有内容依然适用。","**FIBA的要求。** 8–9岁时，运动能力仍比篮球专项更重要，运球、传球、投篮和防守的引入不做严格的机械训练（Mini 第4页）。从10岁起，更强调基本功，先进行有对抗的活动，再回到无对抗的练习，不安排固定的专门位置，并且“3对3、4对4这类‘小场’比赛往往更适合这个年龄的孩子”（Mini 第5页）。德国篮协2016年执教指南的U10部分概括为“Techniktraining ist Spieltraining”（技术训练就是比赛训练），让每个人都有大量触球和做决定的机会（[DBB指南，2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) 第6–7页）。","**条目来源。** 大部分新增条目来自Jr. NBA Starter训练课计划，Positive Coaching Alliance称其“通常适合9–11岁”。其他条目来自FIBA、瑞士J+S-Kids课程（8–10岁）以及瑞士联邦体育局的《学校篮球》材料（6–15岁）。","**用球和篮筐。** FIBA：U10篮筐8英尺（2.43米）（Mini 第33页）。中国2017年规则：9–10岁用5号球、篮筐2.60米；延庆区为2026年全国总决赛发布的一篇解读文章给出U10为2.75米，但文章并未说明总决赛实际采用了这一高度，也没有中国篮协文件确认。NBA与USA Basketball，9–11岁：6号球、篮筐9英尺。德国篮协U10：5号球（允许使用较轻的型号）、篮筐2.60米。研究：9–11岁男孩使用440克的球时，比使用同尺寸、485克的标准球运球、传球和接球次数更多，投篮也更准（Arias 2012）；9–12岁儿童在8英尺篮筐上的投中次数多于10英尺篮筐，9–10岁组最明显（Chase 1994）。","**中国的比赛。** 2026年全国总决赛设U10男子组和U10混合组，比赛分四节、每节6分钟，要求技能等级4级。10岁以上的报名者可从5级开始参加技能测试，5级以上必须逐级晋升。常州市2026年比赛规程规定U10为全场4对4，场地12×15米，篮筐2.6米，5号球。","**训练课时长。** 对9–11岁，[NBA与USA Basketball指南](https://youthguidelines.nba.com/)建议每周训练两次、每次45–75分钟，每周有组织的篮球活动最多5小时，每周至少休息2天，每年最多5个月。英格兰篮协的U10训练课为60分钟，开头15分钟是趣味游戏（[Playbook](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7138/the-pdf-playbook.pdf) 第25页）。90分钟的训练课超出了这两者。","**训练与比赛的比例。** USA Basketball（“学习训练”阶段，约8–12岁）建议训练占70%、比赛占30%。加拿大篮协（“学习训练”阶段，女孩8–11岁，男孩9–12岁）建议75:25，并提醒“比赛太多会浪费宝贵的训练时间”（[ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) 第36–38页）。加拿大还提出，这个阶段每个人都应打遍所有位置。","**不做掩护。** 据媒体报道，中国篮协2026年U12训练营计划规定12岁以下不做有球掩护；德国小篮球规则在U12及以下禁止掩护和手递手传球；爱尔兰在U11禁止持球掩护。本页没有掩护类活动。","**预防损伤的热身。** U8页的FIFA 11+ Kids可选项覆盖7–12岁。"]},{"age":"U12","title":"Activity Library: U12","guidance":["**Who.** Ages 11 and 12, China's U12 category, the last mini-basketball age. Everything on the U10 tab still applies.","**What FIBA asks at 10–12.** More emphasis on fundamentals and more analytical feedback, but no specialist roles, and ideas for attack and defence that \"should be simple at the beginning\". Small-sided 3 on 3 and 4 on 4 are often better, with the aim of playing 5 on 5 \"in a slightly more organised way\" (Mini p.5). The German federation's U11/U12 goals add systematic technique training, basic defensive technique, and passing and moving as a group ([DBB guide, 2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) p.7–8). FIBA's Level 1 coaching course for under-12s: \"perfecting basketball fundamentals is not the most important aspect\", making practice fun is \"the most important consideration\", and \"all players should play all positions\" ([WABC Level 1, 3.2.2](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=268)). Basketball England's U12 list: more complex footwork, shooting on the move, defence, rebounding, pivoting and passing under pressure.","**Where the rows come from.** Jr. NBA Starter and All-Star (plus two MVP dribbling drills), FIBA's 4 on 4 chapter (Mini p.44–47), the CBA's 2026 U12 camp plan as reported in the media, and Switzerland's Federal Office of Sport. The Positive Coaching Alliance aims Jr. NBA All-Star at coaches of teenagers; using it at U12 is a judgment for players training toward elite level, in line with Jr. NBA's advice that elite teams start with All-Star or MVP.","**Ball and basket.** FIBA: size 5 at U12, no height given (Mini p.33). China's 2017 rules: size 5 and 2.75 m for ages 11–12; a Yanqing district explainer published for the 2026 finals lists 3.05 m for U12 (no CBA document confirms the finals' heights), and Changzhou's city rules use 3.05 m with a size 7 ball, a local choice. NBA and USA Basketball, ages 12–14: girls size 6, boys size 7, 10 ft. Germany: size 5 and 2.60 m up to U12. Ireland U12: size 5, regulation baskets.","**Competition in China.** The 2026 national finals had U12 boys and U12 girls divisions with 8-minute quarters and required skill level 5. Reported level 5 items: a one-handed pass into a net, behind-the-back and step-back dribbles, and lay-ups with the right and left hand, underhand and overhand; a two-handed pass where one hand is required counts as an error and adds 2 seconds ([launch report](https://t.m.youth.cn/transfer/index/url/sports.youth.cn/ssjj/202407/t20240715_15382084.htm)). Two Jr. NBA MVP dribbling rows for those moves are in Block 1. Changzhou plays U12 as full-court 5 on 5.","**Rules that shape this tab.** No on-ball screens under 12 (CBA camp plan, media report: \"12岁以下…不做有球掩护\", no on-ball screens under 12); Germany bans screens and hand-offs to U12. Player-to-player only (FIBA: no zone until U16, Mini p.34; Ireland). No double-teams (Ireland U12, Germany). Help defence is allowed (Ireland U12).","**What the CBA's 2026 U12 camps worked on.** As reported in the media: every session ran warm-up and activation, then technique, then team tactics, then stretching and recovery; training centred on drive-and-kick and pass-and-cut; the camps used 贝壳防守 (shell defence), 分割线防守 (help-line defence: weak-side defenders adjust to the ball and stop cuts), 5Y动态进攻 (5Y motion offence: continuous passing, cutting and refilling spots, no set plays) and the 维克森林训练法 (Wake Forest drill: transition that adds players each change of possession, 2 on 1 up to 5 on 5); one camp dropped its all-star game to put \"团队篮球优先\" (team basketball first) ([report](https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260829A059G300); [camp summary](https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260902A06XWC00)). The reports give no set-ups, so these are not rows; Shell Drill – 4 on 4, 3 on 1 Drive and Kick Reaction, 3-Person Pass, Cut and Replace and 3 on 1 Transition on this tab train the same ideas.","**Long shots.** Two rows include 3-point shots. FIBA counts shots from outside the 3-point line as 2 in mini-basketball because young players often lack the technique or strength for long shots (Mini p.33), and Basketball Ireland does the same at U12. FIBA's Start Coaching handbook adds: \"When young players shoot from \"beyond their range\" they will usually have poor technique\" (Facilitator Handbook p.97).","**Session length.** NBA and USA Basketball: ages 9–11, 45–75 minutes twice a week, at most 5 hours a week; ages 12–14, 60–90 minutes 2–4 times a week, at most 10 hours, at least 1 rest day a week, at most 7 months a year. Basketball England U12: 75–90 minutes. A 90-minute session is at the top of the 12–14 and Basketball England ranges, and 15 minutes over the 75-minute maximum for ages 9–11, which covers 11-year-olds.","**Teaching through games.** In a Spanish school study, 11–12-year-olds taught through tactical games outperformed a direct-instruction group in 3 on 3 on decisions, dribbling, shooting, spacing and off-ball defence (González-Espinosa 2021). In a Scottish study, 12-year-olds taught through games made more than twice as many good off-ball decisions, with no difference in skill execution (Gray and Sproule 2011). Both were short school units (10 and 5 lessons); the Spanish pupils had no formal basketball training.","**Injury-prevention warm-up.** SHRed, a basketball-specific programme tested in players aged 11–18, is the first row of Block 1."],"titleZh":"活动库：U12","guidanceZh":["**适用对象。** 11岁和12岁，即中国的U12组别，也是小篮球的最后一个年龄段。U10页的所有内容依然适用。","**FIBA对10–12岁的要求。** 更强调基本功，给予更具分析性的反馈，但不安排固定的专门位置，攻防理念“一开始应当简单”。3对3、4对4的小场比赛往往更好，目标是以“稍有组织的方式”打5对5（Mini 第5页）。德国篮协对U11/U12的目标还包括：系统的技术训练、基本的防守技术，以及集体的传球与跑动（[DBB指南，2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) 第7–8页）。FIBA一级教练员课程对12岁以下的说法：“把篮球基本功练到完美并不是最重要的”，让训练有趣才是“最重要的考虑”，并且“所有队员都应打所有位置”（[WABC一级，3.2.2](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=268)）。英格兰篮协的U12清单：更复杂的脚步、行进间投篮、防守、篮板、转身，以及在压力下传球。","**条目来源。** Jr. NBA Starter和All-Star（另加两个MVP级运球练习）、FIBA的4对4章节（Mini 第44–47页）、媒体报道的中国篮协2026年U12训练营计划，以及瑞士联邦体育局。Positive Coaching Alliance把Jr. NBA All-Star定位给执教青少年的教练；在U12使用它，是针对以精英为目标训练的队员所做的判断，这与Jr. NBA“精英队伍从All-Star或MVP级开始”的建议一致。","**用球和篮筐。** FIBA：U12用5号球，未给出篮筐高度（Mini 第33页）。中国2017年规则：11–12岁用5号球、篮筐2.75米；延庆区为2026年总决赛发布的一篇解读文章列出U12为3.05米（没有中国篮协文件确认总决赛的篮筐高度），常州市比赛规程采用3.05米和7号球，属于地方选择。NBA与USA Basketball，12–14岁：女孩6号球，男孩7号球，篮筐10英尺。德国：U12及以下5号球、篮筐2.60米。爱尔兰U12：5号球，标准篮筐。","**中国的比赛。** 2026年全国总决赛设U12男子组和U12女子组，每节8分钟，要求技能等级5级。据报道，5级项目包括：单手传球入网、背后运球和后撤步运球，以及右手和左手的低手上篮与高手上篮；要求单手传球时用了双手传球，算作失误并加2秒（[启动报道](https://t.m.youth.cn/transfer/index/url/sports.youth.cn/ssjj/202407/t20240715_15382084.htm)）。针对这些动作的两个Jr. NBA MVP运球条目（“胯下-变向-背后连续运球”和“侧后撤步分解练习”）放在第1板块（常规与小游戏）。常州市U12为全场5对5。","**影响本页的规则。** 12岁以下不做有球掩护（中国篮协训练营计划，媒体报道：“12岁以下…不做有球掩护”）；德国在U12及以下禁止掩护和手递手传球。只用人盯人（FIBA：U16之前不用区域防守，Mini 第34页；爱尔兰同样如此）。不包夹（爱尔兰U12、德国）。允许协防（爱尔兰U12）。","**中国篮协2026年U12训练营的训练内容。** 据媒体报道：每次训练课依次进行热身激活、技术、团队战术、拉伸恢复；训练以突破分球和传切配合为核心；训练营采用了贝壳防守、分割线防守（弱侧防守队员随球调整位置，阻止空切）、5Y动态进攻（持续传球、空切和补位，不打固定战术）以及维克森林训练法（每次攻防转换都增加人数的转换练习，从2打1一直到5对5）；有一个训练营取消了全明星赛，以贯彻“团队篮球优先”（[报道](https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260829A059G300)；[训练营总结](https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260902A06XWC00)）。报道没有给出具体组织方式，所以这些没有列为条目；本页的“4对4贝壳防守（Shell）”、“3打1突破分球反应”、“三人传切补位”和“3打1攻防转换”练的是同样的理念。","**远距离投篮。** 有两个条目包含三分投篮。FIBA在小篮球中把三分线外的投篮算作2分，因为小队员往往缺乏远投的技术或力量（Mini 第33页），爱尔兰篮协在U12也这样做。FIBA的Start Coaching手册还指出：“小队员在‘超出自己射程’的距离投篮时，技术通常都会变形”（Facilitator Handbook 第97页）。","**训练课时长。** NBA与USA Basketball：9–11岁，每周两次、每次45–75分钟，每周最多5小时；12–14岁，每周2–4次、每次60–90分钟，每周最多10小时，每周至少休息1天，每年最多7个月。英格兰篮协U12：75–90分钟。90分钟的训练课处于12–14岁标准和英格兰篮协范围的上限，比9–11岁（涵盖11岁队员）75分钟的上限多出15分钟。","**通过比赛教学。** 一项西班牙学校研究中，通过战术游戏教学的11–12岁学生，在3对3中的决策、运球、投篮、拉开空间和无球防守方面都优于直接讲授组（González-Espinosa 2021）。一项苏格兰研究中，通过比赛教学的12岁学生做出的正确无球决策是对照组的两倍多，技术执行上没有差别（Gray and Sproule 2011）。两项研究都是短期的学校教学单元（分别为10课和5课）；西班牙的学生没有接受过正规篮球训练。","**预防损伤的热身。** SHRed是一套篮球专项热身方案，在11–18岁队员中做过检验，列为第1板块（常规与小游戏）的第一个条目。"]},{"age":"U14","title":"Activity Library: U14","guidance":["**Who.** Ages 13 and 14, China's U14 category. Everything on the U12 tab still applies except the under-12 bans on screens and on 3-point scoring.","**What the federations ask.** German federation U13/U14: steer technique toward competition technique, make athletic training a major focus, consolidate defensive technique, learn simple team structures, and value creativity over rigid sequences; train players for a position \"but not one-sidedly\" ([DBB guide, 2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) p.8–9). Basketball England U14: shooting, on-ball defence, passing on the move and movement off the ball ([Talent Plan](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7137/talent-plan.pdf) p.19); 5 on 5 \"is introduced but is underpinned by concepts worked through 1v1 to 3v3\" ([Playbook](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7138/the-pdf-playbook.pdf) p.27). Canada (Train to Train, phase 1: girls 11–13, boys 12–14): no zone defence or zone presses, 4 practices to 1 game, and train through 1 on 1, 2 on 2 and 3 on 3 ([ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) p.40–42).","**What FIBA's coaching course asks at 13–14.** \"Coaches must go into more depth concerning the development of technical fundamentals and individual tactical decisions (the decisions taken on the 1x1, 2x2, 3x3, etc.)\", without going too fast. More experienced players \"must use their non-preferred hand\"; all players should be able to fast break from any position and be introduced to perimeter and post skills; and success can be defined by the right process, not only points ([WABC Level 1, 3.2.2](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=268)). FIBA's older book for this age (Basketball for Young Players, 2000, since replaced by FIBA's newer coaches manual) adds: \"Exclusively individual defense must be trained\", at most 25% new material in any practice, and tall players do the same drills as the others; it prints 24 complete 120-minute sessions for 13–14-year-olds ([chapter 7, Iceland federation copy](<https://kki.is/library/Skrar/06.CAPITULO%206%20(Ingles).pdf>)).","**Where the rows come from.** Jr. NBA All-Star (the Positive Coaching Alliance aims it at coaches of teenagers), the more basic Jr. NBA MVP items and two Jr. NBA Starter screening activities, plus Switzerland's Federal Office of Sport and two training studies.","**Ball and basket.** 10 ft (3.05 m). NBA and USA Basketball, ages 12–14: girls size 6, boys size 7. Basketball New Zealand U14: boys size 6, girls size 5. Basketball Ireland U14: size 6. China's junior high league (players 15 and under): boys size 7, girls size 6. Changzhou U14: 5 on 5, 3.05 m, size 7. Research: in 51 U14 boys, a 2.80 m basket in competition produced more fast breaks and longer set attacks; shooting improved but not significantly (Ortega-Toro 2021).","**Competition in China.** The 全国U14青少年篮球联赛 (National U14 Youth League) is run by the CBA and the China Student Sports Federation; its 2026 final stage is 23–29 November in Yanqing, Beijing, and Zhejiang and Hangzhou girls' teams qualified ([report](https://www.sohu.com/a/1079772830_138481)). The 2026 中国初中篮球联赛 (China Junior High League) plays 4 × 8 minutes and splits each 12-player roster into groups A and B for the first two quarters ([Shaanxi notice](https://finance.sina.com.cn/wm/2026-05-25/doc-inhzchzh3486712.shtml)). No U14 regulation text with shot clock or defence rules was found.","**Defence rules differ.** Zone: FIBA's manual says not until U16 (Mini p.34), and FIBA's Start Coaching workbook says it \"is not recommended for players under 14\"; Ireland and New Zealand ban it at U14; Canada bans it in phase 1; USA Basketball allows all defences at 12–14. Double-teams: banned at U14 in Ireland, allowed in the USA. This tab has no zone or trapping rows. Full-court pressure is allowed in both.","**Session length.** NBA and USA Basketball, ages 12–14: 60–90 minutes, 2–4 times a week, at most 10 hours a week (players near that limit should not play another organised sport at the same time), at least 1 rest day a week and at most 7 months a year. Basketball England U14: 90 minutes. The 90-minute session fits.","**Specialising and growth.** NBA and USA Basketball: \"Delay specialization in basketball until at least age 14.\" Puberty starts on average at 12.5–13 for boys and 11–11.5 for girls (Canada Basketball).","**Strength work.** The German federation makes athletic training a major focus at U13/U14. The 2014 international consensus and the NSCA position statement support resistance training for young players when it is designed and supervised by qualified professionals, technique first, 2–3 sessions a week on non-consecutive days ([Lloyd 2014](https://doi.org/10.1136/bjsports-2013-092952); Faigenbaum 2009). That is separate from the 90-minute court session."],"titleZh":"活动库：U14","guidanceZh":["**适用对象。** 13岁和14岁，即中国的U14组别。U12页的所有内容依然适用，但12岁以下禁止掩护和不计三分的规定除外。","**各国篮协的要求。** 德国篮协U13/U14：把技术引向比赛技术，把体能训练作为重点，巩固防守技术，学习简单的团队配合结构，重视创造性而非僵化的套路；可以针对位置训练队员，“但不能片面”（[DBB指南，2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) 第8–9页）。英格兰篮协U14：投篮、持球防守、行进间传球和无球跑动（[Talent Plan](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7137/talent-plan.pdf) 第19页）；5对5“开始引入，但以1对1到3对3中练过的理念为基础”（[Playbook](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7138/the-pdf-playbook.pdf) 第27页）。加拿大（“训练如何训练”第1阶段：女孩11–13岁，男孩12–14岁）：不用区域防守或区域紧逼，训练与比赛4比1，并通过1对1、2对2和3对3进行训练（[ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) 第40–42页）。","**FIBA教练员课程对13–14岁的要求。** “教练必须更深入地发展技术基本功和个人战术决策（即在1对1、2对2、3对3等情况下做出的决策）”，但不能推进太快。经验较多的队员“必须使用非惯用手”；所有队员都应能从任何位置发动快攻，并开始接触外线和内线技术；成功可以用正确的过程来定义，而不只是得分（[WABC一级，3.2.2](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=268)）。FIBA针对这个年龄的旧版书籍（Basketball for Young Players，2000年，后被FIBA新版教练员手册取代）补充：“必须只训练个人防守”，任何一次训练中新内容最多占25%，高个子队员和其他人做同样的练习；书中收录了24节完整的、面向13–14岁的120分钟训练课（[第7章，冰岛篮协版本](<https://kki.is/library/Skrar/06.CAPITULO%206%20(Ingles).pdf>)）。","**条目来源。** Jr. NBA All-Star（Positive Coaching Alliance将其定位给执教青少年的教练）、较基础的Jr. NBA MVP项目和两个Jr. NBA Starter掩护活动，另有瑞士联邦体育局的材料和两项训练研究。","**用球和篮筐。** 篮筐10英尺（3.05米）。NBA与USA Basketball，12–14岁：女孩6号球，男孩7号球。新西兰篮协U14：男孩6号球，女孩5号球。爱尔兰篮协U14：6号球。中国初中篮球联赛（15岁及以下）：男子7号球，女子6号球。常州U14：5对5，篮筐3.05米，7号球。研究：在51名U14男孩中，比赛使用2.80米篮筐时，快攻更多、阵地进攻时间更长；投篮有所提高，但不显著（Ortega-Toro 2021）。","**中国的比赛。** 全国U14青少年篮球联赛由中国篮协和中国中学生体育协会主办；2026年总决赛阶段于11月23–29日在北京延庆举行，浙江和杭州的女队获得了参赛资格（[报道](https://www.sohu.com/a/1079772830_138481)）。2026年中国初中篮球联赛比赛为4节×8分钟，每队12人的名单分为A、B两组，分别打前两节（[陕西通知](https://finance.sina.com.cn/wm/2026-05-25/doc-inhzchzh3486712.shtml)）。没有找到包含进攻计时或防守规则的U14规程文本。","**防守规则各不相同。** 区域防守：FIBA手册说U16之前不用（Mini 第34页），FIBA Start Coaching手册说“不建议14岁以下队员使用”；爱尔兰和新西兰在U14禁止；加拿大在第1阶段禁止；USA Basketball在12–14岁允许所有防守。包夹：爱尔兰在U14禁止，美国允许。本页没有区域防守或包夹条目。两者都允许全场紧逼。","**训练课时长。** NBA与USA Basketball，12–14岁：每次60–90分钟，每周2–4次，每周最多10小时（接近这一上限的队员不应同时参加其他有组织的运动），每周至少休息1天，每年最多7个月。英格兰篮协U14：90分钟。90分钟的训练课符合要求。","**专项化与生长发育。** NBA与USA Basketball：“篮球专项化至少推迟到14岁。”男孩青春期平均在12.5–13岁开始，女孩在11–11.5岁（加拿大篮协）。","**力量训练。** 德国篮协把体能训练作为U13/U14的重点。2014年国际共识声明和NSCA立场声明都支持青少年队员进行抗阻训练，前提是由合格的专业人员设计和指导，技术优先，每周2–3次，安排在不相邻的日子（[Lloyd 2014](https://doi.org/10.1136/bjsports-2013-092952)；Faigenbaum 2009）。这与90分钟的球场训练课分开进行。"]},{"age":"U16","title":"Activity Library: U16","guidance":["**Who.** Ages 15 and 16. Everything on the U14 tab still applies, except its no-zone and no-double-team rules (see Rules below).","**What the federations ask.** German federation U15/U16: more intense technique training, position-specific and under game-like conditions; basketball-specific athleticism; the start of strength training; more complex team tactics; and coordinating sport and school loads ([DBB guide, 2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) p.9–11). Basketball England U16: more speed, consistency and accuracy, \"early position specific work\" and a broad range of finishes ([Talent Plan](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7137/talent-plan.pdf) p.19), and 5 on 5 \"underpinned with the concepts of 3v3 and 4v4\" ([Playbook](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7138/the-pdf-playbook.pdf) p.28). Canada (Train to Train, phase 2: girls 13–15, boys 14–16): the regulation game with a shot clock, and zone defences and presses only once players use their basic skills well in competition; late maturers must still get chances to play ([ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) p.46).","**What FIBA asks at 15–16.** FIBA's Level 1 course: keep the long-term view but measure each player's needs in more detail, \"what are they missing?\" ([WABC Level 1, 3.2.2](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=268)). FIBA's 2000 book (Basketball for Young Players, since replaced): training \"more analytical and individualised\"; prepare 15–16-year-olds for \"progressively, higher loads of physical work\"; every player, guard or forward included, learns to play with the back to the basket in the low post; and practice built around decision-making ([chapter 8, Iceland federation copy](<https://kki.is/library/Skrar/07.CAPITULO%207%20(Ingles).pdf>)).","**Where the rows come from.** Mostly Jr. NBA MVP, the level at which \"players will also begin to specialize and fit into more specific roles and positions\"; plus one Jr. NBA All-Star game (Circle Trap 3 on 3), one FIBA decision game (Low-post decision 3 on 3) and the SHRed warm-up. Position rows are marked BIGS or GUARDS as Jr. NBA labels them. Basketball England's ages-and-stages summary still asks for an \"all-round\" player at 15–18 for women and 16–18 for men ([summary](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/3802/summary-of-our-basketball-development-model-ages-and-stages.pdf)), so every player should get both.","**Rules.** Full FIBA rules: Ireland from U15, USA Basketball for high school (four 10-minute periods, 24-second shot clock with a 14-second reset after an offensive rebound, boys size 7, girls size 6). Zone: FIBA allows it from U16 (Mini p.34), but Basketball New Zealand still bans it at U16. FIBA's 2000 book says that at 15–16 \"it will be enough to start with one simple alignment (2-1-2, 2-3)\", built from part drills up to 5 on 5, with other alignments and specific press defence left until 17–18. Its zone drills depend on diagrams that could not be read, so this tab has no zone rows; that is a gap.","**Competition in China.** National U15 and U17 leagues exist (the 2026 U15 boys' final was 14–20 August in Jinjiang); no U15, U16 or U17 regulation text was found. The 2026 National Youth Three-Ball Games have under-18 groups only. Zhejiang's 2026 Provincial Games (Quzhou) include 5-a-side and 3x3 basketball; their age groups were not found.","**Session length.** NBA and USA Basketball, high school: 90–120 minutes, 3–4 times a week, at most 14 hours a week, at least 1 rest day a week and at most 9–10 months a year. Basketball England U16: 90 minutes. USA Basketball's Training to Compete stage (about 14–17) moves to 50% training and 50% competition.","**Strength and warm-up.** The German federation starts strength training at U15/U16; see the U14 tab for the consensus guidance. In 275 Slovenian male club players aged 13–17, a coach-led neuromuscular warm-up of about 14 minutes went with injury prevalence of 10.9% against 23.3% in teams without it ([Paravlić 2024](https://doi.org/10.1080/02640414.2024.2415215)). SHRed (U12 tab) is a ready-made basketball version."],"titleZh":"活动库：U16","guidanceZh":["**适用对象。** 15岁和16岁。U14页的所有内容依然适用，但其中不用区域防守和不包夹的规定除外（见下方“规则”）。","**各国篮协的要求。** 德国篮协U15/U16：更高强度的技术训练，针对位置、在接近比赛的条件下进行；篮球专项体能；开始力量训练；更复杂的团队战术；协调好运动与学业的负担（[DBB指南，2016](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/10/1.10-Leitfaden-fuer-das-Training-mit-Kindern-und-Jugendlichen.pdf) 第9–11页）。英格兰篮协U16：更快的速度、更高的稳定性和准确性，“初步的位置专项训练”和多样的终结方式（[Talent Plan](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7137/talent-plan.pdf) 第19页），以及5对5“以3对3和4对4的理念为基础”（[Playbook](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/7138/the-pdf-playbook.pdf) 第28页）。加拿大（“训练如何训练”第2阶段：女孩13–15岁，男孩14–16岁）：采用带进攻计时的正式比赛，只有当队员在比赛中能很好地运用基本技术后，才使用区域防守和紧逼；晚熟的队员仍必须获得上场机会（[ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) 第46页）。","**FIBA对15–16岁的要求。** FIBA一级课程：保持长期视角，但要更细致地衡量每名队员的需要——“他们还缺什么？”（[WABC一级，3.2.2](https://wabc-chn.fiba.com/?p=268)）。FIBA 2000年的书（Basketball for Young Players，后被取代）：训练“更具分析性、更个性化”；让15–16岁队员为“逐步加大的身体负荷”做好准备；每名队员，包括后卫和前锋，都要学会在低位背身打球；训练要围绕决策来安排（[第8章，冰岛篮协版本](<https://kki.is/library/Skrar/07.CAPITULO%207%20(Ingles).pdf>)）。","**条目来源。** 主要来自Jr. NBA MVP，在这一级别“队员也将开始专项化，进入更具体的角色和位置”；另有一个Jr. NBA All-Star比赛（“圆圈包夹3对3”）、一个FIBA决策比赛（“低位决策3对3”）和SHRed热身。位置条目按Jr. NBA的标注分为BIGS（内线）或GUARDS（后卫）。英格兰篮协的年龄与阶段概要仍要求女子15–18岁、男子16–18岁培养“全面型”队员（[概要](https://www.basketballengland.co.uk/media/3802/summary-of-our-basketball-development-model-ages-and-stages.pdf)），所以每名队员两类都应练。","**规则。** 完整FIBA规则：爱尔兰从U15起使用；USA Basketball的高中比赛（四节、每节10分钟，24秒进攻计时，进攻篮板后重置为14秒，男子7号球，女子6号球）。区域防守：FIBA从U16起允许（Mini 第34页），但新西兰篮协在U16仍禁止。FIBA 2000年的书说，15–16岁时“从一种简单的站位（2-1-2、2-3）开始就够了”，由分解练习逐步过渡到5对5，其他站位和专门的紧逼防守留到17–18岁。书中的区域防守练习依赖无法辨认的图示，所以本页没有区域防守条目；这是一个空缺。","**中国的比赛。** 全国U15和U17联赛已经设立（2026年U15男子总决赛于8月14–20日在晋江举行）；没有找到U15、U16或U17的规程文本。2026年全国青少年三大球运动会只设U18以下组别。浙江省2026年省运会（衢州）设有五人制篮球和三人篮球；其年龄组别未找到。","**训练课时长。** NBA与USA Basketball，高中：每次90–120分钟，每周3–4次，每周最多14小时，每周至少休息1天，每年最多9–10个月。英格兰篮协U16：90分钟。USA Basketball的“为比赛而训练”阶段（约14–17岁）调整为训练与比赛各占50%。","**力量训练与热身。** 德国篮协在U15/U16开始力量训练；共识性指导见U14页。在275名13–17岁的斯洛文尼亚男子俱乐部队员中，由教练带领、约14分钟的神经肌肉热身对应的损伤发生率为10.9%，而没有这种热身的球队为23.3%（[Paravlić 2024](https://doi.org/10.1080/02640414.2024.2415215)）。SHRed（见U12页）是现成的篮球版本。"]}],"items":[{"key":"U6|routine|Walks and runs with the ball","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Walks and runs with the ball","nameZh":"持球走跑","howItRuns":"Walk on heels and on tiptoes. Move forward, backward and sideways holding the ball high, low or behind the back.","source":"Mini p.10, items 1–2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用脚跟走，再踮脚尖走。持球举高、放低或放在背后，向前、向后、向侧方移动。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Heel flicks and high knees","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Heel flicks and high knees","nameZh":"后踢腿与高抬腿","howItRuns":"Run so the heels touch the ball held behind the back. Run so the knees touch the ball held in front.","source":"Mini p.10, items 3–4","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球拿在背后，跑动中用脚跟踢到球。球拿在身前，跑动中用膝盖碰到球。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Ball around the body","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Ball around the body","nameZh":"绕身体传球","howItRuns":"While walking or running, pass the ball around the head, body and legs, or toss it from hand to hand. Eyes stay up on the coach.","source":"Mini p.10, item 5","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"边走或边跑，让球绕头、绕身体、绕腿传递，或在两手之间来回抛接。眼睛始终看着教练。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Music stop","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Music stop","nameZh":"音乐停","howItRuns":"Move with the ball while music plays and freeze when it stops. Next step: the same while dribbling freely with one or two hands.","source":"Mini p.10, items 6–7","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"音乐响起时持球移动，音乐一停立即定住。进阶：同样玩法，改为单手或双手自由运球。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Which part of the hand?","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Which part of the hand?","nameZh":"用手的哪里拍？","howItRuns":"Bounce the ball with a fist, the side of the hand, the back of the hand, then palm and fingers. Ask which gave the most control.","source":"Mini p.11, item 26","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"依次用拳头、手掌侧面、手背拍球，最后用手掌和手指。问小朋友：哪种拍法最能控制住球？"},{"key":"U6|routine|High and low","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"High and low","nameZh":"高低运球","howItRuns":"Dribble high, very high, low and very low. Sitting down, dribble with one finger, then two, up to five.","source":"Mini p.12, Body Orientation items 10–11","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"高运球、很高运球、低运球、很低运球。坐在地上，先用一根手指运球，再用两根，一直加到五根。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Toss, clap, catch","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Toss, clap, catch","nameZh":"抛球拍手接","howItRuns":"Throw the ball high and catch it after clapping in front, behind the back or under the legs. Then touch the floor or turn around before the catch.","source":"Mini p.12, Spatial-Temporal item 4","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"把球高高抛起，在身前、背后或腿下拍手后再接住。然后改为接球前先摸一下地面或原地转一圈。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Line explorers","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Line explorers","nameZh":"沿线探险","howItRuns":"Walk, run, jump and dribble along the lines and circles of the court.","source":"Mini p.12, Body Orientation items 1 and 4","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"沿着球场上的线和圆圈走、跑、跳和运球。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Obstacle roll","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Obstacle roll","nameZh":"绕障碍滚球","howItRuns":"Scatter cones, bottles or bags on the court. Players move around them rolling the ball with one hand, left then right. Then two hands, then feet, and last dribbling.","source":"Mini p.12, Spatial-Temporal item 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在场上随意摆放标志桶、瓶子或沙包。队员绕着障碍物移动，单手滚球，先左手后右手。然后双手滚球，再用脚带球，最后改为运球。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Clap the rhythm","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Clap the rhythm","nameZh":"拍节奏运球","howItRuns":"The coach claps a rhythm and the players dribble it, standing first and then on the move.","source":"Mini p.13, Spatial-Temporal item 12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练拍出一个节奏，队员按这个节奏运球，先原地，再行进间。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Jack-Hammer Game","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Jack-Hammer Game","nameZh":"气锤游戏","howItRuns":"A leader dribbles high, low, slow and fast. The others copy.","source":"Mini p.17, item 8","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一名领头人运球，时高时低、时慢时快，其他人跟着模仿。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Car Game","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Car Game","nameZh":"汽车游戏","howItRuns":"Everyone dribbles to the coach's calls: start your engine (on the spot), first gear (walk), second gear (jog), top gear (sprint), reverse, red light, green light, left or right, pit stop (sprint back to the start).","source":"Mini p.17, item 9","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"所有人按教练口令运球：“发动引擎”（原地运球）、“一挡”（走）、“二挡”（慢跑）、“最高挡”（冲刺）、“倒车”、“红灯”、“绿灯”、“左转”或“右转”、“进站”（冲刺回到起点）。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Hot Ball (Taps) and Around The World Wraps","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Hot Ball (Taps) and Around The World Wraps","nameZh":"烫手球与绕身环绕","howItRuns":"Tap the ball fast from hand to hand at the waist, in front of the face and overhead. Then wrap it around the waist, head and knees, ten times each way.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/1/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/1/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球在两手之间快速来回拨动，分别在腰前、面前和头顶做。然后让球绕腰、绕头、绕膝盖环绕，每个方向各10次。"},{"key":"U6|routine|Follow the Leader","age":"U6","block":"routine","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Follow the Leader","nameZh":"跟着领头人","howItRuns":"Players line up behind a leader, a ball each, and copy the leader's action. The leader changes action every 5 to 15 seconds and hands over after one minute.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员每人一球，在领头人身后排成一路纵队，模仿领头人的动作。领头人每5到15秒换一个动作，1分钟后换人当领头人。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Pac Man","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Pac Man","nameZh":"吃豆人","howItRuns":"A tag game in which taggers and runners may move only along the court lines.","source":"Mini p.12, Body Orientation item 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"捉人游戏，捉人者和逃跑者都只能沿着球场上的线移动。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Tiger Tail","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Tiger Tail","nameZh":"老虎尾巴","howItRuns":"Every player tucks a ribbon into the back of the shorts and tries to take other players' ribbons. On the whistle everyone freezes, and anyone who moves gives the tails they have collected to the nearest player. A lost tail can be replaced with one collected. Most ribbons wins. Add dribbling to make it harder.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 9","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名队员把一条彩带塞在短裤后腰当尾巴，设法抢别人的彩带。哨声一响所有人定住，谁动了就要把自己抢到的尾巴交给离他最近的队员。自己的尾巴被抢走后，可以用抢到的一条补上。彩带最多者获胜。加难：加入运球。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Tail Game","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Tail Game","nameZh":"尾巴游戏","howItRuns":"Every child has a ball and a ribbon tail and dribbles inside a marked area. One child with no tail tries to grab tails for a set time. The player who grabs the most tails wins.","source":"Mini p.17, item 10","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个小朋友一个球、一条彩带尾巴，在划定区域内运球。一名没有尾巴的小朋友在规定时间内设法抓尾巴。抓到尾巴最多的队员获胜。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Dribble Tag","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Dribble Tag","nameZh":"运球捉人","howItRuns":"Three or four taggers dribble and chase the other players for a set time. Next step: everyone dribbles.","source":"Mini p.17, item 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"运球贴标签","howItRunsZh":"三到四名捉人者运球，在规定时间内追捉其他队员。进阶：所有人都运球。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|1-2-3 Stop","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"1-2-3 Stop","nameZh":"一二三木头人","howItRuns":"One player at half court faces away and calls \"1-2-3 Stop\" while the others dribble in from the baseline. On \"Stop\" the caller turns, and anyone seen moving goes back to the baseline. First to half court wins.","source":"Mini p.19, item 17","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"1-2-3停","howItRunsZh":"一名队员站在半场处背对大家，喊“1-2-3停”，其他人从底线向前运球。喊到“停”时，喊口令的人转身，被看到还在动的人退回底线。最先到达半场者获胜。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Wolf and Sheep","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Wolf and Sheep","nameZh":"狼与羊游戏","howItRuns":"Everyone has a ball. On \"the wolf isn't here\" the sheep leave the key and dribble anywhere. On \"here comes the wolf\" the wolf may tag any sheep outside a key. Tagged sheep become wolves.","source":"Mini p.19, item 16","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球。喊“狼不在”时，羊离开限制区，在场上任意运球。喊“狼来了”时，狼可以去抓任何不在限制区内的羊。被抓到的羊变成狼。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Fisherman","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Fisherman","nameZh":"渔夫游戏","howItRuns":"The fish dribble from one baseline to the other past a fisherman at half court. Anyone tagged becomes a fisherman.","source":"Mini p.19, item 14","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"小鱼从一条底线运球到另一条底线，要穿过站在半场的渔夫。被抓到的人变成渔夫。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Four Corners","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Four Corners","nameZh":"四角落游戏","howItRuns":"Four players stand at the corners of a half court and one in the middle. On \"go\" the corner players move to the next corner while the middle player tries to get to one first. FIBA allows running in place of dribbling.","source":"Mini p.18, item 13","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四名队员分站半场的四个角，一名站在中间。喊“开始”时，四角的队员移动到下一个角，中间的队员设法抢先占到一个角。FIBA允许用跑代替运球。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|NBA Tag Game","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"NBA Tag Game","nameZh":"NBA捉人游戏","howItRuns":"Players each pick one of two or three team names. The coach stands in the middle and calls a team, and that team runs to the far baseline without being tagged. Tagged players sit or kneel where they were tagged. Next step: everyone dribbles.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名队员从两三个队名中选一个。教练站在中间喊一个队名，该队队员跑向对面底线，途中不能被抓到。被抓到的队员在被抓的位置坐下或跪下。进阶：所有人都运球。"},{"key":"U6|smallGames|Transfer the Treasure","age":"U6","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Transfer the Treasure","nameZh":"搬运宝藏","howItRuns":"A coach at half court faces away, with cones around them as treasure. Players dribble out from the baseline, take a cone and dribble it back. If the coach turns and sees a player moving toward the treasure, the coach may chase and tag them; a tagged player loses the cone. First to three cones wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一名教练站在半场处背对队员，身边摆一圈标志桶当宝藏。队员从底线运球出发，拿一个标志桶并运球带回。如果教练转身看到有队员正朝宝藏移动，可以追捉；被抓到的队员要交出标志桶。最先拿到3个标志桶者获胜。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Target throw","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Target throw","nameZh":"投准练习","howItRuns":"Throw balls of different sizes into bins, hoops and baskets at different heights, at marks on a wall, or to knock down pins.","source":"Mini p.21, items 1, 3 and 4","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"把大小不同的球投进不同高度的桶、圈和篮筐，或投向墙上的标记，或用球击倒球瓶。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Throw up to a target","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Throw up to a target","nameZh":"向上投准","howItRuns":"Sitting on the floor, throw into a bin placed on a bench, so the ball has to travel upward.","source":"Mini p.21, \"Vary the Target\"","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"坐在地上，把球投进放在长凳上的桶里，让球必须向上飞。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Every touch scores","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Every touch scores","nameZh":"碰到就得分","howItRuns":"Free shooting in which hitting the ring, net or backboard also counts. Team version: 2 points for a basket, 1 for the ring, half a point for the backboard; first team to a set score wins.","source":"Mini p.21, items 2 and 6","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"自由投篮，球碰到篮筐、篮网或篮板也算。团队版：投进得2分，碰篮筐得1分，碰篮板得0.5分；最先达到规定分数的队获胜。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Stop on the signal","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Stop on the signal","nameZh":"听信号急停","howItRuns":"Run and stop at once on a signal. Then the same while dribbling. Then stop and stand on one foot.","source":"Mini p.13, Balance items 5 and 8","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"跑动中听到信号立即停住。然后在运球中做同样练习。再改为停住后单脚站立。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Jump Stop Game","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Jump Stop Game","nameZh":"跳步急停游戏","howItRuns":"Coach's arm up means go; arm down means jump stop. A player who is late or off balance takes three steps back. First across the court wins. Next step: with a ball.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/1/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/1/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练手臂举起表示出发，手臂放下表示跳步急停。停晚了或没站稳的队员后退三步。最先穿过球场者获胜。进阶：带球进行。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Partner swaps","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Partner swaps","nameZh":"搭档换球","howItRuns":"Pairs sit face to face with a ball each and swap balls by rolling, bouncing and throwing.","source":"Mini p.14, Coordination item 21","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组面对面坐下，每人一球，用滚球、击地和抛球的方式互换球。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Clap before the catch","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Clap before the catch","nameZh":"拍手再接球","howItRuns":"In pairs, A passes to B, and B must clap before catching.","source":"Mini p.14, Coordination item 25","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，A传球给B，B必须先拍手再接球。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Knock the coin","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Knock the coin","nameZh":"击硬币","howItRuns":"Pairs bounce-pass to each other, trying to knock a coin on the floor toward the partner.","source":"Mini p.14, Coordination item 18","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组互相击地传球，设法用球把地上的硬币打向搭档那边。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Lay-up footwork","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"ballMovement","group":null,"kind":"activity","name":"Lay-up footwork","nameZh":"上篮脚步","howItRuns":"Players jump to high-five the coach. Then, from the block, they take one step with the foot away from the baseline and jump at the basket. Then add a ball: a tennis ball or a size 3 for young children. Use both sides and more than one basket so nobody waits long.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员跳起与教练击掌。然后从低位卡位点出发，用远离底线的那只脚迈一步，朝篮筐起跳。再加上球：年龄小的用网球或3号球。两侧都练，并使用多个篮筐，避免有人长时间等待。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Touch game","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"games","group":"Compete","kind":"game","name":"Touch game","nameZh":"触碰游戏","howItRuns":"Pairs with a ball each dribble and try to touch the partner's ball, knee or back. Most touches in a set time wins.","source":"Mini p.13, Coordination item 4; p.16, Speed item 3","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，每人一球，边运球边设法碰到对方的球、膝盖或后背。规定时间内碰到次数最多者获胜。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Dribble races","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"games","group":"Compete","kind":"game","name":"Dribble races","nameZh":"运球赛跑","howItRuns":"Race dribbling over 15 to 20 metres, in and out of cones, or as a relay.","source":"Mini p.15, Endurance items 1–3","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"运球竞速：15到20米直线、绕标志桶穿行，或以接力形式进行。"},{"key":"U6|compete|Crocodile","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"games","group":"Compete","kind":"game","name":"Crocodile","nameZh":"鳄鱼游戏","howItRuns":"Players shoot from a spot close to the basket. A miss sends the shooter to the baseline. Each make rescues one player from there. If everyone ends up on the baseline, the crocodile wins.","source":"Mini p.22, item 9; Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员在离篮筐较近的一个点投篮。投失的人去底线站。每投进一球，可以从底线救回一名队员。如果所有人都到了底线，鳄鱼获胜。"},{"key":"U6|compete|All Together to the Basket","age":"U6","block":"compete","type":"games","group":"Compete","kind":"game","name":"All Together to the Basket","nameZh":"全体投篮","howItRuns":"Two teams stand back to back at half way, a ball each. On the signal everyone dribbles to the basket they face and shoots, with up to three tries, then dribbles back. Most makes wins.","source":"Mini p.23, item 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队在中线背对背站好，每人一球。信号一响，所有人运球冲向自己面对的篮筐投篮，最多投三次，然后运球返回。投进最多的队获胜。"},{"key":"U6|game|Hoop Ball","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Hoop Ball","nameZh":"圈中接球","howItRuns":"Two small teams, 3 to 7 a side. A teammate stands in a floor hoop at each end, and a team scores by getting the ball to that teammate. Dribbling and passing are both allowed. Change the player in the hoop often.","source":"Mini p.31","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"篮圈球","howItRunsZh":"两支小队，每队3到7人。两端地上各放一个呼啦圈，各有一名本队队员站在圈内，把球交到这名队友手中即得分。运球和传球都允许。经常更换圈内的队员。"},{"key":"U6|game|More attackers than defenders","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"More attackers than defenders","nameZh":"以多打少","howItRuns":"Uneven teams play keep-away. A team scores by making a set number of passes, or by passing the ball into the key.","source":"Mini p.16, Anticipation and Choice item 3; p.25","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"人数不等的两队进行传球护球游戏，不让对方拿到球。完成规定次数的传球，或把球传进限制区，即得分。"},{"key":"U6|game|3 on 3 across the court","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 across the court","nameZh":"横场3对3","howItRuns":"A small-sided game played across the court on side baskets, with attack and defence at both ends.","source":"Mini p.33, p.35, p.41","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"横向使用球场、在两侧边篮架上进行的小场比赛，两端都有进攻和防守。"},{"key":"U6|game|No grab","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options","kind":"rule","name":"No grab","nameZh":"不抢手中球","howItRuns":"Defenders may not take the ball out of a player's hands. They may intercept passes.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"“不抓球”规则","howItRunsZh":"防守队员不能从持球队员手中抢球，但可以抢断传球。"},{"key":"U6|game|No double team","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options","kind":"rule","name":"No double team","nameZh":"禁止包夹","howItRuns":"Only one defender may guard the player with the ball.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"“无夹击球队”","howItRunsZh":"只能由一名防守队员防守持球人。"},{"key":"U6|game|Ring, net or backboard scores","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options","kind":"rule","name":"Ring, net or backboard scores","nameZh":"碰筐、网、板都得分","howItRuns":"A shot that hits the ring, net or backboard earns points. Use it when the basket cannot be lowered.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"投篮碰到篮筐、篮网或篮板即可得分。篮架无法降低时使用。"},{"key":"U6|game|Everyone plays","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options","kind":"rule","name":"Everyone plays","nameZh":"人人上场","howItRuns":"Every player plays in each half.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名队员在上、下半场都要上场。"},{"key":"U6|game|Light whistle on travels","age":"U6","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options","kind":"rule","name":"Light whistle on travels","nameZh":"走步宽松判罚","howItRuns":"Stop play, tell the player what happened and give the ball back. FIBA writes this for U10; applying it below U10 is a judgment.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"暂停比赛，告诉队员发生了什么，然后把球还给他。FIBA这条是针对U10写的；用于U10以下是本库编者的判断。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Signal dribble","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Signal dribble","nameZh":"听口令运球","howItRuns":"Dribble in the middle of the court and respond to the coach's calls: change speed, change direction, change hand, go backwards.","source":"Mini p.17, item 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在场地中间运球，根据教练口令做出反应：变速、变向、换手、后退。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Dribble lines","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble lines","nameZh":"沿线运球","howItRuns":"Dribble along the court lines. On meeting another player, change hand, reverse or change direction.","source":"Mini p.17, item 7","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"运球线","howItRunsZh":"沿球场上的线运球。遇到其他队员时，换手、掉头或变向。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Statue Game","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Statue Game","nameZh":"雕像游戏","howItRuns":"Everyone dribbles and stops on the coach's signal, using the stop the coach names: jump stop or stride stop. A late stop or the wrong stop loses a point.","source":"Mini p.17, item 6","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"所有人运球，听到教练信号后按教练指定的方式停住：跳步急停或跨步急停。停晚了或停错的扣1分。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Stop and face","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Stop and face","nameZh":"急停转向","howItRuns":"Free dribbling. On the signal, stop and turn to face a basket, a sideline or the baseline, as called. The coach may also name the pivot foot and a forward or reverse pivot.","source":"Mini p.18, item 11","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"自由运球。听到信号后停住，按口令转向面对篮筐、边线或底线。教练也可以指定中枢脚，以及做前转身还是后转身。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Ball swap","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Ball swap","nameZh":"运球换球","howItRuns":"Everyone dribbles around the court. When two players come close, each takes over the other's ball without picking it up.","source":"Mini p.20, item 22","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"所有人在场上运球。两名队员靠近时，互相接过对方的球继续运，过程中不能把球抱起来。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Marker course","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Marker course","nameZh":"标志物路线","howItRuns":"Groups of 3 to 5 start on the baseline, with markers at both free-throw lines and at half court. At each marker the dribbler does the skill the coach has set: change hand, change speed, change direction, retreat dribble or jump stop.","source":"Mini p.20, item 24","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3到5人一组从底线出发，两条罚球线和半场处各放一个标志物。运球者在每个标志物处完成教练指定的技术：换手、变速、变向、后撤运球或跳步急停。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Dribble Chicken","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble Chicken","nameZh":"迎面运球","howItRuns":"Two players dribble straight at each other, then change hands to go past. They keep dribbling throughout and may stop moving to avoid other pairs.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两名队员面对面直线运球冲向对方，然后换手从对方身边过去。全程保持运球，为避开其他组可以停下脚步。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Copy Cat","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Copy Cat","nameZh":"影子运球","howItRuns":"Pairs. The dribbler faces the coach. The partner has their back to the coach and stays in front of the dribbler. The coach points, and the dribbler goes that way at any speed.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组。运球者面向教练，搭档背对教练，始终站在运球者正前方。教练指一个方向，运球者以任意速度朝那个方向运球。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Weak hand, two balls","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Weak hand, two balls","nameZh":"弱手与双球运球","howItRuns":"For players who are ready: dribble with the non-preferred hand, or dribble two balls alternately, standing and then moving.","source":"Mini p.5; p.13, Coordination item 5","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"适合已经准备好的队员：用非惯用手运球，或两球交替运球，先原地再行进间。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Lay-up footwork, moving","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Lay-up footwork, moving","nameZh":"行进间上篮脚步","howItRuns":"Run in from the 3-point line, take the ball from the coach at the block, take one step and jump. Next step: dribble in from the 3-point line.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 3","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"从三分线跑进来，在低位卡位点从教练手中接球，迈一步起跳。进阶：从三分线运球进来。"},{"key":"U7|routine|1-2 Step Lay-Ups","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"1-2 Step Lay-Ups","nameZh":"一步、两步上篮","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball. The shooter starts 3 to 6 feet (about 1 to 2 m) from the basket with no dribble, takes one or two steps and lays the ball off the square on the backboard. The partner rebounds. Swap after one minute.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一个球。投篮者从距篮筐约1到2米处开始，不运球，迈一步或两步，把球打在篮板小方框上投进。搭档抢篮板。1分钟后交换。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Parallel Relay Race","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Parallel Relay Race","nameZh":"并行接力赛","howItRuns":"Three or four small teams on the baseline. The first player dribbles to the far basket, stops and shoots, with up to three shots. They rebound, return and high-five the next player. The shot can be off a jump stop or a lay-up. Most baskets in a set time wins.","source":"Mini p.24, item 6","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三到四个小队站在底线。第一名队员运球到对面篮筐，停下投篮，最多投三次。自己抢篮板，返回后与下一名队员击掌。可以跳步急停后投篮，也可以上篮。规定时间内投进最多的队获胜。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Pair Shooting","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Pair Shooting","nameZh":"结对投篮","howItRuns":"One player shoots; the partner rebounds and passes the ball out. Three shots, then swap. Pairs can race to a set score.","source":"Mini p.29, item 8","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一人投篮，搭档抢篮板并把球传出来。投三次后交换。各组可以比赛谁先达到规定分数。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Around the World","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Around the World","nameZh":"环游世界游戏","howItRuns":"The coach sets 6 to 10 spots inside the players' range. Players shoot in turn. A make moves the shooter to the next spot; a miss passes the turn to the next player. After three misses at one spot the shooter moves on anyway. First to make one from every spot wins. Give every player a ball to cut waiting.","source":"Mini p.22, item 11; Start Coaching, Plan 3","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练在队员投篮范围内设6到10个投篮点。队员轮流投篮。投进就移到下一个点；投失就轮到下一名队员。在同一个点投失三次后，也照样移到下一个点。最先在每个点都投进一球者获胜。每人一球可以减少等待。"},{"key":"U7|routine|Pick Your Shot","age":"U7","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Pick Your Shot","nameZh":"选点投篮","howItRuns":"Cones mark shooting spots, some close and a few farther out. Teams line up at half court, and one player at a time dribbles to a cone and shoots. A make wins that cone for the team. Most cones wins. If makes are rare, move the cones closer or count hitting the rim.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/1/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/1/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用标志桶标出投篮点，有的近，少数几个远一些。各队在半场排队，每次一人运球到一个标志桶处投篮。投进就为本队赢下这个标志桶。赢得标志桶最多的队获胜。如果很少投进，就把标志桶移近，或改为碰到篮筐也算。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|Dribble Gang","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Dribble Gang","nameZh":"运球越捉越多","howItRuns":"Dribble tag in which a tagged player joins the taggers.","source":"Mini p.17, item 4","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"运球连连转","howItRunsZh":"运球捉人游戏，被抓到的队员加入捉人者一方。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|Dog and Hare Game","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Dog and Hare Game","nameZh":"小狗与野兔游戏","howItRuns":"Two teams, a ball each. The dogs start in the centre circle and the hares anywhere on court. On \"go\" the dogs dribble and try to touch hares; a hare who is touched stops and sits. Most touches in a set time wins.","source":"Mini p.18, item 12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，每人一球。小狗队从中圈出发，野兔队在场上任意位置。喊“开始”后，小狗运球去碰野兔；被碰到的野兔停下坐好。规定时间内碰到次数最多者获胜。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|Four Corners, dribbling","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Four Corners, dribbling","nameZh":"四角落游戏（运球版）","howItRuns":"As on the U6 and under tab, with the corner players sprint-dribbling to the next corner.","source":"Mini p.18, item 13","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"四角落游戏","howItRunsZh":"玩法同“U6及以下”页，四角的队员改为快速运球冲到下一个角。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|Relay Race with Pins","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Relay Race with Pins","nameZh":"推倒球瓶接力","howItRuns":"Two teams, one ball each. The first player dribbles with one hand and knocks down the pins along the path with the other, then dribbles back. The next player dribbles and stands the pins up again, and so on.","source":"Mini p.20, item 20","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"标杆接力赛","howItRunsZh":"两队，每队一个球。第一名队员单手运球，用另一只手推倒路线上的球瓶，然后运球返回。下一名队员运球过去，把球瓶重新立起来，依此轮流进行。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|Swipers Game","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Swipers Game","nameZh":"拍球手游戏","howItRuns":"Two teams. One team dribbles. When the coach calls \"Swipers\", the other team tries to knock balls away. No contact: swipers touch only the ball. A player who loses the ball holds it overhead until a teammate rolls a ball between their legs. Two minutes, then swap.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队。一队运球。教练喊“拍球手”时，另一队设法把球拍掉。不许身体接触：拍球手只能碰球。球被拍掉的队员把球举过头顶，直到有队友把一个球从他两腿之间滚过去才能继续。2分钟后两队交换。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|20 Passes","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"20 Passes","nameZh":"传球20次","howItRuns":"Two teams, a ball each. After each pass the passer runs to a sideline. First team to 20 passes wins, and a dropped pass costs one point. FIBA's manual runs the same game with a rule against passing straight back, and with questions between rounds (Mini p.8).","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，每队一个球。每次传球后，传球人要跑到边线。最先完成20次传球的队获胜，传球掉地扣1分。FIBA手册中也有同样的游戏，另加不许直接回传给传球人的规则，并在每轮之间向队员提问（Mini 第8页）。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|20 Passes, Keeping Off","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"20 Passes, Keeping Off","nameZh":"传球20次（有抢断）","howItRuns":"One ball. The team without it tries to intercept passes and may not take the ball out of a player's hands. Each defender guards one player. A team that wins the ball starts its own count to 20. In Start Coaching the count resets to zero if the ball hits the floor.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 3; Mini p.9","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"只用一个球。无球一方设法抢断传球，但不能从持球队员手中抢球。每名防守队员盯一名队员。抢到球的队从零开始数自己的20次。在Start Coaching中，球一落地，计数就归零。"},{"key":"U7|smallGames|4x3 Pass Tag","age":"U7","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"4x3 Pass Tag","nameZh":"三抓四传球捉人","howItRuns":"Three taggers pass one ball among themselves and try to touch one of the four runners with the ball held in the hands, never thrown. Start Coaching adds that taggers may pivot but not travel; FIBA's manual lets the coach allow dribbling. Runners stay inside a marked area such as the 3-point line. Count the tags in a set time, then change taggers. Jr. NBA's team version has a video ([Rookie Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/)).","source":"Mini p.32; Start Coaching, Plan 7","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"4x3传球贴便签","howItRunsZh":"三名捉人者互相传一个球，设法用拿在手里的球碰到四名逃跑者中的一人，球绝不能扔出去碰人。Start Coaching补充：捉人者可以做转身，但不能走步；FIBA手册允许教练准许运球。逃跑者须留在划定区域内，例如三分线以内。规定时间内统计捉到的次数，然后更换捉人者。Jr. NBA的团队版有视频（[Jr. NBA Rookie 第6课](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/6/)）。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Pairs Passing","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"Pairs Passing","nameZh":"结对传球","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball. The receiver steps away, cuts back and catches with the stop the coach names, jump or stride. They pivot to face the basket, then pivot back and pass. The English manual misprints the name as \"Paris Passing\".","source":"Mini p.25, item 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一个球。接球人先向外走开，再切回来，按教练指定的方式急停接球：跳步急停或跨步急停。转身面向篮筐，再转回来传球。英文版手册把名称误印成了“Paris Passing”。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Dribble, stop, pivot, pass","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble, stop, pivot, pass","nameZh":"运球-急停-转身-传球","howItRuns":"Relay. Dribble to a set point, jump stop, pivot and pass back to the line, then jog back.","source":"Mini p.28, item 5","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"接力形式。运球到指定点，跳步急停，转身后把球传回本队队伍，然后慢跑回去。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Dribble, Pivot, Pass","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble, Pivot, Pass","nameZh":"运球转身传球（有防守）","howItRuns":"Groups of at least four. The first player dribbles out and jump stops. The second runs behind them and defends the pass back to the line. The passer uses fakes and pivots and does not throw high over the top.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"至少四人一组。第一名队员运球出去后跳步急停。第二名队员跑到他身后，防守他回传给队伍的球。传球人利用假动作和转身摆脱，不能从防守人头顶高吊传球。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Defender in the middle","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Defender in the middle","nameZh":"中间有防守","howItRuns":"Two players pass with a defender between them. Then groups of three and five with one or two defenders.","source":"Mini p.16, Anticipation and Choice item 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人传球，中间站一名防守队员。然后改为三人组和五人组，配一到两名防守队员。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Timed passing","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Timed passing","nameZh":"限时传球","howItRuns":"Teams of 2 to 5 count their passes in a set time, first with no defence and then against a defending team. Players stop as they catch.","source":"Mini p.15, Endurance item 6","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每队2到5人，在规定时间内数传球次数，先无防守，再对抗一支防守队。队员接球时要停住。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Defend the Circles","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1","kind":"activity","name":"Defend the Circles","nameZh":"守护圆圈","howItRuns":"An attacker and a defender start in a corner. The attacker has 10 seconds to dribble into the no-charge circle, the free-throw circle or the centre circle. The defender wins by keeping them out and does not need to take the ball.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 4","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一名进攻队员和一名防守队员从底角出发。进攻队员有10秒时间，运球进入无撞人半圆区、罚球圈或中圈。防守队员只要不让他进去就算赢，不需要把球抢下来。"},{"key":"U7|compete|\"GO\"","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1","kind":"activity","name":"\"GO\"","nameZh":"“冲！”","howItRuns":"An attacker and a defender pass the ball to each other while moving across the court. At any moment the attacker can go and drive to the basket. The defender tries to keep them out of the key.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 7","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一名进攻队员和一名防守队员横穿球场，边移动边互相传球。进攻队员随时可以突然启动，突破冲向篮筐。防守队员设法不让他进入限制区。"},{"key":"U7|compete|1 on 1 from every spot","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1","kind":"activity","name":"1 on 1 from every spot","nameZh":"各位置1对1","howItRuns":"FIBA lists 1 on 1 games from all positions on the court and gives no further detail.","source":"Mini p.16, Anticipation and Choice item 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"FIBA列出了从球场各个位置开始的1对1游戏，没有给出更多细节。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Signal shots","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and finishing contests","kind":"activity","name":"Signal shots","nameZh":"听信号投篮","howItRuns":"Stand with the back to the basket and pivot to shoot on the signal. Or start with the ball on the floor, pick it up and shoot on the signal.","source":"Mini p.22, items 13–14","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"背对篮筐站立，听到信号转身投篮。或者先把球放在地上，听到信号捡起球投篮。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Dribbling and Shooting Relay Race","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and finishing contests","kind":"activity","name":"Dribbling and Shooting Relay Race","nameZh":"运球和投篮接力赛","howItRuns":"Two groups. The first player dribbles toward the basket, stops and shoots, with up to three tries, then returns. Most baskets in a set time wins.","source":"Mini p.23, item 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分两组。第一名队员运球向篮筐，停下投篮，最多投三次，然后返回。规定时间内投进最多的组获胜。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Dribble Slalom Relay Races","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and finishing contests","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble Slalom Relay Races","nameZh":"绕桶运球接力赛","howItRuns":"Teams start at half way, dribble around cones and shoot. Most baskets in a set time, or first to a set score. In Start Coaching the players change hands at each cone and finish with a lay-up.","source":"Mini p.23, item 4; Start Coaching, Plan 6","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"弯道运球接力赛","howItRunsZh":"各队从中线出发，绕标志桶运球后投篮。比规定时间内谁投进最多，或谁先达到规定分数。在Start Coaching中，队员在每个标志桶处换手，最后以上篮结束。"},{"key":"U7|compete|Swish Lay-up","age":"U7","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and finishing contests","kind":"activity","name":"Swish Lay-up","nameZh":"擦板不碰筐上篮","howItRuns":"The team tries to make lay-ups in a row that go in off the backboard without touching the ring. FIBA's target is 10. Players jump up at the basket, not forward toward the baseline.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 4","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全队设法连续上篮命中，球要擦板入筐、不碰篮筐。FIBA的目标是连续10个。队员向上朝篮筐起跳，而不是向前冲向底线。"},{"key":"U7|game|Munnsy Hoops","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Munnsy Hoops","nameZh":"三圈传球赛","howItRuns":"Teams of 3 to 5 and three floor hoops. A team scores by passing to a teammate standing in any hoop, and nobody may stand in a hoop for more than 2 seconds. The scoring team keeps the ball. The defence wins it only by intercepting a pass or stealing from a dribbler.","source":"Mini p.31","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"Munnsy（穆尼西）篮圈","howItRunsZh":"每队3到5人，地上放三个呼啦圈。把球传给站在任一圈内的队友即得分，任何人在圈内停留不得超过2秒。得分队继续控球。防守方只能通过抢断传球或抢断运球者的球来获得球权。"},{"key":"U7|game|5 Point Passing","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 Point Passing","nameZh":"5分传球","howItRuns":"Two equal teams. Each completed pass earns 1 point, and a pass to the teammate in the marked 5-point zone earns 5. Defenders try to intercept; after an interception the passing team gets the ball back. Play for a set time and rotate the player in the zone.","source":"Mini p.32","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"人数相等的两队。每完成一次传球得1分，传给站在划定5分区内的队友得5分。防守方设法抢断；抢断后，球交还传球一方。按规定时间进行，并轮换5分区内的队员。"},{"key":"U7|game|Pass and Win","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Pass and Win","nameZh":"传球制胜","howItRuns":"Equal teams. One team starts in the centre circle and scores by passing to a teammate inside the no-charge circle. Dribbling in does not score. Each defender stays with one player and may intercept passes but not take the ball from a player's hands.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"人数相等的两队。一队从中圈出发，把球传给站在无撞人半圆区内的队友即得分。运球进去不算得分。每名防守队员盯一人，可以抢断传球，但不能从持球人手中抢球。"},{"key":"U7|game|Tallyball Touchdown","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Tallyball Touchdown","nameZh":"计数达阵","howItRuns":"Equal teams. A team must make 6 passes and then pass to a teammate in the key to score a point. The count resets if the ball touches the floor.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 3","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"人数相等的两队。一队必须先完成6次传球，再传给限制区内的队友，才得1分。球一落地，计数归零。"},{"key":"U7|game|5 Possessions","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 Possessions","nameZh":"5个回合","howItRuns":"Equal teams. The offence earns 1 point for getting the ball into the key and 2 points for a made shot from inside the key. After five possessions the teams swap. Each defender stays with one player, and the coach may limit dribbles.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"人数相等的两队。进攻方把球送进限制区得1分，在限制区内投篮命中得2分。五个回合后两队攻守交换。每名防守队员盯一人，教练可以限制运球次数。"},{"key":"U7|game|3 on 3 or 4 on 4 across the court","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 or 4 on 4 across the court","nameZh":"横场3对3或4对4","howItRuns":"As on the U6 and under tab. With four a side the passes are shorter. With only a half court, FIBA's stand-in for transition is that every player touches half way after each change of possession before rejoining play.","source":"Mini p.41, p.44","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"玩法同“U6及以下”页。每队四人时传球距离更短。如果只有半场，FIBA用来替代攻防转换的做法是：每次球权转换后，所有队员都要先摸一下中线，再回来参与比赛。"},{"key":"U7|game|Pass before a shot","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U7","kind":"rule","name":"Pass before a shot","nameZh":"投篮前传球","howItRuns":"The team must make 1 to 3 passes before it may shoot.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"“投篮前传球”","howItRunsZh":"全队必须先完成1到3次传球才能投篮。"},{"key":"U7|game|Points for a pass","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U7","kind":"rule","name":"Points for a pass","nameZh":"传球得分","howItRuns":"1 point for a pass to a player in the key, or 1 point when a shot follows a catch.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"“传球得分”","howItRunsZh":"传给限制区内的队员得1分，或接球后投篮得1分。"},{"key":"U7|game|Inside counts more","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U7","kind":"rule","name":"Inside counts more","nameZh":"限制区内分更高","howItRuns":"A shot from inside the key is worth 3 points and from outside it 2.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在限制区内投篮命中得3分，限制区外得2分。"},{"key":"U7|game|Limit dribbles","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U7","kind":"rule","name":"Limit dribbles","nameZh":"限制运球次数","howItRuns":"Restrict the number of dribbles to push passing.","source":"FIBA Dos and Don'ts","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"限制运球次数，促使队员多传球。"},{"key":"U7|game|Ball into the key first","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U7","kind":"rule","name":"Ball into the key first","nameZh":"先进限制区再投","howItRuns":"No shot is allowed until the ball has gone into the key.","source":"FIBA Dos and Don'ts","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球进入过限制区之后才允许投篮。"},{"key":"U7|game|No zone defence","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U7","kind":"rule","name":"No zone defence","nameZh":"禁止区域防守","howItRuns":"Player-to-player defence only. FIBA, the NBA with USA Basketball, and China's rules all say this for young players.","source":"Mini p.34; Sources and checks tab","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"只能人盯人防守。FIBA、NBA与USA Basketball，以及中国的规则，都对低龄队员作此规定。"},{"key":"U7|game|Travel leeway","age":"U7","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U7","kind":"rule","name":"Travel leeway","nameZh":"走步与两次运球放宽","howItRuns":"The 2018 China Mini-Basketball League U8 rules allowed 3 to 4 steps and 1 to 2 double dribbles outside the key. Beyond that the referee called the violation, explained it to the player and gave the ball to the other team. Inside the key the normal rules applied.","source":"Sources and checks tab","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"2018年中国小篮球联赛U8规则：在限制区外允许走3到4步，允许出现1到2次两次运球。超出这个限度，裁判判违例，向队员解释，并把球判给对方。在限制区内按正常规则执行。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Low, Middle, High Dribble","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Low, Middle, High Dribble","nameZh":"低、中、高运球","howItRuns":"A ball each, starting on the sideline. Dribble low with the right hand for 20 seconds, eyes up, the left arm protecting the ball, then with the left hand. Repeat at middle height, then high (about shoulder level). The coach holds up fingers and players call out the number. Next step: partners face each other and one mirrors a leader who changes hand and height to \"lose\" them. Competitive version: partners shoulder to shoulder on opposite sides of a line, both dribbling with the outside hand, try to get two feet over the line.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/), 7","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，从边线出发。右手低运球20秒，抬头看前方，左臂护球；再换左手。然后中等高度重复，再高运球（约与肩同高）。教练举起手指，队员喊出数字。进阶：两人一组面对面，一人做领做者，不断换手、换高度，想“甩掉”对方，另一人照做跟上。比赛版：两人肩并肩分站一条线的两侧，都用外侧手运球，努力把双脚都挤过这条线。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Stationary Crossover Low, Middle, High","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Stationary Crossover Low, Middle, High","nameZh":"原地体前变向（低中高）","howItRuns":"Knees bent, swing the ball side to side low and quick below the knees for 20 seconds, then at knee level for 20 seconds, then higher for 20 seconds. Next step: a partner mirrors a leader who changes level; then add 1, 2 or 3 dribbles before each crossover.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/); Starter Plan 1","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"屈膝，在膝盖以下低而快地左右来回拨球（体前变向）20秒，再在膝盖高度做20秒，然后再高一些做20秒。进阶：两人一组，一人领做并变换高度，搭档照做；之后每次体前变向前先加1次、2次或3次运球。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Dribble Balance","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble Balance","nameZh":"单脚平衡运球","howItRuns":"Stand on the right leg, knee slightly bent, and dribble with the right hand; then the left leg and left hand. 3 x 20 seconds each leg. Next step: a partner balancing on one leg leads changes of height and hand, and the other mirrors.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"右腿单脚站立，膝盖微屈，用右手运球；再换左腿站立、左手运球。每条腿3组×20秒。进阶：两人一组，一人单脚平衡站立领做，变换运球高度和换手，另一人照做。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Cone Dribbling","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Cone Dribbling","nameZh":"绕桶运球","howItRuns":"Even lines, five cones in a straight line from sideline to sideline for each line. Zig-zag through the cones, switching hands at each change of direction, and stop past the last cone. The next player starts when the one ahead is halfway. Then come back the other way. Next step: one or two players stand in place of cones as defenders; or run it as a relay.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/), 10; Starter Plan 1","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分成人数相等的几路纵队，每路前方从边线到边线直线摆放5个标志桶。队员蛇形绕桶运球，每次变向时换手，绕过最后一个标志桶后停住。前一名队员运到一半时，下一名出发。然后按原路反方向运回来。进阶：让一两名队员代替标志桶站位当防守人；或改成接力比赛。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Two balls","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Two balls","nameZh":"两球交换","howItRuns":"In pairs with two balls, swap balls on the coach's signal, first by handing over, then by taking over the dribble. Then both partners dribble two balls each and swap on the signal. Next step: one player dribbles 4 balls.","source":"Mini p.13, Coordination items 7, 8","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组共两个球，听教练信号交换球：先用手递给对方，再改为直接接过对方的运球继续运。然后两人各运两个球，听信号交换。进阶：一名队员同时运4个球。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Forward and back in pairs","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Forward and back in pairs","nameZh":"两人前进后退运球","howItRuns":"Pairs with a ball each. A dribbles forward while B dribbles backward, and they change on the coach's signal. The coach uses a spoken signal sometimes and a visual one at other times, so players keep their heads up. Next step: A picks any direction and B goes the opposite way.","source":"Mini p.14, Coordination item 14","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，每人一球。A向前运球，B向后退运球，听教练信号交换方向。教练有时用口令、有时用手势信号，让队员始终抬头。进阶：A任选方向运球，B朝相反方向运。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Lay-Up High Five Drill","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Lay-Up High Five Drill","nameZh":"上篮击掌练习","howItRuns":"One line, no ball. The coach shows a right-hand lay-up: step with the right foot, second step, jump off the left foot, extend the right hand. Each player does the two steps saying \"1, 2\" and high-fives the coach's raised hand. Then the left side with the opposite footwork. 3 minutes each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"排成一路纵队，不用球。教练示范右手上篮：右脚迈第一步，再迈第二步，左脚起跳，右手向上伸展。每名队员边走两步边喊“1、2”，然后跳起与教练举起的手击掌。再练左侧，脚步相反。每侧3分钟。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Lay-Up Skips Drill","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Lay-Up Skips Drill","nameZh":"上篮垫步跳","howItRuns":"Everyone on the baseline moves together on the coach's \"1, 2, jump\"; the coach says which foot steps first. Jumping off one foot, players reach up with the opposite hand. Down and back twice.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全体站在底线，听教练喊“1、2、跳”一起做；教练指定先迈哪只脚。单脚起跳，同时用异侧手向上够。往返两次。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Perfect Shot No Basket Drill","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Perfect Shot No Basket Drill","nameZh":"无篮完美投篮","howItRuns":"No basket. Knees bent, elbow under the ball, shoot up and hold the follow-through. A perfect shot goes up, bounces in front and comes back into the hand without the hand moving. First to two perfect shots wins; 3 x 8 attempts. Harder: a dribble move, or a squat, push-up or sideline run, before each shot.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/); Starter Plan 7","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"不用篮筐。屈膝，肘关节在球的正下方，向上投出并保持跟随动作。完美的一投：球向上飞出，落在身前弹起，回到手里，手不用移动。先完成两次完美投篮者获胜；3组×8次。加难：每次投篮前先做一个运球动作，或做一次深蹲、一个俯卧撑或跑一趟边线。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Block to Block Shooting Drill","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Block to Block Shooting Drill","nameZh":"篮下左右点投篮","howItRuns":"Partners at a basket. The shooter shoots from one block, runs to the other block and gets the ball back from the rebounder. 30 seconds, then switch. Partners count makes to beat their last score. Aim for the square on the backboard.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 11](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/11/), 6; Starter Plan 8","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/11/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组在一个篮下。投篮者在一侧低位卡位点（篮下两侧小方块）投篮，然后跑到另一侧卡位点，接抢篮板搭档传回的球再投。30秒后交换。两人一起数投进个数，争取超过上次成绩。瞄准篮板小方框打板。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Self-Toss Rebound Drill","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Self-Toss Rebound Drill","nameZh":"自抛自抢篮板","howItRuns":"Three lines at each basket. Toss the ball up with two hands, move to it, jump and catch it at its highest point, land, take one shot, rebound and return to the line. 3 x 8. Competitive version: no balls; the coach shoots off the backboard, the first three in line go for the rebound and the winner gets an unguarded shot.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/), 7","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个篮下排三路纵队。双手把球向上抛，移动到球的落点，跳起在最高点接球，落地后投篮一次，抢下篮板后回到队尾。3组×8次。比赛版：不发球；教练投篮打板，每队排头的三名队员争抢篮板，抢到者获得一次无人防守的投篮。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Shooting Line Game","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Shooting Line Game","nameZh":"分组投篮赛","howItRuns":"Each line at a shooting spot is a team. Shoot once, get your own rebound, pass to the next player and go to the back. First team to the set number of makes (the plan uses 8) wins, then lines change spots. Variation: spell a word, one letter per make.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个投篮点的一路纵队为一队。投篮一次，自己抢篮板，传给下一名队员后到队尾。最先投进规定个数（教案中为8个）的队获胜，然后各队交换投篮点。变化：拼一个单词，每投进一球得一个字母。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Run to That Line","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Run to That Line","nameZh":"跑到那条线","howItRuns":"The coach walks the court with the players, naming spaces such as half court, the 3-point line and the sideline, and players repeat each name. The coach then calls a movement and a line, for example \"High knees to the baseline!\", for five lines. Movements: forward, backward or lateral march or skip, high knees, quick feet, and actions from other sports such as swimming arms or skating. Next step: players choose their own movements, or move as a chain of partners holding hands.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练带着队员绕球场走一圈，说出各个区域的名称，如半场、三分线、边线，队员跟着复述。然后教练喊出一个动作和一条线，例如“高抬腿到底线！”，共喊五条线。动作包括：向前、向后或侧向的踏步走或垫步跳、高抬腿、快速小碎步，以及其他运动的动作，如游泳划臂、滑冰。进阶：让队员自选动作，或两人手拉手连成一串移动。"},{"key":"U8|routine|March, High Knees, Quick Feet","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"March, High Knees, Quick Feet","nameZh":"踏步、高抬腿、快速步","howItRuns":"The movements used in Run to That Line. March: walk with high knees, toes pulled up and arms at 90 degrees, then add backward and lateral marching. High knees: drive the knee up with the foot flexed, alternating legs, elbows at 90 degrees. Quick feet (also listed as Side Push): in an athletic stance, move sideways by pushing off the back foot, the left foot to go right; push rather than step or pull.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"这是“跑到那条线”中用到的动作。踏步走：高抬膝走，脚尖勾起，手臂弯成90度；再加入后退踏步和侧向踏步。高抬腿：膝盖用力上提，脚尖勾起，两腿交替，肘关节保持90度。快速步（也称侧推步）：保持准备姿势，靠后脚蹬地向侧面移动，向右移动时用左脚蹬；是“蹬”出去，不是迈步或拖步。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Smacks","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"More dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Smacks","nameZh":"拍球","howItRuns":"Each player holds a ball in front with both hands and smacks it with each hand in turn for 20 seconds, to get comfortable with the ball and with contact on it.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人双手在身前持球，左右手轮流用力拍球20秒，熟悉球性、适应手与球的接触。"},{"key":"U8|routine|One Hand Moving Rolls","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"More dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"One Hand Moving Rolls","nameZh":"单手推滚球行进","howItRuns":"Start on the baseline in a good stance with the ball on the floor and one hand behind it. Walk to half court rolling the ball with the hand kept on it, then turn and come back the same way. Repeat with the other hand.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"从底线出发，保持良好的准备姿势，球放在地上，一只手放在球的后面。手不离球，推着球滚动走到半场，然后转身用同样方法返回。再换另一只手。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Dribbling in a Linear Path","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"More dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Dribbling in a Linear Path","nameZh":"直线运球","howItRuns":"Each player starts in triple threat with the ball at waist level on the shooting-hand side and walks in a straight line, dribbling with the shooting hand slightly behind the top of the ball. Painted floor lines help keep players straight. Heads stay up: players call out the number of fingers the coach holds up at the far end. The ball stays at or below the waist and is not slapped. Next step: walk, then jog, then sprint.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.47","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名队员从三威胁姿势开始，球在投篮手一侧、腰的高度，沿直线行进运球，投篮手放在球顶部稍偏后的位置。可以沿着地板上的场地线走，帮助保持直线。始终抬头：教练在另一端举起手指，队员喊出数字。球保持在腰部或以下，不要拍打球。进阶：先走，再慢跑，再冲刺。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Two balls backwards, figure 8","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"More dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Two balls backwards, figure 8","nameZh":"双球倒退运球与8字运球","howItRuns":"Walk backwards dribbling two balls, then run. Players keep \"chin to shoulder\" to see behind them, or work in pairs with the partner walking forwards and making sure the dribbler does not run into anything. Figure 8: dribble a figure 8 with the legs apart, then dribble figure 8s in pairs.","source":"Mini p.13, Coordination items 6, 9, 10","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"运两个球向后倒退走，然后倒退跑。队员保持“下巴贴肩”，以便看到身后；也可以两人一组，搭档面向前走，确保运球者不撞到东西。8字运球：两腿分开，在两腿间做8字运球；然后两人一组做8字运球。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Form shooting progression","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"More shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Form shooting progression","nameZh":"基础投篮分步练习","howItRuns":"Four stages, each first with the shooting hand only and then with the guide hand on the side of the ball. On one knee (the knee opposite the shooting hand), raise the ball to shoulder level, pause to check form and shoot it up to oneself. Standing, add the legs by rising onto the balls of the feet without jumping. Against a wall from about five feet (1.5 m), aiming at an exact spot. On a hoop, which can be lower at first, with the middle finger last to touch the ball. Good mechanics matter more than makes.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.68–75","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"共四个阶段，每个阶段先只用投篮手，再加上辅助手扶在球的侧面。单膝跪地（投篮手异侧的膝盖着地），把球举到肩的高度，停顿检查动作，然后向上投给自己。站立：加上腿部动作，脚掌发力踮起，但不跳起。对墙：在约1.5米处，瞄准墙上一个确定的点投。对篮筐：开始时篮筐可以调低，出手时中指最后离球。动作规范比投进更重要。"},{"key":"U8|routine|1-Step Form Drill","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"More shooting","kind":"activity","name":"1-Step Form Drill","nameZh":"一步投篮脚步练习","howItRuns":"Two lines face each other across the lane. The first player pushes off the foot nearer half court to cover as much of the lane as possible, lands on the leg nearer the basket and swings the outside leg round into a shooting stance, arms as if holding a ball. They join the opposite line, whose first player goes next. After a minute, each push finishes with a jump as if shooting, landing on the same spot with the follow-through held up. Next step: toss a ball to the player crossing, and add the shot if appropriate.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两路纵队隔着限制区面对面站。排头队员用靠近半场一侧的脚蹬地，尽量跨过限制区更远的距离，用靠近篮筐一侧的腿落地，外侧腿顺势转过来，成投篮站姿，双手做持球姿势。然后排到对面队尾，由对面排头接着做。一分钟后，每次蹬跨后加一个投篮式起跳，落回原地，保持跟随手型。进阶：给横跨过来的队员抛一个球，合适时加上投篮。"},{"key":"U8|routine|Between-the-legs and ankle-lift shots","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"More shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Between-the-legs and ankle-lift shots","nameZh":"胯下拍球投篮与脚夹球投篮","howItRuns":"Players face the basket, a ball each. On the coach's signal they either bounce the ball from behind them between the legs, catch it and shoot; or, holding the ball between the ankles, jump to lift it into the air, catch it and shoot. For the ankle lift, catch after one bounce at first, then before the ball touches the floor.","source":"Mini p.22, items 15 and 17","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员面向篮筐，每人一球。听教练信号，做其中一种：从身后把球经胯下向前击地，接住后投篮；或者用两脚踝夹住球，跳起把球带到空中，接住后投篮。脚夹球时，开始可以等球弹地一次再接，之后要在球落地前接住。"},{"key":"U8|routine|FIFA 11+ Kids","age":"U8","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Injury-prevention warm-up (option)","kind":"activity","name":"FIFA 11+ Kids","nameZh":"FIFA 11+ Kids 防伤热身","howItRuns":"About 15 minutes, replacing the usual warm-up, one ball per player. Seven exercises in order: running game (stop on a call or a signal), skating jumps, single-leg stand with ball throws, push-up, single-leg jumps, \"Spiderman\" (its levels include tapping the ball with a foot, crawling and dribbling) and side rolls (falling technique). Each exercise has 5 levels: start at level 1, do not skip levels, and move up when all players can do it correctly. In a trial with 3,895 football players aged 7–12, teams asked to use it at least twice a week had an overall injury rate about half that of control teams (hazard ratio 0.52). It was designed for football, not basketball.","source":"[Rössler 2018](https://doi.org/10.1007/s40279-017-0834-8), coach manual in supplementary file 1","sourceUrl":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40279-017-0834-8","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"约15分钟，替代平时的热身，每人一球。按顺序做七个练习：跑动游戏（听口令或看信号停住）、滑冰跳、单腿站立抛接球、俯卧撑、单腿跳、“蜘蛛侠”（各级别包括用脚点球、爬行和运球）和侧滚（倒地保护技术）。每个练习分5个级别：从第1级开始，不要跳级，所有队员都能正确完成后再升一级。在一项针对3,895名7–12岁足球运动员的试验中，被要求每周至少使用两次的球队，总体受伤率约为对照组的一半（风险比0.52）。该方案是为足球设计的，并非为篮球设计。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Skip Tag","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Skip Tag","nameZh":"垫步跳捉人","howItRuns":"Inside set boundaries such as half court. One player or the coach is \"it\". Everyone, the tagger included, may only skip. At each tag play pauses, and the tagged player also becomes \"it\" and helps tag. Next step: everyone dribbles while skipping, or runs if the coach prefers.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在划定的范围内进行，如半场。一名队员或教练当捉人者。所有人，包括捉人者，都只能垫步跳移动。每抓到一人暂停一下，被抓到的人也变成捉人者，一起去抓。进阶：所有人边垫步跳边运球；或教练也可以改为跑动。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Freeze Tag","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Freeze Tag","nameZh":"冰冻捉人","howItRuns":"Inside set boundaries such as half court, one player or the coach is \"it\". A tagged player freezes until an unfrozen player touches them. The game ends when everyone is frozen; add taggers if needed. Two minutes. Next step: everyone except the taggers dribbles a ball. Competitive version: two teams; one team freezes the other as fast as possible, then roles switch, and the faster time wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在划定的范围内进行，如半场，一名队员或教练当捉人者。被抓到的人定住，直到没被定住的队员碰一下才能解冻。所有人都被定住时游戏结束；需要时增加捉人者。时间两分钟。进阶：除捉人者外，所有人都运球。比赛版：分两队；一队尽快把另一队全部定住，然后交换角色，用时短的一队获胜。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Robbers and Police (Räuber und Polizei)","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Robbers and Police (Räuber und Polizei)","nameZh":"警察抓小偷","howItRuns":"The robbers have a ball each; the police have none. Police touch robbers. A touched robber becomes a prisoner and stands still with arms out until a robber slaps their hand. Police score 1 point per touch and robbers 1 point per freed prisoner. Then swap roles.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2011/02/Basketball_1_Dribbeln_1_d.pdf) Lesson 1","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2011/02/Basketball_1_Dribbeln_1_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"“小偷”每人一球，“警察”没有球。警察去碰小偷。被碰到的小偷成为“囚犯”，原地站住、张开双臂，直到有小偷拍一下他的手才能解救。警察每碰到一人得1分，小偷每解救一名囚犯得1分。然后交换角色。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Lions and Tigers","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Lions and Tigers","nameZh":"狮子和老虎","howItRuns":"Pairs of similar speed face each other 3 metres apart in the middle of the court, one ball per pair; one side are lions, the other tigers. On \"Lions\", the tigers chase and try to tag the lions, and tagged players go back to their starting spots. The coach can call \"right foot\", \"left foot\" or \"two feet\" for a balanced stop, then \"Go\". Keep a safety line well away from the wall. Next step: on \"change\", chasers and chased swap roles; side shuffles or skips; dribbling with either hand. Competitive version: 1 point per tag, then rotate to new partners.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"速度相近的两人一组，在球场中间相距3米面对面站，每组一个球；一边是“狮子”，另一边是“老虎”。教练喊“狮子”时，老虎追赶并设法抓狮子，被抓到的人回到起始位置。教练可以喊“右脚”“左脚”或“双脚”，让队员平稳急停，再喊“跑”。在离墙足够远的地方设一条安全线。进阶：喊“换”时，追的和被追的交换角色；改用侧滑步或垫步跳；用任意一只手运球进行。比赛版：每抓到一次得1分，然后轮换搭档。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Snake Dribbling","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Snake Dribbling","nameZh":"贪吃蛇运球","howItRuns":"Everyone dribbles inside the 3-point arc. One player, the snake, starts without a ball. On \"Go\" the snake tags dribblers. A tagged player joins the snake by holding its shoulder with one hand and tags with the free hand. The snake grows until one player is left.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"所有人在三分线内运球。一名队员当“蛇”，开始时没有球。喊“开始”后，蛇去抓运球的人。被抓到的人一只手搭在蛇的肩上，连成蛇身，用另一只空着的手去抓人。蛇越来越长，直到只剩最后一名队员。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Four Corners, tag version","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Four Corners, tag version","nameZh":"四角落游戏（捉人版）","howItRuns":"As on the U6 and under tab, but the middle player tries to tag a player before they reach a corner. A tagged player stops where they are until another corner player touches them; then both dribble to the corner. It works best with at least 9 players.","source":"Mini p.19, item 15","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"玩法同“U6及以下”页的“四角落游戏”，但中间的队员要在别人跑到角之前抓住他们。被抓到的人原地停住，直到另一名在角上的队员过来碰他一下；然后两人一起运球到角。至少9人时效果最好。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Mascot Tag","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Mascot Tag","nameZh":"吉祥物捉人","howItRuns":"A half court is split by a line of cones from baseline to half court, and the sidelines are the goal lines. Two teams, every player with a ball, each named after the NBA mascot it thinks is fastest, line up at the cones facing each other. The coach tells a made-up story; when it names a team's mascot, that team dribbles back to its sideline while the other team chases to tag. One point per tag, and players keep their own score. Reset at the cones for a new story.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 11](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/11/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/11/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用一排标志桶从底线到半场线把半场一分为二，两侧边线是各自的安全线。分两队，每人一球，每队以自己认为跑得最快的NBA吉祥物命名，在标志桶两侧面对面站好。教练讲一个编出来的故事；故事里说到哪队的吉祥物，那一队就运球跑回自己的边线，另一队追上去抓。每抓到一人得1分，队员各自记分。每讲一个新故事前，回到标志桶处重新站好。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Coach, What Time Is It?","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Coach, What Time Is It?","nameZh":"教练教练几点了","howItRuns":"Players start on one baseline; the coach stands near the far baseline, facing away. Players call together \"Coach, Coach, what time is it?\" The coach answers with a number from 1 to 12 (\"10 o'clock!\") and players take that many big steps forward. On \"Game time!\" the coach may turn and tag, and players run back to their baseline to be safe; anyone caught joins the coach. Next step: everyone dribbles a ball for each step, and on \"Layup time!\" all dribble to a hoop and try a lay-up before being tagged.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员站在一侧底线；教练站在另一侧底线附近，背对队员。队员一起喊：“教练，教练，几点了？”教练回答1到12中的一个数字（如“10点！”），队员就向前迈相应数量的大步。教练喊“比赛时间到！”时可以转身抓人，队员跑回自己的底线就安全了；被抓到的人加入教练一方。进阶：每迈一步都运一次球；教练喊“上篮时间到！”时，所有人运球到篮下，在被抓到之前尝试上篮。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Dribble Chaos","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Dribble Chaos","nameZh":"运球大乱斗","howItRuns":"Two players from each team start in the key, each with a ball. They dribble and try to knock opponents' balls out of the key. A player whose ball is knocked out, or who double dribbles, steps out and a teammate takes the ball into the key. Players outside may knock at opponents' balls but may not step into the key. Dribblers keep their heads up and push the ball hard.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 3","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每队两名队员各持一球在限制区内开始。边运球边设法把对手的球打出限制区。球被打出限制区或两次运球的队员出局，由一名队友持球进入限制区接替。场外队员可以去打对手的球，但不能踏进限制区。运球队员要抬头，用力按拍球。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Up or Down Game","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Up or Down Game","nameZh":"立桶倒桶","howItRuns":"Two teams, \"Up\" and \"Down\", a ball each. Cones are spread around the gym, as many standing up as face down, with at least one cone per player. Everyone dribbles around; Team Up stands cones up and Team Down turns them face down, using only their hands. Players keep moving and may not guard cones. At the end of the time, count the cones to find the winner. Next step: a set dribble move before turning a cone, such as 5 crossovers in a row; after a mistake the player goes to a different cone. Competitive version: all players against the coaches.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/), 4, 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分为“立”队和“倒”队，每人一球。在场馆内分散摆放标志桶，立着的和倒扣的各一半，标志桶总数至少每人一个。所有人运球移动；“立”队把标志桶立起来，“倒”队把标志桶倒扣，只能用手。队员要一直移动，不能守着标志桶。时间到后数标志桶决定胜负。进阶：翻动标志桶前先完成指定的运球动作，如连续5次体前变向；出现失误要换一个标志桶。比赛版：全体队员对抗教练。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Capture the Cones Game","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Capture the Cones Game","nameZh":"抢标志桶","howItRuns":"Four teams, one in each corner, every player dribbling a ball. Players take cones from the other corners and bring them back to their own; they may not guard their own corner. Coaches move around and tag players carrying cones, and a tagged player returns the cone where it came from. Players dribble at all times and should go for diagonal cones. After 4 minutes the team with the most cones wins. Next step: dribble with the right hand going to a cone and the left hand bringing it back.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分四队，各占一个角，每人运一个球。队员从其他角拿标志桶带回自己的角；不能守着自己的角。教练在场内走动，去抓拿着标志桶的队员，被抓到的人要把标志桶送回原处。队员必须一直运球，应该去拿对角的标志桶。4分钟后，标志桶最多的队获胜。进阶：去拿标志桶时用右手运球，带回时用左手运球。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Tic-Tac-Toe Dribbling Game","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Tic-Tac-Toe Dribbling Game","nameZh":"运球井字棋","howItRuns":"Two teams, X and O, line up on opposite sides of a tic-tac-toe board made with cones, hoops or tape in the middle. On \"Go\" the first player in each line dribbles to the board, stands in any square, passes the ball back to their line and makes an X or an O with their arms. The next players do the same. First team with three in a row wins; after a tie, play again.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分为X队和O队，排在场地中间井字棋盘的两侧，棋盘用标志桶、呼啦圈或胶带摆成。喊“开始”后，每队排头运球到棋盘，站进任意一格，把球传回本队，并用手臂摆出X或O。下一名队员接着做。最先连成三个一线的队获胜；平局则再玩一次。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|The Ball Carts (Die Ballwagen)","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"The Ball Carts (Die Ballwagen)","nameZh":"运球进球车","howItRuns":"Two teams and two ball carts, with balls of different sizes. Each player takes a ball and dribbles it into the other team's cart. The first team with an empty cart wins.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-4_d.pdf) Lesson 4","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-4_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分两队，有两辆球车，车里放着大小不同的球。每名队员拿一个球，运球放进对方的球车。最先把自己的球车清空的队获胜。"},{"key":"U8|smallGames|Over/Under Relay","age":"U8","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Over/Under Relay","nameZh":"上下传球接力","howItRuns":"Even groups on the baseline. The first player dribbles three times with the right hand, then passes back over the head or under the legs. Each next player does the same, passing the opposite way from how they got the ball. The last player runs to the front and the group repeats with the left hand; done when the ball reaches the last player a second time. FIBA's version: roll the ball between the teammates' legs, and the last player dribbles it to the front; first team whose starting player is back at the front wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/); Mini p.25, item 5","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"人数相等的几组站在底线。排头右手运球三次，然后从头上或胯下把球传给身后的人。后面每名队员照做，传球方式与自己接球的方式相反（从头上接到就从胯下传，反之亦然）。最后一名队员拿球跑到最前面，全组换左手重复；球第二次传到最后一名队员时完成。FIBA的版本：把球从队友们的胯下滚过去，最后一名队员拿球运到最前面；最先让原来的排头回到最前面的队获胜。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Dribble starts","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble starts","nameZh":"多姿势起步运球","howItRuns":"Start the dribble from different positions: standing, sitting, kneeling, lying on the back or on the tummy.","source":"Mini p.16, Speed item 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"从不同姿势开始运球：站立、坐地、跪姿、仰卧或俯卧。"},{"key":"U8|compete|First dribble record","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"First dribble record","nameZh":"运球纪录挑战","howItRuns":"Each player with a ball dribbles a set number of times, then catches the ball in triple threat. The coach counts successful repetitions, and players try to beat their own record. Controlled dribbling, no slapping. Next step: later in the level, the non-dominant hand, using the finger pads and keeping the ball at or below the waist.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.45–47","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，运球规定次数后，以三威胁姿势接住球。教练记录成功次数，球员努力打破自己的纪录。运球要有控制，不要拍球。进阶：在本阶段后期，改用非惯用手，用指腹控球，球保持在腰部或以下高度。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Dribble Balance Push","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble Balance Push","nameZh":"单脚平衡推进运球","howItRuns":"Even lines, a ball each. The first player stands on the right leg, knee slightly bent, dribbling with the right hand. On \"go\" they push forward, switch to the left hand and dribble to the foul line, where they stop on the left foot and dribble left-handed until the next \"go\". Then they push off again, switching hands, and so on to half court, the far foul line and the far baseline. The next group starts when the first reaches the foul line.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分成人数相等的几路纵队，每人一球。第一名球员右腿单脚站立，膝盖微屈，右手运球。听到“走”后向前推进，换左手运球到罚球线，在罚球线左脚单脚站定，左手运球，等待下一声“走”。然后再次推进、换手，依次推进到半场、对面罚球线和对面底线。第一组到达罚球线时，下一组出发。"},{"key":"U8|compete|5-5-5 Creative Dribble","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"5-5-5 Creative Dribble","nameZh":"5-5-5创意运球","howItRuns":"Each player has a ball in open space. Dribble with the right hand for 5 seconds, the left hand for 5 seconds, then any way they like for 5 seconds; repeat for a minute. Next step: dribble around the court and, on the whistle, race to find a partner and do the 5-5-5 together. Competitive version: a relay in which partners on the sideline both dribble to the far sideline, do the 5-5-5 and dribble back; the first pair finished wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，在空地上散开。右手运球5秒，左手运球5秒，再自由运球5秒；循环1分钟。进阶：在场上运球，听到哨声后迅速找到一名搭档，两人一起做5-5-5。比赛版：接力形式，两人一组从边线一起运球到对面边线，完成5-5-5后运球返回；最先完成的一组获胜。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Relay past standing opponents","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Relay past standing opponents","nameZh":"运球过人接力","howItRuns":"Teams race from one end of the court to the other. Opponents stand on the court, and each dribbler gets past them with dribble moves and finishes with a lay-up. The standing players must stay still but may try to knock the ball away. The next player starts once the dribbler crosses half way.","source":"Mini p.29, item 10","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"各队从球场一端比赛到另一端。对手站在场上，运球者用运球动作越过他们，最后上篮。站着的球员必须原地不动，但可以尝试把球拍掉。运球者过半场后，下一名球员出发。"},{"key":"U8|compete|1.2.3. Triple Threat","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Triple threat, stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"1.2.3. Triple Threat","nameZh":"1、2、3，三威胁！","howItRuns":"Everyone dribbles around the half court. When the coach says \"1, 2, 3!\", players answer \"Triple Threat!\" and drop into a triple-threat stance. On \"Go!\" they dribble on. Next step: dribble with the off hand or crossover while moving; in the stance, \"rip\" the ball left to right, low below the knees or high above the head.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"所有人在半场内运球。教练喊“1、2、3！”，球员回答“三威胁！”并迅速做出三威胁姿势。听到“走！”后继续运球。进阶：移动中用非惯用手运球或做体前变向；在三威胁姿势时，把球从左到右“扫球”，低扫在膝盖以下，或高扫举过头顶。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Forward Pivot Basic; Reverse Pivot Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Triple threat, stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"Forward Pivot Basic; Reverse Pivot Drill","nameZh":"前转身与后转身练习","howItRuns":"Each player holds a ball in a good stance on the baseline. On the coach's \"Pivot!\", players pivot on the left foot in quarter steps; after 4 pivots they face forward again. Relax, then repeat with the right foot as the pivot foot. Forward Pivot Basic uses forward quarter steps and the Reverse Pivot Drill reverse quarter steps.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/), 7","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人持球，在底线上保持良好的准备姿势。教练喊“转身！”，球员以左脚为中枢脚，每次转四分之一圈；转4次后重新面向前方。放松，然后换右脚作中枢脚重复。前转身基础练习每次向前转四分之一圈，后转身练习每次向后转四分之一圈。"},{"key":"U8|compete|The Locomotive (Die Lokomotive)","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Triple threat, stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"The Locomotive (Die Lokomotive)","nameZh":"火车头","howItRuns":"Every player has a ball. Odd numbers are locomotives and even numbers are wagons. On the signal the locomotives dribble freely and the wagons follow, dribbling. On a signal everyone jump stops; on the next, everyone starts again. Then swap roles.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-4_d.pdf) Lesson 4","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-4_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球。单号球员当火车头，双号球员当车厢。信号发出后，火车头自由运球，车厢运球跟随。听到信号，所有人跳步急停；再听到信号，所有人重新出发。然后交换角色。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Under the arms, pivot, pass","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Triple threat, stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"Under the arms, pivot, pass","nameZh":"钻臂·转身·传球","howItRuns":"Pairs 3 to 4 metres apart. One player stands still with legs apart and arms stretched out. On the coach's signal the partner dribbles under the arms, circles the player and dribbles back to the start, then stops, pivots (forward and reverse) and passes to the standing player, who then does the same.","source":"Mini p.28, item 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，相距3–4米。一人原地站立，双腿分开，双臂伸展。教练发出信号后，搭档运球从其手臂下钻过，绕该球员一圈后运球回到起点，然后停下，转身（前转身和后转身），传球给站立的球员；之后由站立的球员做同样的练习。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Corner Passing","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Triple threat, stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"Corner Passing","nameZh":"角落传球","howItRuns":"Teams line up at the four corners of a half court, one ball per corner. On the signal the first player dribbles to the half circle, stops, turns, passes to the next player in the line and runs back. Most passes in a set time wins. Next step: pass to the next corner's line and run to that line; pivot left or right, forward or back; pass with either hand. In Start Coaching (Dribble and Pass), players dribble to the free-throw line, jump stop, pivot forward or reverse as the coach calls, pass to the next line and join it.","source":"Mini p.28, item 6; p.29, item 7; Start Coaching, Plan 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"各队分别在半场的四个角排队，每个角一个球。信号发出后，第一名球员运球到半圆处，停下，转身，传球给本队下一名球员，然后跑回队伍。规定时间内传球次数最多的队获胜。进阶：传给下一个角的队伍，并跑到该队排队；向左或向右、向前或向后转身；左右手都可以传球。Start Coaching（运球与传球）中的做法：球员运球到罚球线，跳步急停，按教练口令做前转身或后转身，传球给下一队并排到该队后面。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Red Light","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"footwork","group":"Triple threat, stops and pivots","kind":"activity","name":"Red Light","nameZh":"红绿灯","howItRuns":"Players start on one baseline with a ball each; the coach faces them from the far baseline. \"Green light\": dribble and jog or run toward the coach. \"Yellow light\": walk while dribbling. \"Orange light\": walk backward while dribbling. \"Red light\": a quick jump stop into triple threat. Anyone the coach sees still moving after \"Red light\" goes back to the baseline. The first player to reach the coach wins and leads the next round.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/), 8","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球员每人一球，站在一侧底线；教练在对面底线面向他们。“绿灯”：运球慢跑或快跑向教练。“黄灯”：边运球边走。“橙灯”：边运球边倒退走。“红灯”：迅速跳步急停，成三威胁姿势。“红灯”后被教练看到仍在移动的球员退回底线。最先到达教练处的球员获胜，并主持下一轮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Stationary Wall Passing – Chest","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing and catching","kind":"activity","name":"Stationary Wall Passing – Chest","nameZh":"原地对墙胸前传球","howItRuns":"Each player stands a short distance from a wall with a target on it. Step toward the target with the lead foot, snap the thumbs down and extend the arms; let the ball bounce, catch it and repeat, 3 sets of 10 passes. Next step: dribble before passing, change the distance, or hit whichever target the coach or a partner calls. USA Basketball's Catch Own Pass Off Wall starts with a two-hand bounce pass, then a chest pass, catching with the hands in a \"W\" behind the ball.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/); [USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.59–60","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人站在离墙不远处，墙上贴有目标。前脚向目标迈步，拇指向下翻压，手臂伸直；让球弹回落地一次后接住，重复，3组×10次传球。进阶：传球前先运球，改变距离，或击中教练或搭档喊出的目标。USA Basketball的“对墙自传自接”先做双手击地传球，再做胸前传球，接球时双手在球后呈“W”形。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Make the Connection Game","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing and catching","kind":"activity","name":"Make the Connection Game","nameZh":"连线传球","howItRuns":"Groups of 4 or 5. All but one have a ball and dribble in place. The connector, without a ball, moves to each player in turn, shows hands and calls that player's name; the player makes a bounce or chest pass to the connector, who passes it back. On \"switch\", a new connector. Next step: the connector shows hands without calling names, and players pass on eye contact; or players do 3 crossovers before passing.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"4–5人一组。除一人外每人一球，原地运球。没有球的“连线人”依次跑到每名球员面前，伸出双手并喊出该球员的名字；该球员给连线人击地传球或胸前传球，连线人再传回。听到“换”时，换一名新的连线人。进阶：连线人只伸手不喊名字，球员通过眼神交流传球；或球员先做3次体前变向再传球。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Pepper Passing","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing and catching","kind":"activity","name":"Pepper Passing","nameZh":"热身传球","howItRuns":"Players stand in a circle with a passer in the middle. The ball goes from the outside to the middle player, who passes to the next player on the outside, and so on round the circle. Teams race to get round the circle quickest. Next step: two balls passed back and forth (2 Ball Pepper Passing · 双球热身传球).","source":"Mini p.26, items 6–7","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球员站成一圈，一名传球者站在中间。球从外圈传给中间的球员，中间球员再传给外圈的下一名球员，依次绕圈。各队比赛谁最快传完一圈。进阶：两个球来回传（双球热身传球）。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Square Passing","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing and catching","kind":"activity","name":"Square Passing","nameZh":"方形传球","howItRuns":"Players stand in a square and pass the ball among themselves as quickly as possible. On the coach's signal they change direction, clockwise or counterclockwise. Next step: on the move, each passer follows the pass to join the line at the next corner.","source":"Mini p.26, item 11","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球员站成方形，尽可能快地相互传球。教练发出信号后改变传球方向，顺时针或逆时针。进阶：在移动中进行，每名传球者传球后跟着球跑到下一个角排队。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Gates Passing Game","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing and catching","kind":"activity","name":"Gates Passing Game","nameZh":"穿门传球","howItRuns":"Gates of two cones 2 to 5 feet (about 0.6 to 1.5 m) apart are spread across a half or full court, with at least as many gates as partners. Partners share a ball and start on the baseline. They dribble to any gate and throw a bounce or chest pass through it. The pair with the most passes through gates in one minute wins. Next step: dribble with only the left or right hand before passing, or use other passes such as overhead. Competitive version: first pair to 25 passes, counting out loud.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用两个标志桶组成一个“门”，桶距约0.6–1.5米，分散摆在半场或全场，门的数量至少与搭档组数相同。两人一组共用一球，从底线出发。运球到任意一个门，用击地传球或胸前传球穿过门。1分钟内穿门传球最多的一组获胜。进阶：传球前只用左手或只用右手运球，或改用其他传球方式，如头上传球。比赛版：最先完成25次传球的一组获胜，传球时大声数数。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Basketball Tennis","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing and catching","kind":"activity","name":"Basketball Tennis","nameZh":"篮球网球","howItRuns":"Rectangles about 10 by 20 feet (about 3 by 6 m), marked with cones and split in half. Two players share a ball, one on each side. They bounce pass across the middle line, trying to make a pass the opponent cannot catch after one bounce, so the opponent has to move. Scoring is like tennis: 15, 30, 40, game. Ball fakes and pivots are encouraged.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用标志桶摆出约3米×6米的长方形，中间一分为二。两人共用一球，各站一边。隔着中线击地传球，尽量传出对手在一次反弹后接不到的球，迫使对手移动。计分方式同网球：15、30、40、赢一局。鼓励使用持球假动作和转身。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Who Is Ready Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Who Is Ready Drill","nameZh":"谁准备好了","howItRuns":"Groups of 3 in a triangle with one ball. The passer faces away while the other two decide which of them will make eye contact. The passer jumps and turns, finds the player looking with hands up, takes a quick step and passes. The receiver becomes the passer. Next step: a fourth player defends one receiver, and the passer finds the one not defended; then a defender on the passer as well, with pass fakes encouraged.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一组站成三角形，一个球。传球者背对另外两人，两人商定由谁进行眼神交流。传球者跳起转身，找到举手看着自己的球员，快速跨一步传球。接球者成为新的传球者。进阶：第四名球员防守其中一名接球者，传球者要找到无人防守的那一个；然后传球者也有人防守，鼓励做传球假动作。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Partner Pass or Shoot Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Partner Pass or Shoot Drill","nameZh":"传还是投","howItRuns":"Partners about 10 feet (3 m) apart with one ball. The partner without the ball gives a cue: open hands means pass; arms down at the sides means shoot the ball to the partner as if at a basket. Next step: add a defender to each pair, who either crowds the ball handler (pass around the defence) or gives space (shoot to the partner).","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，相距约3米，一个球。无球的搭档给出信号：张开双手表示传球；双臂垂在身体两侧表示像投篮一样把球投给搭档。进阶：每组加一名防守人，防守人或者贴近持球人（绕过防守传球），或者让出空间（投给搭档）。"},{"key":"U8|compete|The Ball Thief (Der Balldieb)","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"The Ball Thief (Der Balldieb)","nameZh":"偷球贼","howItRuns":"The attackers may not move and pass among themselves. One defender tries to intercept as many passes as possible in 30 seconds, then the next defender has a turn. When everyone has defended, the trainer announces the steals, and the team with more interceptions wins. Next step: no passing back; change the numbers of attackers and defenders to suit the level.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2011/02/Basketball_3_Passen_1_d.pdf) Lesson 3","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2011/02/Basketball_3_Passen_1_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"进攻球员不能移动，相互传球。一名防守人在30秒内尽可能多地拦截传球，然后换下一名防守人。所有人都防守过后，教练公布抢断数，拦截多的队获胜。进阶：不准回传；根据水平调整进攻和防守人数。"},{"key":"U8|compete|2 on 1 Shooting Game","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 1 Shooting Game","nameZh":"2打1投篮游戏","howItRuns":"At each basket, two attackers stand at the elbows facing the basket and a defender stands under the basket with a ball. The defender passes to one elbow player and runs out to defend. The attackers stay where they are: the receiver shoots if open or passes to the other attacker, who shoots if open. After a shot or a steal, one attacker rotates to defence and two new attackers come in. Next step: the defender rolls the ball or makes low passes; move the attackers to the wing and baseline.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个篮筐处，两名进攻人站在两侧肘区面向篮筐，一名防守人持球站在篮下。防守人传球给一侧肘区的球员，然后跑出去防守。进攻人原地不动：接球者有空位就投篮，否则传给另一名进攻人，后者有空位就投篮。投篮或被抢断后，一名进攻人轮换去防守，两名新进攻人上场。进阶：防守人滚球或传低球；进攻人换到侧翼和底线位置。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Open & Decide Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Open & Decide Drill","nameZh":"空位判断","howItRuns":"Three players across the key: one on each block and one under the basket with the ball, with a defender behind the ball-handler. On \"go\" the ball-handler dribbles to the free-throw line, jump stops and pivots to face the basket. The defender guards one block player, and the ball-handler decides quickly whom to pass to for the shot. The passer becomes the shooter, the shooter the defender, and the defender goes to the back of the line. Keep a tally of makes over 3 minutes. Next step: a second defender follows the dribbler, and after the pass it is 3 on 2.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人分布在限制区：两侧低位卡位点各一人，篮下一人持球，持球人身后有一名防守人。听到“走”，持球人运球到罚球线，跳步急停，转身面向篮筐。防守人防守其中一名低位球员，持球人迅速判断传给谁投篮。传球者变投篮者，投篮者变防守人，防守人回到队尾。统计3分钟内的投进次数。进阶：第二名防守人跟随运球者，传球后形成3打2。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Keep Away Game","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Keep Away Game","nameZh":"抢球大战","howItRuns":"Groups of five: four cones in a square and a fifth to one side as a rest station. Three attackers stand at cones, so one cone is empty, with a defender in the middle. The ball may be passed only left or right, never across. Players without the ball either receive the pass or fill the empty cone. The defender has 30 seconds to steal the ball; then everyone rotates, the defender going to the rest station. Competitive version: live 2 on 2 using all four cones, with two dribbles allowed; a steal or tipped pass changes possession, and the first team to 20 passes wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"5人一组：4个标志桶摆成方形，第5个放在一侧作为休息站。三名进攻人各站一个桶，空出一个桶，一名防守人在中间。只能向左或向右传，不能对角传。无球球员要么接球，要么补到空着的桶。防守人有30秒抢球；之后所有人轮换，防守人去休息站。比赛版：用四个桶打实战2对2，允许运球两次；抢断或碰到传球即交换球权，最先完成20次传球的队获胜。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Recognizing Spots on the Floor","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Team play: spots, spacing and cutting","kind":"activity","name":"Recognizing Spots on the Floor","nameZh":"认识场上位置","howItRuns":"Five areas (baseline, wing, top of the key, low post, high post) each have a ball. Five players start on the baseline, run to an area and stand by the ball, and repeat until everyone has been to every spot. Then the coach calls spots, and players fill them, pick up the ball and get into triple threat facing the basket. Players stay on the spot, not between spots. Next step: one spot, building to all five in a row; sprint to the spot, pick up the ball and shoot; last, the coach calls a spot for the pass and the receiver shoots.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.78–79","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五个区域（底线、侧翼、弧顶、低位、高位）各放一个球。五名球员从底线出发，跑到一个区域站在球旁，重复直到每人都到过每个位置。然后教练喊出位置，球员跑去补位，捡起球，面向篮筐做三威胁姿势。球员要站在位置上，不要站在两个位置之间。进阶：先练一个位置，逐步连续练完五个；冲刺到位置，捡起球投篮；最后，教练喊出传球的位置，接球者投篮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Proper Floor and Player Awareness","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Team play: spots, spacing and cutting","kind":"activity","name":"Proper Floor and Player Awareness","nameZh":"场地与队友站位意识","howItRuns":"Start with 3 players inside the lane. On command they spread out along the half-court line, 12 feet (about 3.7 m) apart. The coach passes to one player, who passes to the properly spaced teammates. Next step: 4, then 5 players; on command players switch places with a teammate, the passer signalling with a raised hand or by calling \"change\"; air passes, then bounce passes; the coach calls a number of passes, then the player with the ball shoots.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.77–78","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"开始时3名球员站在限制区内。听到口令后沿中线散开，相互间隔约3.7米。教练传球给其中一人，该球员再传给站位间距合适的队友。进阶：增加到4人、再到5人；听口令与队友换位，由传球者举手或喊“换”示意；先空中传球，再击地传球；教练喊出传球次数，传完后持球者投篮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Spacing","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Team play: spots, spacing and cutting","kind":"activity","name":"Spacing","nameZh":"拉开空间","howItRuns":"Cones or discs are set about 12 to 15 feet (about 3.7 to 4.6 m) apart across the court. On command players sprint to a marker, then to a new marker on the next command. Variation: players in a line on the baseline each place a marker about 12 to 15 feet from the last one, then pass to the nearest teammate and then to one much farther away, to show that short passes are easier.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.80–81","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在场上摆放标志桶或标志盘，间距约3.7–4.6米。听到口令，球员冲刺到一个标志物；下一次口令时再冲向另一个新的标志物。变化：球员在底线排成一排，每人在距前一个标志物约3.7–4.6米处放一个标志物，然后先传给最近的队友，再传给远得多的队友，体会短传更容易。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Pass & Cut Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Team play: spots, spacing and cutting","kind":"activity","name":"Pass & Cut Drill","nameZh":"传球后空切","howItRuns":"One line at the top of the key with a few balls at the front, another line on the wing. The top player passes to the wing and cuts to the basket. The coach either defends the cutter or lets them cut freely. If the cutter is open, the wing passes to them; if the cutter is defended, the wing drives and shoots a lay-up.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一队排在弧顶，排头放几个球；另一队排在侧翼。弧顶球员传球给侧翼后向篮下空切。教练可以防守空切者，也可以让其自由切入。空切者有空位，侧翼就传给他；空切者被防住，侧翼就自己突破上篮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Give & Go Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Team play: spots, spacing and cutting","kind":"activity","name":"Give & Go Drill","nameZh":"传切配合上篮","howItRuns":"Players start on the 3-point line with the ball on the wing; the coach stands at the ball-side elbow. Pass to the coach, cut at once toward the basket and take the return pass for a lay-up. Use several baskets; with a second line, the coach moves elbow to elbow to feed both. Next step: the coach holds the ball at the right or left hip to show which side to cut; fake the other way first; then a defender on the cutter, and the passer fakes toward the defender before cutting off the coach.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球员站在三分线处，球在侧翼；教练站在有球侧的肘区。传球给教练，立即向篮下切入，接回传球上篮。可同时使用多个篮筐；如果有第二队，教练在两个肘区之间移动，给两边喂球。进阶：教练把球放在右髋或左髋旁，示意从哪一侧切；切入前先向反方向做假动作；然后给空切者加一名防守人，传球者先向防守人方向做假动作，再贴着教练切入。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Transition from Defense to Offense","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Team play: spots, spacing and cutting","kind":"activity","name":"Transition from Defense to Offense","nameZh":"由守转攻","howItRuns":"Five lines at one end; four cones at the top of the key at each end mark five lanes (two outside, two inside, one middle). Without a ball, the front player of each line sprints to the far baseline, staying in their lane; players rotate until everyone has run every lane. Then add balls: the middle lane dribbles and the outside lanes pass; then the middle and inside lanes pass while the outside players dribble. Last, the middle player dribbles to the top of the key while the other four run their lanes, and chooses whom to pass to.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.81","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五队排在场地一端；两端弧顶各放四个标志桶，划出五条跑道（两条外道、两条内道、一条中道）。先不持球，每队排头沿本跑道冲刺到对面底线，不离开跑道；轮换直到每人都跑过每条跑道。然后加球：中道运球，外道传球；再改为中道和内道传球，外道球员运球。最后，中道球员运球到弧顶，其余四人沿各自跑道跑，由中道球员选择传给谁。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Drive & Kick Competition Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Team play: spots, spacing and cutting","kind":"activity","name":"Drive & Kick Competition Drill","nameZh":"突破分球比赛","howItRuns":"Two lines side by side at half court on one side, with one cone on the 3-point line above the elbow and one on the 3-point line at the wing. The first two players high-five. The ball-handler dribbles to the elbow cone and goes left or right round it, while the cutter runs to the wing cone and reacts. If the ball-handler goes left, the cutter cuts to the middle of the key for a pass and lay-up; if right, the cutter cuts to the short corner for a jump shot. Players rebound and switch lines. Competitive version: two groups race to 10 made shots.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在半场一侧并排两队，一个标志桶放在肘区上方的三分线上，另一个放在侧翼的三分线上。前两名球员击掌。持球人运球到肘区上方的桶，从左侧或右侧绕过，切入者跑到侧翼的桶并根据持球人做出反应。持球人向左，切入者就切到限制区中间接球上篮；持球人向右，切入者就切到短底角接球跳投。球员抢篮板后交换队伍。比赛版：两组比赛，先投进10球者获胜。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Windows Defensive Slide Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Defence","kind":"activity","name":"Windows Defensive Slide Drill","nameZh":"守窗滑步","howItRuns":"Partners with one ball. Two cones about 6 to 8 feet (about 1.8 to 2.4 m) apart make a \"window\". One partner stands between the cones in a defensive stance; the other tries to roll the ball through the window, and the defender slides the feet sideways to stop it. Switch after 1 to 2 minutes and see who gets the most deflections. Next step: the attacker tries to dribble through the window, and the defender slides to cut them off.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一个球。两个标志桶相距约1.8–2.4米，组成一扇“窗户”。一人站在两桶之间做防守姿势；另一人尝试把球滚过窗户，防守人横向滑步拦住。1–2分钟后交换，看谁碰到的球最多。进阶：进攻人尝试运球穿过窗户，防守人滑步封堵。"},{"key":"U8|compete|One-on-One Tag Game","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Defence","kind":"activity","name":"One-on-One Tag Game","nameZh":"1对1捉人","howItRuns":"One attacker without a ball and one defender, in the space from the top of the key to the baseline between the lane lines. The attacker tries to reach the baseline between the lane lines without being touched, and the defender stays between the attacker and the basket. Next step: the coach dribbles from the top of the key to the basket while the defender stays in front in a good stance; then 2 on 2 or 3 on 3, each attacker with a ball on a spot, one attacker at a time dribbling to the basket on the coach's command while their defender stays between ball and basket.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.75–77","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一名不持球的进攻人和一名防守人，在弧顶到底线、两条限制区边线之间的区域内进行。进攻人尝试在不被碰到的情况下到达两条限制区边线之间的底线，防守人始终站在进攻人和篮筐之间。进阶：教练从弧顶运球攻向篮下，防守人以良好姿势始终挡在其前面；然后进行2对2或3对3，每名进攻人持球站在一个位置上，按教练口令每次一名进攻人运球攻向篮筐，其防守人保持在球和篮筐之间。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Tracing the Ball Breakdown Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Defence","kind":"activity","name":"Tracing the Ball Breakdown Drill","nameZh":"跟球手分解练习","howItRuns":"Groups of 3 with one ball. Two players face each other a little more than the lane width apart, one with the ball; the third starts in the middle. The third player closes out on the ball-handler, stays low, calls \"ball\" and traces the ball with the ball-side hand. The ball-handler moves the ball on one side of the body for 3 seconds, then passes, follows the pass, closes out and traces. Next step: the ball moves on both sides of the body, so the tracer switches hands; then add a pivot; then one dribble to gain a passing angle, after which the tracer uses both hands.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一组一个球。两人面对面站立，间距略大于限制区宽度，其中一人持球；第三人从中间出发。第三人扑防持球人，保持低重心，喊“球”，用有球侧的手跟随球移动。持球人在身体一侧移动球3秒，然后传球，传球后跟上去扑防并跟球。进阶：球在身体两侧移动，跟球者要换手；然后加入转身；再允许运一次球以获得传球角度，此时跟球者用双手。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Pass and Shot (Pass und Wurf)","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Pass and Shot (Pass und Wurf)","nameZh":"传球与投篮","howItRuns":"Two columns, A and B, and marker cones. Everyone has a ball except the first player in column A, who runs to a marker, takes a pass from the first player in B and shoots. The shooter rebounds and switches columns; the passer, now without a ball, runs to the other marker and the sequence repeats. Next step: vary the shooting positions; finish as a competition.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-5_d.pdf) Lesson 5","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-5_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分成A、B两路纵队，摆放标志桶。除A队第一名球员外每人一球；他跑到一个标志桶处，接B队第一名球员的传球后投篮。投篮者抢篮板后换到另一队；传球者此时手中无球，跑到另一个标志桶处，循环进行。进阶：变换投篮位置；最后以比赛形式结束。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Pass and Go (Passe et va)","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Pass and Go (Passe et va)","nameZh":"传球前进","howItRuns":"Pairs with a ball at a basket, and six chalked zones 3 steps apart. Each partner starts in one of the two zones farthest from the basket. Pass to the partner, then run to the next zone closer to the basket. Partners take turns shooting once each and repeat until the minute ends; most baskets in one minute wins. Next step: the pair plays against another pair.","source":"[FFBB Bouge au basket](https://eduscol.education.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/document/30-dactivite-physique-bouge-au-basketpdf-102369.pdf) sheet 6","sourceUrl":"https://eduscol.education.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/document/30-dactivite-physique-bouge-au-basketpdf-102369.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一个球，在一个篮筐前，用粉笔画出六个区域，每个间隔3步。两人各从离篮筐最远的两个区域之一出发。传球给搭档，然后跑到更靠近篮筐的下一个区域。两人轮流各投一次，重复直到1分钟结束；1分钟内投进最多的一组获胜。进阶：两组对抗。"},{"key":"U8|compete|1, 2, 3","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"1, 2, 3","nameZh":"1、2、3投篮","howItRuns":"A basket and three chalked zones one step apart, numbered 1 (closest) to 3. Shoot from zone 1, then 2, then 3, and repeat until the minute ends. A basket from zone 1 scores 1 point, from zone 2 scores 2 and from zone 3 scores 3; add up the points. Next step: play against an opponent on three new zones, or move the zones farther back.","source":"[FFBB Bouge au basket](https://eduscol.education.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/document/30-dactivite-physique-bouge-au-basketpdf-102369.pdf) sheet 4","sourceUrl":"https://eduscol.education.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/document/30-dactivite-physique-bouge-au-basketpdf-102369.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一个篮筐，用粉笔画出三个区域，每个间隔一步，从近到远编号1到3。依次从1区、2区、3区投篮，重复直到1分钟结束。1区投进得1分，2区得2分，3区得3分；累计得分。进阶：在三个新区域与对手比赛，或把区域往后移。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Free Throw (Lancer franc)","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Free Throw (Lancer franc)","nameZh":"罚球游戏","howItRuns":"A start zone and a shooting zone 10 steps away. Shoot twice, dribble to the line, dribble back and repeat. One basket scores 1 point and two baskets score 3. Most points after one minute wins. Next step: 1 v 1, or with a partner against another pair, the partner passing after each shot.","source":"[FFBB Bouge au basket](https://eduscol.education.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/document/30-dactivite-physique-bouge-au-basketpdf-102369.pdf) sheet 5","sourceUrl":"https://eduscol.education.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/document/30-dactivite-physique-bouge-au-basketpdf-102369.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"设一个出发区，和一个距离10步的投篮区。投篮两次，运球到线，再运球回来，重复。投进一球得1分，两球都进得3分。1分钟后得分最多者获胜。进阶：1对1，或与搭档一起对抗另一组，每次投篮后由搭档传球。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Shooting in Pairs (Wurf zu zweit)","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Shooting in Pairs (Wurf zu zweit)","nameZh":"两人投篮","howItRuns":"Pairs at the halfway line with one ball. Player 1 picks a side and shoots once, rebounds, dribbles back to the halfway line and passes to the partner, who shoots from the other side. One point per basket; first pair to 10 baskets wins.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2011/02/Basketball_2_Werfen_1_d.pdf) Lesson 2","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2011/02/Basketball_2_Werfen_1_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，在中线处共用一个球。1号球员选一侧投篮一次，抢篮板，运球回到中线，传球给搭档，搭档从另一侧投篮。投进一球得1分；最先投进10球的一组获胜。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Shooting competition","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Shooting competition","nameZh":"投篮比赛","howItRuns":"Teams shoot freely from in front of the basket. Each basket is 1 point, and the team with the most baskets in a set time wins. Next step: change the distance, shoot from either side, with or without the backboard. FIBA also lists a free-throw competition, individual or in teams.","source":"Mini p.22, items 7–8","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"各队在篮筐正前方自由投篮。投进一球得1分，规定时间内投进最多的队获胜。进阶：改变距离，从左右两侧投篮，打板或不打板。FIBA还列出了罚球比赛，可个人或分队进行。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Wrap Battle","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Wrap Battle","nameZh":"绕腰投篮对决","howItRuns":"Two teams line up side by side at the free-throw line, at as many baskets as possible; the first player in each line has a ball. The first two tap balls together, wrap the ball round the waist three times, then shoot. The first to make a shot or a put-back scores a point for the team. They pass to the next two, and play goes on for 3 minutes; most points wins. Next step: wrap round the head, one leg or the ankles; or, as an easier version, dribble in for a lay-up after wrapping.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/), 9","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队在罚球线并排排队，尽可能多用几个篮筐；每队排头持一球。前两人先互相碰球，把球绕腰三圈，然后投篮。最先投进或补篮得手者为本队得1分。之后传给下两人，持续3分钟；得分多的队获胜。进阶：改为绕头、绕单腿或绕脚踝；或降低难度，绕完后运球上篮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Make For a Cone Game","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Make For a Cone Game","nameZh":"投篮赢桶","howItRuns":"Two to four teams of at most five, each at a spot such as the wing, elbow or corner, with a line of cones beside it, one per player. The first player in each line shoots and gets the rebound. A make lets them take a cone from any other team. Make or miss, they pass to the next player in line. The team with the most cones at the end wins. Next step: shoot from the 3-point line, or start with a drive and kick to the shooter.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"2–4队，每队最多5人，各站一个位置（如侧翼、肘区或底角），旁边摆一排标志桶，每人一个。每队排头投篮并抢篮板。投进可以从任意其他队拿走一个桶。无论投进与否，都传球给本队下一名球员。最后桶最多的队获胜。进阶：从三分线投篮，或先突破分球再由投手投篮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Snatching the Basketball","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"layups","group":"Rebounding and lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Snatching the Basketball","nameZh":"高点抢球","howItRuns":"Players jump and grab the ball with both hands at full overhead extension, then pull it down hard to the chin with elbows out. Knees bend for a high jump. Next step: a standing jump, then one step and jump.","source":"[USAB Curriculum](https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf) p.63","sourceUrl":"https://cdn1.sportngin.com/attachments/document/1e20-2167909/USA_Basketball_Youth_Coaching_Guide___Part_2.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球员跳起，双臂在头顶完全伸直，双手抓球，然后用力把球拉到下巴处，肘部向外打开。屈膝以便跳得更高。进阶：先原地起跳，再上一步起跳。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Toss & Get It Drill","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"layups","group":"Rebounding and lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Toss & Get It Drill","nameZh":"抛板抢篮板","howItRuns":"Players line up in the paint, and the coach throws the ball off the backboard. The first player rebounds, chins the ball, tosses it back to the coach and goes to the end of the line. Next step: after the rebound, one shot to make a basket. FIBA's version: a player or the coach throws the ball against the backboard, and a teammate rebounds, lands and shoots.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/), 11; Mini p.22, item 18","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球员在限制区内排队，教练把球抛向篮板。第一名球员抢到篮板，把球护在下巴处，再抛回给教练，然后回到队尾。进阶：抢到篮板后投篮一次，争取投进。FIBA版本：一名球员或教练把球抛向篮板，队友抢篮板，落地后投篮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Lay-Up Bowling","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"layups","group":"Rebounding and lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Lay-Up Bowling","nameZh":"上篮保龄球","howItRuns":"Two teams on opposite baselines, each with a ball and a spare ball near its sideline, and 3 cones 2 to 3 feet (about 0.6 to 0.9 m) apart near half court, toward each team's sideline. The first player dribbles to the far end for a lay-up, rebounds, dribbles back, jump stops and passes to the next. After a make they bowl the spare ball at the cones, retrieve it and return it; after a miss they go to the back of the line. First team to knock down all 3 cones wins. Next step: the coach at half court shows 1 (lay-up) or 2 (crossover, then lay-up on the other side).","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队分别站在两端底线，每队一个球，另在本队一侧边线附近放一个备用球；在中线附近、靠各队边线一侧摆3个标志桶，间距约0.6–0.9米。第一名球员运球到对面上篮，抢篮板，运球返回，跳步急停后传给下一名球员。投进后，用备用球像打保龄球一样滚向标志桶，捡回球放回原处；投失则回到队尾。最先撞倒全部3个桶的队获胜。进阶：教练站在中线处示意1（直接上篮）或2（先体前变向，再从另一侧上篮）。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Rock, Paper, Scissors Game","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"layups","group":"Rebounding and lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Rock, Paper, Scissors Game","nameZh":"石头剪刀布","howItRuns":"Three cones on the half-court line. Two teams with balls, each in 3 lines on its baseline facing the cones. The first player in each line dribbles to meet an opponent at a cone and, still dribbling with one hand, plays rock, paper, scissors with the other. The winner pivots and dribbles to their basket for a lay-up while the other player follows to apply pressure. A made lay-up scores 1 point; first team to 10 wins. Players then join a different line. In the key, players may jump stop and shoot.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"中线上摆三个标志桶。两队都持球，各在本队底线排成3路纵队，面向标志桶。每路排头运球到标志桶处与对手相遇，一只手继续运球，用另一只手玩石头剪刀布。赢的一方转身运球攻向本队篮筐上篮，输的一方跟上施加压力。上篮投进得1分；最先得10分的队获胜。之后球员换到另一路纵队。进入限制区后，球员可以跳步急停投篮。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Chase lay-ups","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"layups","group":"Rebounding and lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Chase lay-ups","nameZh":"追逐上篮","howItRuns":"Partners with one ball. The ball handler starts at a spot such as the right wing; the partner starts about 2 strides behind at a cone. On \"Go\" the ball handler dribbles in for a lay-up and the partner runs to catch up and contest. Both go to the back of the line and switch roles. Change spots, and change the gap to suit ability. Next step: extra points for scoring in set ways, such as underhand, weak hand or off two feet; or add a second attacker and defender, so a ball handler who is cut off can pass.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一个球。持球人从某个位置出发，如右侧翼；搭档在其身后约2大步的标志桶处出发。听到“走”，持球人运球上篮，搭档追上去干扰投篮。两人都回到队尾并交换角色。变换出发位置，并根据能力调整前后距离。进阶：用指定方式得分可加分，如低手上篮、弱手上篮或双脚起跳上篮；或增加一名进攻人和一名防守人，持球人被封堵时可以传球。"},{"key":"U8|compete|Frequent Flyers","age":"U8","block":"compete","type":"layups","group":"Rebounding and lay-ups","kind":"activity","name":"Frequent Flyers","nameZh":"环球飞人","howItRuns":"About 5 cones round the perimeter, each named after a city. Attackers outnumber defenders (3:1, 4:2, 5:2 and so on). Each attacker has a ball and starts at a cone; the defenders start in the lane. Attackers dribble in and try to score in the paint while the defence tries to stop them, with one shot per drive. A make from a cone \"stamps the passport\" there, and the player then tries the cones not yet scored from; after a miss they may start from any of those. The first to score from every cone wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/), 8, 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"外围摆约5个标志桶，每个以一座城市命名。进攻人数多于防守人数（3:1、4:2、5:2等）。每名进攻人持球从一个桶出发；防守人从限制区内出发。进攻人运球突入，尝试在限制区内得分，防守方阻止，每次突破只能投一次。从某个桶出发投进即在该处“盖护照章”，之后再挑战尚未得分的桶；投失后可以从任一尚未得分的桶重新出发。最先在所有桶都得分者获胜。"},{"key":"U8|game|Points Game","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Points Game","nameZh":"传球得分赛","howItRuns":"Teams of 3 to 5, with six cones spread around the court. Passes may go only to a player at a cone or to a player in the key. A pass to a cone scores 1 point, a pass in the key 3 points, and a dribble into the key 1 point. If the defence gets the ball, it becomes the offence. Defenders must see both their opponent and the ball, and may not take the ball from a player's hands; they must intercept passes.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 2","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每队3–5人，场上分散摆放六个标志桶。只能传给站在桶旁的球员或限制区内的球员。传给桶旁球员得1分，传给限制区内球员得3分，运球进入限制区得1分。防守方得球后转为进攻。防守人必须同时看到对手和球，不能从持球人手中抢球，只能拦截传球。"},{"key":"U8|game|Into the Key","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Into the Key","nameZh":"攻入限制区","howItRuns":"Equal teams. Players pass and dribble to try to get into the key. They stay 2 to 3 metres apart, lead into the key and then move back out to the perimeter, and after a pass cut to the basket and back out. The coach can play on offence to shorten passes, and cones can mark where players may stand on the perimeter.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 1","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队人数相等。球员通过传球和运球尝试进入限制区。队员之间保持2–3米距离，切入限制区后再回到外围；传球后向篮下切入，再回到外围。教练可以参与进攻以缩短传球距离，也可以用标志桶标出外围可以站的位置。"},{"key":"U8|game|Cone Knockdown Game","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Cone Knockdown Game","nameZh":"击倒标志桶","howItRuns":"A rectangle marked with cones, or half a court, with one cone at each end; each of two teams is given one of the cones. One ball. Teams start in the middle, one on offence, which passes the ball toward its cone and scores by knocking it down with a pass. A steal or deflection changes possession. Defenders may not guard the cones, and a stuck team may pass to the coach. Play to a set score or time. Easier version: allow 2 or 3 dribbles before a pass.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用标志桶围出长方形，或用半个场地，两端各放一个桶；两队各分到一个桶。一个球。两队从中间开始，一队进攻，向本队的桶传球推进，用传球击倒桶得分。抢断或碰球即交换球权。防守人不能守桶，进攻受阻时可以传给教练。打到规定分数或规定时间。降低难度：传球前允许运球2–3次。"},{"key":"U8|game|5 Pass Knockout","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 Pass Knockout","nameZh":"连传五次","howItRuns":"Two teams of 3 to 6 in a space marked by court lines, one ball; use substitutes if teams are uneven. The offence tries to complete 5 passes, using pivots and cuts, with no dribbling. If the defence taps the ball, the ball goes out, or a travel is called, the defence picks it up and goes straight on offence. Easier version: passes off a pivot score 2 and others 1, or remove one defender. Competitive version: count how often a team reaches 5 passes; use the key or the 3-point area as the space; or require a score after the 5 passes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队各3–6人，在场地线围出的区域内进行，一个球；人数不等时安排替补。进攻方利用转身和空切，尝试完成5次传球，不准运球。如果防守方碰到球、球出界或被判走步，防守方拿球直接转为进攻。降低难度：转身后的传球得2分，其他传球得1分，或减少一名防守人。比赛版：统计一队完成5次传球的次数；用限制区或三分线以内区域作为场地；或要求完成5次传球后还要得分。"},{"key":"U8|game|Advantage Numbers Game","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Advantage Numbers Game","nameZh":"叫号多打少","howItRuns":"Two even teams on opposite sidelines, every player numbered. The coach stands at the free-throw line facing the offence, holding the ball in the hand farther from the basket. The coach calls up to 3 numbers; those attackers run out, take the ball from the coach's hand and try to score. Defenders with those numbers must first high-five the coach's empty hand. Play until a score, defensive rebound or steal, then switch. Play a set number of possessions or a set time. With an odd number of players, one player has two numbers. Next step: every attacker touches the ball before a shot.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/), 3, 4","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队人数相等，分别站在两侧边线，每人编号。教练站在罚球线面向进攻方，用离篮筐较远的那只手持球。教练最多叫3个号码；被叫到号码的进攻人跑出来，从教练手中拿球尝试得分。相同号码的防守人必须先与教练空着的手击掌。打到得分、防守篮板或抢断为止，然后攻防交换。打规定回合数或规定时间。人数为单数时，由一人担任两个号码。进阶：投篮前每名进攻人都要触球。"},{"key":"U8|game|2 on 2 Numbers Game; 3 On 3 Numbers Game","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"2 on 2 Numbers Game; 3 On 3 Numbers Game","nameZh":"2对2 / 3对3叫号","howItRuns":"Two players share each number, and everyone stands on the baseline. The coach throws the ball onto the court and calls two numbers, and those players race for the ball. The pair that gets it attacks and the other pair defends, for one possession and one shot. Mix the numbers evenly. First team to 5 points, counting by ones. In the 3 On 3 Numbers Game three players share each number; its target score is unclear in the source (3 in the heading, 5 in the text).","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个号码由两人共用，所有人站在底线。教练把球抛进场内并叫出两个号码，被叫到的球员冲去抢球。抢到球的两人进攻，另外两人防守，打一个回合、投一次篮。号码要搭配均匀。最先得5分的队获胜，每球计1分。3对3叫号游戏中每个号码由三人共用；原资料中其目标分数不明确（标题为3分，正文为5分）。"},{"key":"U8|game|Scramble Game","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Scramble Game","nameZh":"紧急补防","howItRuns":"Two even teams. Three attackers start outside the 3-point line at both wings and the top, and three defenders each match up about 6 feet (about 1.8 m) away. The coach throws to one attacker, and play is live on the catch. That attacker's defender must first run to touch the half-court line, then come back to defend, so the offence starts 3 on 2. Teams alternate: the attackers become defenders and three new attackers come in. First team to 5 baskets wins. Next step: at most 3 dribbles each time a player gets the ball.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/), 9","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队人数相等。三名进攻人站在三分线外的两侧侧翼和弧顶，三名防守人各自对位，相距约1.8米。教练传球给其中一名进攻人，接球即开始实战。该进攻人的防守人必须先跑去摸中线，再回来防守，所以进攻开始时是3打2。两队轮换：进攻人转为防守人，换三名新进攻人上场。先投进5球的队获胜。进阶：每次接球后最多运球3次。"},{"key":"U8|game|2 on 2 Surprise","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"2 on 2 Surprise","nameZh":"2对2突袭","howItRuns":"Teams of 2 or more, at several baskets. One attacker with the ball starts at the top of the key on the 3-point line, guarded. A second defender stands under the basket facing the ball, with the second attacker behind them, who cuts to an open wing for a pass. Then it is live 2 on 2, and the defender under the basket closes out on the ball. Offence and defence switch after each possession; first team to 3 wins. Competitive version: other teams wait on the baseline and rotate in on defence after a score or a stop; first to 5.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每队2人或以上，在多个篮筐进行。一名持球进攻人站在弧顶的三分线处，有人防守。第二名防守人站在篮下面向球，第二名进攻人站在他身后，向空着的侧翼切出接球。然后打实战2对2，篮下防守人扑防持球人。每回合后攻防交换；先得3分的队获胜。比赛版：其他队在底线等候，在得分或防守成功后轮换上场防守；先得5分者获胜。"},{"key":"U8|game|Coach Assisted 2 on 2 Small-Sided Game","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Coach Assisted 2 on 2 Small-Sided Game","nameZh":"教练助攻2对2","howItRuns":"The half court is split in two. On each side two attackers and two defenders line up at the wing and corner, with a coach at the elbow. The offence passes to the coach and cuts to the basket against live defence. The coach passes back to the cutter or a teammate; if not, the cutter returns outside the 3-point line. Play runs until a score or stop, or until the coach calls \"Live\" for a 2 on 2. Then the defenders attack and two new defenders come in. Competitive version: 1 point for a live 2 on 2 basket, 2 for a score off a give-and-go pass.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"半场一分为二。每侧两名进攻人和两名防守人分别站在侧翼和底角，教练站在肘区。进攻方传球给教练，在实战防守下向篮下切入。教练回传给切入者或其队友；如果没有回传，切入者回到三分线外。打到得分或防守成功为止，或直到教练喊“实战”转入2对2。然后防守人转为进攻，换两名新防守人上场。比赛版：实战2对2投进得1分，传切配合回传后得分得2分。"},{"key":"U8|game|3v3 Champions Court","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3v3 Champions Court","nameZh":"3对3擂台赛","howItRuns":"Teams of 3. One team starts on defence, and the next team waits at half court by the coach; waiting teams stand off the court passing a ball to each other. The offence high-fives the coach and attacks until it scores or the defence gets a steal or rebound. A scoring team keeps the ball, sprints back to high-five the coach and attacks again. A defence that wins the ball sprints to high-five the coach and becomes the offence. The losing team passes to the next team and goes off. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA Rookie Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/rookie/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每队3人。一队先防守，下一队在半场的教练旁等候；等候的队在场外互相传球。进攻方先与教练击掌，然后进攻，直到得分，或防守方抢断、抢到篮板。得分的队继续持球，冲刺回去与教练击掌后再次进攻。防守方得球后冲刺与教练击掌，转为进攻。输的一队把球传给下一队并下场。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U8|game|Four 6-minute quarters","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Four 6-minute quarters","nameZh":"四节×6分钟","howItRuns":"The game length used at the 2026 China U8 national finals.","source":"[China Sports Daily via Sina](https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml)","sourceUrl":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"2026年中国U8全国总决赛采用的比赛时长。"},{"key":"U8|game|Outside shots count 2","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Outside shots count 2","nameZh":"外线投篮计2分","howItRuns":"A shot from outside the 3-point line is worth 2 points, not 3. FIBA adds that it could count 1 point or nothing, to discourage these shots further.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三分线外投篮计2分，而不是3分。FIBA补充说，也可以计1分或不计分，以进一步减少这类投篮。"},{"key":"U8|game|Five passes, three points","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Five passes, three points","nameZh":"五传投进得3分","howItRuns":"A made shot after 5 passes is worth 3 points.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"完成5次传球后投进，计3分。"},{"key":"U8|game|Free throws for non-scorers","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Free throws for non-scorers","nameZh":"未得分者罚球","howItRuns":"At each quarter break, every player who has not scored takes one or two free throws, and makes count for the team.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每节间歇时，每名还没有得分的球员罚球一到两次，投进计入球队得分。"},{"key":"U8|game|Pass out after an offensive rebound","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Pass out after an offensive rebound","nameZh":"进攻篮板后先外传","howItRuns":"After an offensive rebound the ball must go to a teammate outside the key before the team can shoot.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"抢到进攻篮板后，必须先把球传给限制区外的队友，球队才能投篮。"},{"key":"U8|game|Fouled shooter","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Fouled shooter","nameZh":"投篮被犯规","howItRuns":"A fouled shooter gets 1 point, the team gets the ball at half way, and there is no free throw.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"投篮被犯规的球员得1分，球队在中线处获得球权，不罚球。"},{"key":"U8|game|Substitution options","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Substitution options","nameZh":"换人方式","howItRuns":"Two ways to get every player into each half (U6 tab): a compulsory substitution halfway through each quarter, or substitutions on the fly.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"让每名球员在每个半场都能上场的两种方式（见“U6及以下”页的“人人上场”）：每节进行到一半时强制换人，或比赛中随时换人。"},{"key":"U8|game|10-point substitution","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"10-point substitution","nameZh":"得10分换下","howItRuns":"A player who scores 10 points comes off and may come back on later.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"得到10分的球员下场，之后可以再上场。"},{"key":"U8|game|No foul-out","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"No foul-out","nameZh":"不设犯满离场","howItRuns":"Players are not removed at 5 fouls; the referee may substitute a player who is too rough.","source":"Mini p.33","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球员犯规满5次不罚下；对动作过于粗野的球员，裁判可以将其换下。"},{"key":"U8|game|Play 2 periods, sit 2","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Play 2 periods, sit 2","nameZh":"上两节、休两节","howItRuns":"Germany's mini rules: every player plays at least 2 periods and sits out 2, with substitutions only at breaks.","source":"[DBB Miniregeln](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"德国迷你篮球规则：每名球员至少上场2节、休息2节，只在节间换人。"},{"key":"U8|game|No visible score","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"No visible score","nameZh":"不显示比分","howItRuns":"Canada Basketball does not recommend a visible score at this stage, and suggests creative scoring such as a point for every completed pass.","source":"[Canada Basketball ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) p.32","sourceUrl":"https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"Canada Basketball（加拿大篮协）不建议在这一阶段显示比分，并建议采用有创意的计分方式，例如每完成一次传球得1分。"},{"key":"U8|game|No throw-in","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"No throw-in","nameZh":"不掷界外球","howItRuns":"Instead of a sideline throw-in, the player with the ball stands at mid-court and must pass without dribbling.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"不在边线掷界外球，改为持球球员站在中场，不运球直接传球。"},{"key":"U8|game|Don't guard the throw-in","age":"U8","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U8","kind":"rule","name":"Don't guard the throw-in","nameZh":"不防掷界外球","howItRuns":"The defender stands beside the thrower, not in front. Once the ball is passed, both play normally.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"防守人站在掷球者旁边，而不是正前方。球传出后，双方正常比赛。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Line Hops","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Line Hops","nameZh":"单脚跳线","howItRuns":"Four parts. 1: balance on one leg while dribbling and hop in as many directions as possible for 20 seconds, then switch legs. 2: the same on both feet. 3: in pairs, one partner calls out a letter and the other tries to spell it out by hopping on one leg. 4: in pairs, both stand on one leg while dribbling and try to push the partner off balance. The plan gives 2 x 20 seconds.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"共四部分。1：单脚站立保持平衡并运球，向尽可能多的方向跳20秒，然后换脚。2：同样的练习，改为双脚。3：两人一组，一人喊出一个字母，另一人用单脚跳“写”出这个字母。4：两人一组，双方都单脚站立并运球，设法把对方推得失去平衡。教案安排：2组×20秒。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Tuck Back Drill","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Tuck Back Drill","nameZh":"收球后撤练习","howItRuns":"Every player has a ball, or pretends to, and faces forward in triple threat. On \"tuck back!\", players say \"strong!\" while dropping the right foot and placing the ball on the right hip. On \"over!\", they step forward with the right foot while turning 90 degrees. On \"triple threat!\", they return to the triple-threat stance until the coach says relax. The plan gives 2 x 6 each way.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/), 7","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球（也可以假装持球），面向前方，成三威胁姿势。教练喊“收球后撤！”，队员喊“稳！”，同时右脚向后撤，把球收到右侧髋部。教练喊“转！”，队员右脚向前上步，同时转体90度。教练喊“三威胁！”，队员回到三威胁姿势，保持到教练喊“放松”为止。教案安排：每个方向2组×6次。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Retreat Dribble Drill","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Retreat Dribble Drill","nameZh":"后撤运球练习","howItRuns":"Players start on the baseline with a ball. They dribble with the right hand to the extended free-throw line, then take two retreat dribbles back, keeping the shoulder between an imaginary defender and the ball. They square up, dribble forward and repeat at half court, the far extended free-throw line and the far baseline. Repeat with the other hand. Next step: after the retreat, add a crossover or one between-the-legs dribble to attack the next spot. The plan gives 3 x 15 seconds.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员持球从底线出发。右手运球到罚球线延长线，然后后撤运球两次，用肩膀挡在假想防守人和球之间。重新面对前方，向前运球，并在半场、对面罚球线延长线和对面底线重复同样动作。换另一只手重复。进阶：后撤之后加一次体前变向或一次胯下运球，攻向下一个点。教案安排：3组×15秒。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Spin Dribble Drill","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Spin Dribble Drill","nameZh":"转身运球练习","howItRuns":"Every player has a ball and starts on the sideline. Take 2 dribbles with the right hand and spin to the left, then 2 dribbles with the left hand and spin back to the right. Continue down the court and back. The second dribble is a hard dribble, and the feet almost reach a jump stop at the same time as it, ready to spin. 3 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，从边线出发。右手运球2次后向左转身，再左手运球2次后向右转身回来。一路运到对面再返回。第二次运球要用力往下砸，双脚几乎同时完成跳步急停，准备转身。时长3分钟。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Change of Speed Game","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Change of Speed Game","nameZh":"变速运球游戏","howItRuns":"Partners, each with a ball, line up along the sideline with the leader in front. The leader runs, jogs or walks in a straight line to the other sideline, and the partner mirrors, staying within 2 feet (about 60 cm) of the leader. Roles switch on the way back. The plan gives 3 times down and back.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，每人一球，沿边线排开，领头的人在前面。领头者沿直线跑、慢跑或走到另一侧边线，搭档模仿他的速度，与领头者保持在约60厘米以内。返回时交换角色。教案安排：往返3次。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Face to Face (Vis-à-vis)","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"passing","group":"Passing","kind":"activity","name":"Face to Face (Vis-à-vis)","nameZh":"面对面传球","howItRuns":"Pairs stand 3 m apart with one ball and pass back and forth in the form the coach sets. Next step: chest, bounce and overhead passes; two balls, or two pass types combined; a triangle in threes; groups of 3 to 5 who follow their pass. Competitive version: count completed passes.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.9","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，相距3米，一个球，按教练指定的方式来回传球。进阶：胸前传球、击地传球、头上传球；用两个球，或把两种传球方式结合；三人一组三角传球；3至5人一组，传球后跟随球跑到接球人位置。比赛版：统计成功传球的次数。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Star Passing","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"passing","group":"Passing","kind":"activity","name":"Star Passing","nameZh":"星星传球","howItRuns":"Groups of 5 stand in a star formation. On the coach's signal they pass in a set pattern, shown in the manual's diagram. The team that makes the most passes in a set time wins. Next step, Double Star Passing · 双星传球: the players are split into two teams, each with a ball, and both teams pass at the same time.","source":"Mini p.26, items 8 and 10","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"5人一组，站成五角星队形。听到教练信号后，按固定路线传球（路线见手册中的示意图）。在规定时间内传球次数最多的队获胜。进阶——双星传球：队员分成两队，每队一个球，两队同时传球。"},{"key":"U10|routine|2 Ball Square Passing","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"passing","group":"Passing","kind":"activity","name":"2 Ball Square Passing","nameZh":"双球方形传球","howItRuns":"Players stand in a square and pass two balls in opposite directions. On the coach's signal both balls change direction.","source":"Mini p.26, item 12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员站成正方形，两个球朝相反方向传递。听到教练信号后，两个球同时改变传球方向。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Press Lay-up (Drück-Korbleger)","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Press Lay-up (Drück-Korbleger)","nameZh":"按球上篮","howItRuns":"Players spread over all the baskets. For a right-hander: press the ball to the floor while stepping with the left foot, take two ground contacts (right, left), jump off the left leg, pull the swing-leg knee up and shoot one-handed off the backboard. Teach the shot before the lay-up, and bend the knees deeply for a clear start. Next step: more advanced players learn both sides, right with the right hand and left with the left.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.7","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员分散到所有篮筐。以右手投篮者为例：左脚上步的同时把球向下按到地面（运一次球），再走两步（右、左），左脚起跳，摆动腿的膝盖向上提，单手打板投篮。先教投篮，再教上篮；起步时屈膝要深，动作开始要清楚。进阶：水平较高的队员学习两侧上篮——右侧用右手，左侧用左手。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Star Lay-up","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Star Lay-up","nameZh":"星星上篮","howItRuns":"1 dribbles and passes to 2, 2 dribbles and passes to 3, 3 dribbles and passes to 4, and 4 passes to 5, who shoots a lay-up. 6 rebounds and passes, and the activity continues. Players move to the line they passed to and call for the ball. Next step: players lead for the ball instead of dribbling. Neither text gives the start positions; FIBA's manual shows them in its p.26 diagram. The manual's version differs: 5 dribbles in for the lay-up, 2 rebounds and the shooter moves to 2's spot.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 4; Mini p.26, item 9","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"1号运球后传给2号，2号运球后传给3号，3号运球后传给4号，4号传给5号，5号上篮。6号抢篮板后传球，练习继续进行。队员传球后跑到接球的那一队，并喊着要球。进阶：队员不运球，改为摆脱接球。两份资料都没有写明起始站位，FIBA手册第26页的示意图中有标示。手册中的版本有所不同：由5号运球上篮，2号抢篮板，投篮者跑到2号的位置。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Spin Step-In Drill","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Spin Step-In Drill","nameZh":"旋转抛球上步练习","howItRuns":"One line on the baseline, each player with a ball; use several baskets. Three cones go around the paint: just above the block, in the middle of the lane and just above the opposite block. At the first cone, spin the ball out in front, step forward and land on the inside foot. Once square and balanced, repeat at the middle cone. At the third cone, plant the inside foot and shoot. The shooter rebounds and goes to the back of the line; the next player starts when the one ahead reaches the middle cone. Work in both directions.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在底线排成一路纵队，每人一球；可使用多个篮筐。在限制区周围放三个标志桶：一个在低位卡位点稍上方，一个在限制区中间，一个在对侧低位卡位点稍上方。到第一个标志桶时，把球旋转着抛到身体前方，向前上步，用内侧脚落地接球。站稳、身体正对前方并保持平衡后，在中间标志桶重复同样动作。到第三个标志桶时，内侧脚踩实后投篮。投篮者自己抢篮板，然后回到队尾；前一名队员到达中间标志桶时，下一名队员出发。两个方向都要练。"},{"key":"U10|routine|See-Through Ball (Der durchsichtige Ball)","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"See-Through Ball (Der durchsichtige Ball)","nameZh":"透明球","howItRuns":"Everyone dribbles an imaginary ball through the hall. On signal 1, players move into the shooting start position; on signal 2, they shoot and hold the finish. A further signal restarts the sequence. BASPO's cues: shooting hand on the nose, guide hand at the ear, ball at chest height; after release, the shooting hand's fingers point to the floor and the guide hand's to the ceiling. Next step: players correct themselves or each other; then use a real ball.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.6; p.2","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个人在场地内运一个想象中的球。听到第1个信号，队员摆出投篮准备姿势；听到第2个信号，做投篮动作并保持收尾姿势。再给一个信号，重新开始整个流程。BASPO的动作要点：投篮手位于鼻子前方，辅助手位于耳朵旁，球在胸口高度；出手后，投篮手手指指向地面，辅助手手指指向天花板。进阶：队员自我纠正或互相纠正；然后改用真球。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Through the Middle to the Marker (Durch die Mitte zur Markierung)","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Through the Middle to the Marker (Durch die Mitte zur Markierung)","nameZh":"穿越中圈到标志点","howItRuns":"Each player has a ball. Dribble through the centre circle, jump-stop onto a free floor marker in the shooting stance, shoot, collect the ball and dribble back through the centre circle. The coach sets one focus at a time: basic position, guide-hand fingers up, shooting-hand fingers down, backspin, high arc. Competitive version: a ring hit scores 1 point and a basket 3.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.6","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球。运球穿过中圈，用跳步急停停在一个空着的地面标志点上，成投篮姿势，投篮，拿回球，再运球穿过中圈。教练每次只强调一个重点：基本姿势、辅助手手指朝上、投篮手手指朝下、后旋、高弧线。比赛版：球碰到篮筐得1分，投进得3分。"},{"key":"U10|routine|Partner Step-In Shooting Drill","age":"U10","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Partner Step-In Shooting Drill","nameZh":"搭档上步投篮练习","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball. One player stands inside the 3-point line facing the basket in a good stance, ready to catch; the other stands under the basket with the ball and passes. The shooter takes a 1-2 step into the shot and shoots. The passer rebounds and passes again until the shooter has made 10 shots, then the players change places.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一个球。一人站在三分线内，面向篮筐，摆好姿势准备接球；另一人持球站在篮下传球。投篮者用一二步上步接球投篮。传球者抢篮板后再次传球，直到投篮者投进10个，然后两人交换位置。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|Team Tag","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Team Tag","nameZh":"团队捉人","howItRuns":"Two teams on a full or half court. The taggers hold a bib, shirt, cone or other object and try to tag players on the other team. A tagged player takes the object and becomes a tagger. Play continues until the coach whistles or calls time, and the players without a bib at the end win. Next step: everyone dribbles. Or every player holds a partner's hand throughout.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/), 9","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，在全场或半场进行。捉人者手持一件号码背心、一件衣服、一个标志桶或其他物品，去抓对方队员。被抓到的队员接过这件物品，成为新的捉人者。游戏持续到教练吹哨或喊停为止，结束时手上没有背心的队员获胜。进阶：所有人都运球。或者每名队员全程拉着搭档的手。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|The Chase Game","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"The Chase Game","nameZh":"追逐游戏","howItRuns":"Teams of four, each player with a ball, on a full court. Player 1 starts on the baseline, Player 2 (the chaser) at the free-throw line, Player 3 at half court and Player 4 on the far baseline. On \"go\", 2 tries to tag 3 before 3 reaches 4's baseline. If 3 gets there, 4 becomes the chaser and chases 2 toward 1's baseline. A chaser who tags the player being chased swaps roles with them at once. Players count their tags, and the top four catchers form a new team for the next game. Easier: no balls, or a shorter court. Harder: off hand only.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四人一队，每人一球，在全场进行。1号站在底线，2号（追人者）站在罚球线，3号站在半场，4号站在对面底线。听到“开始”后，2号要在3号到达4号所在的底线之前抓到3号。如果3号成功到达，4号成为追人者，向1号所在的底线追2号。追人者一旦抓到被追的人，立即与其交换角色。队员各自统计抓到的次数，抓人最多的前四名在下一局组成一个新队。降低难度：不用球，或缩短场地。加难：只用非惯用手运球。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|Jail Break","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Jail Break","nameZh":"越狱","howItRuns":"Two teams. Dribblers start inside the key with a ball each; defenders stand along the 3-point line. Dribblers try to dribble past the defenders and over the 3-point line. Defenders may not steal but slide their feet to force changes of direction. A dribbler who gets past becomes a defender. Play until one dribbler is left, then start a new game with the roles switched.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/), 6, 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队。运球者每人一球，从限制区内出发；防守者沿三分线站开。运球者要设法运球突破防守者，越过三分线。防守者不能抢球，只能用滑步逼对方改变方向。成功突破的运球者变成防守者。一直进行到只剩一名运球者，然后交换角色开始新一局。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|Pivot Tag (Sternschritt-Fangis)","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Pivot Tag (Sternschritt-Fangis)","nameZh":"转身捉人","howItRuns":"Everyone has a ball except 2 to 4 catchers. A player touched by a catcher gives up the ball and becomes a catcher. A chased player who holds the ball in both hands and pivots correctly shakes off the catcher, who must then chase someone else; only one catcher at a time can be shaken off this way. The double-dribble rule is suspended. Next step: set the dribbling hand, or change the field size or the number of catchers.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.5","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"除2至4名捉人者外，每人一球。被捉人者碰到的队员交出球，成为捉人者。被追的队员如果双手持球并做出正确的转身动作，就能甩掉捉人者，捉人者必须改去追别人；每次只能用这种方法甩掉一名捉人者。暂不判两次运球。进阶：指定运球手，或改变场地大小、捉人者人数。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|Fir-Tree Tag (Tannenbaum-Fangis)","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Fir-Tree Tag (Tannenbaum-Fangis)","nameZh":"圣诞树捉人","howItRuns":"Everyone has a ball and dribbles constantly; 2 to 4 catchers are marked with a band. A touched player becomes a \"fir tree\", feet wide and ball overhead, and is freed when someone dribbles a ball through their legs. Next step: change the field size or the number of catchers, set the hand, or free trees by crawling under their legs instead.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.5","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，全程不停运球；2至4名捉人者戴上标志带。被碰到的队员变成一棵“圣诞树”：双脚大大分开，双手把球举过头顶；有人运球从他的两腿之间穿过，他就被解救。进阶：改变场地大小或捉人者人数，指定运球手，或改为从“树”的两腿之间钻过去来解救。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|Rabbit Hunt (Hasenjagd)","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Rabbit Hunt (Hasenjagd)","nameZh":"猎兔","howItRuns":"Three roles: rabbits, who have a ball; hunters, who have none; and stationary players, \"X\". Hunters chase rabbits. A rabbit under pressure can dribble away or pass to an X, who passes back quickly. A hunter who touches a rabbit swaps roles with them.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf) Lesson 6","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三种角色：兔子（有球）、猎人（无球）和站在原地不动的队员“X”。猎人追兔子。兔子受到逼抢时，可以运球逃开，也可以传给某个X，X要快速回传。猎人碰到兔子后，两人交换角色。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|Ball Depot (Das Balldepot)","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Ball Depot (Das Balldepot)","nameZh":"传球入库","howItRuns":"Two teams, each with a ball cart. Pairs cross the court passing one ball between them and put it in the other team's cart. The first team with an empty cart wins. Next step: each team has a ball thief who intercepts passes and dribbles stolen balls to the other team's cart.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-9_d.pdf) Lesson 9","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-9_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，每队一辆球车。两人一组，相互传一个球穿过场地，把球放进对方队的球车。先把自己球车清空的队获胜。进阶：每队派一名“偷球者”，拦截对方的传球，并把抢到的球运到对方队的球车里。"},{"key":"U10|smallGames|Hit Relay (Treff-Stafette)","age":"U10","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Hit Relay (Treff-Stafette)","nameZh":"投篮寻宝接力","howItRuns":"Groups of 4 or 5 under one basket; all but two have a ball, and there is a pile of \"treasure\" (bottle caps, small cones or cards). On \"go\", ball carriers do a dribbling task, for example moving a tennis ball between small cones, then shoot. Balls are rolled back through the legs of waiting players to a player without a ball. A basket earns the shooter 2 treasure pieces and a miss 1. When the treasure is gone, the group with the most pieces wins. Next step: change the shooting distance.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.8","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"4或5人一组，在同一个篮筐下；除两人外每人一球，另有一堆“宝物”（瓶盖、小标志桶或卡片）。听到“开始”后，持球者先完成一项运球任务（例如在小标志桶之间移动一个网球），然后投篮。球从等待队员的两腿之间滚回，交给没有球的队员。投进得2件宝物，投失得1件。宝物拿完后，宝物最多的小组获胜。进阶：改变投篮距离。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Defense, I Love It Drill","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1: dribble and defend","kind":"activity","name":"Defense, I Love It Drill","nameZh":"我爱防守","howItRuns":"Players spread out in front of the coach. On \"Defense!\", they slap the floor, get into a defensive stance and say \"I love it!\", staying in the stance; repeat the call and response 5 times. The coach then points left or right and players slide that way; if the coach fakes a shot, they put one hand up to contest. Next step: groups of 3 or 4, each with a leader who gives the cues; switch leaders after 30 to 45 seconds. The plan gives 2 x 5.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员在教练面前散开站好。教练喊“防守！”，队员拍一下地面，成防守姿势，并喊“我爱防守！”，保持姿势；这样一呼一应重复5次。然后教练指向左或右，队员向该方向防守滑步；如果教练做投篮假动作，队员举起一只手干扰投篮。进阶：3或4人一组，每组由一名领队发口令；30至45秒后换领队。教案安排：2组×5次。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Read the Hand Drill","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1: dribble and defend","kind":"activity","name":"Read the Hand Drill","nameZh":"看手变向练习","howItRuns":"Partners with one ball. The ball handler takes 1 or 2 slow dribbles toward the partner, who acts as a defender and either holds one hand down low or holds an arm out at about chest height. Hand down: the ball handler makes a high, shoulder-height crossover and dribbles past. Hand up: a low crossover and past. The player then turns and comes back. 10 in total, then switch partners.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一个球。持球者朝搭档慢速运球1到2次，搭档扮演防守人，要么把一只手放低，要么把手臂伸到大约胸口高度。手放低：持球者做高位（与肩同高）的体前变向，运球过人。手抬起：做低位体前变向过人。然后转身返回。共做10次，然后换搭档。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Shield Steal Game","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1: dribble and defend","kind":"activity","name":"Shield Steal Game","nameZh":"护球抢球游戏","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball. On a half court, cones mark a square for each pair, just big enough for the two players. On \"Go\", the attacker dribbles as long as possible while the defender tries to steal, and the attacker counts how long they keep the ball. On a steal or the whistle, players switch roles. 4 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一个球。在半场用标志桶给每组围出一个方块，大小刚好容下两个人。听到“开始”后，进攻者尽可能长时间地运球，防守者设法抢断，进攻者自己数控球坚持了多久。被抢断或教练吹哨时，两人交换角色。时长4分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Middle Corridor (Mittelkorridor)","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1: dribble and defend","kind":"activity","name":"Middle Corridor (Mittelkorridor)","nameZh":"中路通道","howItRuns":"Pairs play 1 on 1 in a side corridor. The coach first explains what is and is not a foul. The attacker dribbles up the corridor from end to end, then both run back through the middle on the less crowded side; the next pair starts when the one ahead has crossed half way. The defender slides in a basic stance one arm's length away. If the ball is lost, it goes straight back to the attacker. Defence at 50%: keep arm's length. At 75%: if too close, sprint ahead without contact. At 100%: defend without fouling.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.10","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，在边路通道里进行1对1。教练先讲清楚什么算犯规、什么不算。进攻者从一端运球推进到另一端，然后两人从中路人少的一侧跑回；前一组过了一半，下一组出发。防守者以基本姿势滑步，保持一臂距离。如果丢球，球立即还给进攻者。防守强度50%：保持一臂距离。75%：如果贴得太近，就无身体接触地冲刺到前面。100%：在不犯规的前提下防守。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Rooted 1 on 1","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1: dribble and defend","kind":"activity","name":"Rooted 1 on 1","nameZh":"定脚1对1","howItRuns":"Three lines at half court, a ball at the front of each, and one defender per line at the 3-point line. The attacker dribbles toward the defender and has five dribbles to score. The defender may not move until the attacker is right in front of them. Players keep their own points. The attacker becomes the defender, and the defender joins the back of a half-court line. 2 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/), 8","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在半场排三路纵队，每队排头持球，每队对应一名防守者站在三分线。进攻者向防守者运球推进，最多运球五次，要在五次运球之内得分。进攻者运到防守者正面之前，防守者不能移动。队员各自记分。进攻者转为防守者，防守者回到某一路半场纵队的队尾。时长2分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Pass Fake Breakdown Drill","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing under pressure","kind":"activity","name":"Pass Fake Breakdown Drill","nameZh":"传球假动作分解练习","howItRuns":"Each player has a ball, spins it to themselves from the side, gives a quick reverse pass fake at chest level, and repeats. Change sides, and add pivots if appropriate. The fake is quick and moves both the ball and the eyes. 2 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，从身体侧面把球旋转抛给自己，接球后在胸前高度快速做一个反向传球假动作，反复进行。换另一侧，合适时加入转身。假动作要快，球和眼神都要跟着动。时长2分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Pass Under Pressure Game","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing under pressure","kind":"activity","name":"Pass Under Pressure Game","nameZh":"压迫下传球游戏","howItRuns":"Groups of three, one ball, in a small area marked with cones or lines. One attacker dribbles continuously inside the area for 30 seconds while a defender tries to steal. The other attacker moves around outside the area; when they raise their hands, the dribbler must pass to them within two seconds, and they pass back. The defence scores a point for each steal or deflection, and the passer and receiver a point for each completed pass. Switch roles every 30 seconds. The plan gives 6 x 30 seconds.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组，一个球，在用标志桶或场地线围出的小区域内进行。一名进攻者在区域内连续运球30秒，一名防守者设法抢断。另一名进攻者在区域外移动；他举起双手时，运球者必须在两秒内传球给他，他再回传。防守方每抢断或碰球一次得1分，传球者和接球者每完成一次传球得1分。每30秒轮换角色。教案安排：6组×30秒。"},{"key":"U10|compete|The Gates (Die Tore)","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing under pressure","kind":"activity","name":"The Gates (Die Tore)","nameZh":"过门","howItRuns":"Three gates, each made of two cones, and 3 balls. Three attackers try to get through one of the gates using passes only, while 2 defenders try to stop them. A point for each time the group gets through; most points in a set time wins.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf) Lesson 6","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三个门，每个门由两个标志桶组成，共3个球。三名进攻者只能通过传球设法穿过其中一个门，两名防守者阻止他们。小组每穿过一次得1分；在规定时间内得分最多者获胜。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Pirate Game (Piratenspiel)","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing under pressure","kind":"activity","name":"Pirate Game (Piratenspiel)","nameZh":"海盗游戏","howItRuns":"Three pirates (defenders) each guard their own \"sea\". Seafarers in pairs with one ball must cross each sea, and may dribble. A pair that gets across runs round the outside back to the start, the \"harbour\". If the ball is intercepted or leaves the sea, the player responsible replaces the pirate. Next step: limit the number of dribbles, or change the field size or the number of pirates.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.9","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三名海盗（防守者）各自看守一片“海域”。航海者两人一组、一个球，必须穿过每一片海域，可以运球。成功穿过的一组从场外绕回起点“港口”。如果球被拦截或出了海域，负责的那名队员替换海盗。进阶：限制运球次数，或改变场地大小、海盗人数。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Pairs passing up the court","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Pass and cut","kind":"activity","name":"Pairs passing up the court","nameZh":"两人推进传球","howItRuns":"Players in two lines, or in pairs, pass the ball back and forth while running to the other end of the court. They may pass the full length of the court, or at the far end the player on the outside shoots. That player rebounds their own shot and the players move to the other side of the court. Players swap lines on the way back.","source":"Mini p.27, item 13","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员排成两路纵队，或两人一组，边向场地另一端跑边来回传球。可以一直传到全场另一端，也可以到达另一端时由外侧队员投篮。投篮者抢自己的篮板，然后两人移到场地另一侧。返回时两人交换队列。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Weaves","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Pass and cut","kind":"activity","name":"Weaves","nameZh":"八字传球","howItRuns":"Three groups on the baseline with one ball. The middle player passes to an outside player, then sprints behind that player and moves in front of them. Each player who catches passes to a player on the opposite side and runs behind that player, making a weave. Finish with a shot, or by stepping off the court at the far end. Next step: 4 groups, where the first pass always goes to the closest player on the side with two players; or 5 groups, where the first pass can go to the closest player on either side and the passer then sprints past both players on that side.","source":"Mini p.27, items 14–15","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":"波浪传球","howItRunsZh":"三路纵队站在底线，一个球。中间队员传球给一侧的队员，然后从该队员身后冲刺绕到他前面。每名接到球的队员都传给另一侧的队员，并从他身后跑过，形成“八字”交叉。最后以投篮结束，或在另一端跑出场地结束。进阶：4路纵队，第一传总是传给有两人那一侧最近的队员；或5路纵队，第一传可以传给任意一侧最近的队员，传球者随后冲刺越过该侧的两名队员。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Dribble & Pass to Target Drill","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Pass and cut","kind":"activity","name":"Dribble & Pass to Target Drill","nameZh":"运球传准练习","howItRuns":"Half the players start on the right baseline; the other half stand well behind a cone on the left wing beyond half court. Everyone has a ball. A baseline player takes two running or jogging dribbles and throws a running pass at the cone. On a hit, the cone player passes back and the passer banana-cuts toward the basket they started near for a lay-up, chased by the cone player; they then switch lines. On a miss, the passer defends and the cone player attacks them 1 on 1 at the basket nearest the passing line. Points for a cone hit, a made lay-up and a stop; play to a set score, then change sides.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/), 8, 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一半队员从右侧底线出发；另一半站在过半场后左侧侧翼一个标志桶的后方较远处。每人一球。底线队员跑动中（或慢跑中）运球两次，然后行进间传球击打标志桶。击中：标志桶那边的队员回传，传球者向自己出发一侧的篮筐做弧线切入上篮，标志桶队员在后面追；然后两人交换队列。未击中：传球者转为防守，标志桶队员在离传球队列最近的篮筐对他进行1对1进攻。击中标志桶、上篮投进和防守成功都得分；打到规定比分后换边。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Pass and Cut, 2 on 2","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Pass and cut","kind":"activity","name":"Pass and Cut, 2 on 2","nameZh":"传切配合2对2","howItRuns":"Attackers 1 and 2 play against defenders, with the coach as a passer. The start positions are shown only in the plan's diagram. 1 passes to the coach or to 2, then cuts to the basket. The attackers score by getting the ball into the key. The defence wins by getting the ball, or if the attackers have not got into the key within 10 seconds. When 1 passes to the coach, 2 waits until 1 has cut before cutting. Defenders stay between their opponent and the player with the ball, able to see both.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 7","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"进攻者1号和2号对抗防守者，教练充当传球人。起始站位只在教案的示意图中标出。1号传给教练或2号，然后向篮下空切。进攻方把球带进或传进限制区即得分。防守方抢到球，或进攻方10秒内没能进入限制区，防守方获胜。1号传给教练时，2号要等1号切完再切。防守者站在自己的对手和持球者之间，两人都能看到。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Pass Fake & Drive Game","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"Pass Fake & Drive Game","nameZh":"传球假动作突破游戏","howItRuns":"A line at the top of the key with a ball, one attacker on the wing, one defender in the key and a coach on the opposite wing. The first player in line passes to the coach, who passes back; on that pass the defender closes out and plays live. The attacker either pass fakes and drives to the basket, or passes to the wing player, with the defender at a disadvantage. Rotate: top to wing, wing to defence, and a new player in at the top. The plan gives 1 x 2 minutes each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"弧顶一路纵队，排头持球；侧翼一名进攻者，限制区内一名防守者，对侧侧翼站一名教练。排头队员传给教练，教练回传；回传的同时，防守者上前扑防，开始实战。进攻者要么做传球假动作后突破上篮，要么在防守者处于不利位置时传给侧翼队员。轮换：弧顶到侧翼，侧翼到防守，再由新队员到弧顶。教案安排：每侧1组×2分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|The Kick Pass Drill","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"The Kick Pass Drill","nameZh":"分球练习","howItRuns":"Two lines, one on the wing with the ball and one in the weakside corner, each attacker with a defender. The defender on the ball starts one step behind. Play is live once the attacker moves. The ball handler drives and reads the weakside defender: if that defender leaves the corner player to help, kick out for an open shot; if the defender stays home, try a lay-up. Play until a score or the defence gets the ball; the attackers move to defence and two new attackers start. Next step: move the corner player to just outside the block, or add an attacker and a defender on the weakside wing for 3 on 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两路纵队，一路在侧翼持球，一路在弱侧底角，每名进攻者都有一名防守者。持球防守人从落后一步的位置开始。进攻者一动就开始实战。持球者突破，同时观察弱侧防守者：如果他离开底角队员去协防，就把球分出去，让底角队员空位投篮；如果他留在原位，就自己上篮。打到得分或防守方得球为止；进攻者转为防守，再上两名新的进攻者。进阶：把底角队员移到低位卡位点外侧，或在弱侧侧翼增加一名进攻者和一名防守者，打3对3。"},{"key":"U10|compete|2 on 2 Drive and Kick","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 2 Drive and Kick","nameZh":"2对2突破分球","howItRuns":"Partners line up on the baseline for 2 on 2. One attacker starts at the top of the key with the ball and one on the wing. The defender on the ball gives the dribbler a slight advantage to drive toward the teammate's side. The dribbler drives and kicks the ball out, and the 2 on 2 is live for one shot. The defence then becomes the offence, the offence goes to the back of the baseline line, and a new pair defends. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"搭档在底线排队，打2对2。一名进攻者持球站在弧顶，另一名站在侧翼。持球防守人给运球者留一点优势，让他朝队友那一侧突破。运球者突破后把球分出，然后2对2实战，只打一次投篮。之后防守方转为进攻方，进攻方回到底线队尾，换上新的一组防守。先得3分获胜。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Shot Fake Breakdown Drill","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shot fakes, jabs and shooting decisions","kind":"activity","name":"Shot Fake Breakdown Drill","nameZh":"投篮假动作分解练习","howItRuns":"Players start on the baseline, each with a ball. Each player spins the ball to themselves, catches, shot fakes and takes one dribble forward with the right hand, repeating to half court; on the way back they dribble forward with the left hand. Stay low, show the ball as for a normal shot, and do not rush the fake. The coach gives feedback along the way. 2 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员每人一球，从底线出发。每人把球旋转抛给自己，接球，做投篮假动作，然后右手向前运球一次，这样一直重复到半场；返回时改用左手向前运球。重心保持低，像正常投篮一样把球亮出来，假动作不要着急。教练在过程中给予反馈。时长2分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Jab Attack Drill","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shot fakes, jabs and shooting decisions","kind":"activity","name":"Jab Attack Drill","nameZh":"试探步进攻练习","howItRuns":"A player with a ball starts facing the basket where half court meets the sideline. Jab with the foot nearest the sideline, then step across the body with the jab foot, taking a big step and a big dribble forward at an angle the other way, and pick up the ball with a 1-2 stop as if to shoot. Reset, jab again and attack the middle. The goal is to be inside the 3-point line after 3 jabs and take a jump shot after the third. Always 1-2 step; no hopping onto two feet after the dribble. 3 times from each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"队员持球，站在半场线与边线的交点，面向篮筐。用靠近边线的脚做试探步，然后这只脚交叉跨过身体，向另一侧斜前方迈一大步、运一大步球，用一二步急停收球，像要投篮一样。重新站好，再做试探步，攻向中路。目标是3次试探步后进入三分线内，并在第三次后跳投。始终用一二步急停；运球后不要双脚跳停。每侧3次。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Variation Shooting","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shot fakes, jabs and shooting decisions","kind":"activity","name":"Variation Shooting","nameZh":"变化投篮","howItRuns":"Partners, one shooter and one passer, with up to 4 pairs per basket. Round 1: the shooter takes 6 shots, all from different spots and ranges, and the passer passes from a different angle each time. Round 2: the same with a different stance: narrow, wide, off one leg, staggered. Round 3: after each pass the passer closes out, and the shooter shot fakes and takes one or two dribbles before the shot, changing spot on every catch. Switch roles after each round. The plan gives 3 to 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/), 9","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一人投篮一人传球，每个篮筐最多4组。第1轮：投篮者投6次，每次都换不同的位置和距离，传球者每次从不同角度传球。第2轮：同样的练习，换不同的站姿：窄站、宽站、单脚、前后开立。第3轮：传球者每次传球后上前扑防，投篮者做投篮假动作，运球一到两次后投篮，每次接球都换位置。每轮结束后交换角色。教案安排：3至5分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Triangle Decision Shooting","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shot fakes, jabs and shooting decisions","kind":"activity","name":"Triangle Decision Shooting","nameZh":"三角决策投篮","howItRuns":"Cones form three triangles, one at the free-throw line and one on each wing, tips pointing to the basket, with groups of 2, 3 or 4 at each. A defender starts at the tip; an attacker with the ball starts on the opposite side, facing the basket. The defender closes out to one side, and the attacker reads it and takes one or two dribbles toward the basket the other way for a jump shot. The shooter becomes the defender, and the defender joins a line at another triangle. After a set time, players count their makes; the highest total wins. The plan gives 4 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用标志桶摆出三个三角形，一个在罚球线，两侧侧翼各一个，尖端都指向篮筐，每个三角形安排2、3或4人。防守者从尖端出发；持球进攻者从对面一侧出发，面向篮筐。防守者向一侧扑防，进攻者读出防守，向另一侧朝篮筐运球一到两次后跳投。投篮者转为防守者，防守者到另一个三角形排队。规定时间结束后，队员统计各自投进的数量，总数最多者获胜。教案安排：4分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Decision 1 on 1","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shot fakes, jabs and shooting decisions","kind":"activity","name":"Decision 1 on 1","nameZh":"决策1对1","howItRuns":"Pairs with a ball at spots around the 3-point line; the coach stands in the lane and gives each pair a number. The defender stands just inside the 3-point line in a stance, facing the basket; the attacker stands behind, touching the ball to the defender's back. When the coach calls a pair's number, the attacker pulls the ball away and attacks the basket, and the defender must touch the floor with both hands before defending. If the coach stays out of the play, the attacker takes a lay-up; if the coach steps forward, the attacker pulls up for a shot. Possessions alternate, make or miss. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组持一个球，分布在三分线周围的各个位置；教练站在限制区内，给每组一个编号。防守者站在三分线内一点，成防守姿势，面向篮筐；进攻者站在他身后，用球贴着防守者的后背。教练喊到某组的编号时，进攻者把球拉开，攻向篮筐，防守者必须先双手触地才能开始防守。如果教练不参与，进攻者上篮；如果教练向前迈步，进攻者急停跳投。无论投进与否，双方交替进攻。先得3分获胜。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Blind 1 on 1","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shot fakes, jabs and shooting decisions","kind":"activity","name":"Blind 1 on 1","nameZh":"背后起动1对1","howItRuns":"Partners at any spot on the 3-point line, up to three pairs per basket. The attacker stands behind the defender, holding the ball on the defender's back. As soon as the attacker moves to dribble, the defender may play live. The attacker has two dribbles to score with a lay-up or jump shot. Next step: lay-ups only, then lay-ups with the non-dominant hand only. The plan gives 4 games.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/), 7","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，站在三分线上任意位置，每个篮筐最多三组。进攻者站在防守者身后，把球贴在防守者的后背上。进攻者一动身运球，防守者即可开始实战防守。进攻者最多运球两次，用上篮或跳投得分。进阶：只允许上篮，再进一步只允许用非惯用手上篮。教案安排：4局。"},{"key":"U10|compete|3-Line Layups Add Variations","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"2 on 1 and 3 on 2","kind":"activity","name":"3-Line Layups Add Variations","nameZh":"三线上篮加变化","howItRuns":"Three lines facing the basket, one on each wing and one at the top of the key. The first in each line dribbles in for a lay-up, rebounds their own shot, passes to the next in that line and goes to the back. The wings shoot right- and left-hand lay-ups, the middle a lay-up without the backboard, and players also mix in finishes such as the Euro step. Rotate lines after 90 seconds. Next step: the middle line defends and one wing line attacks without a ball, making a live 2 on 1 with 10 seconds per possession and lay-ups only.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三路纵队面向篮筐，两侧侧翼各一路，弧顶一路。每队排头运球上篮，抢自己的篮板，传给本队下一人，然后回到队尾。两侧侧翼分别练右手和左手上篮，中路练不打板上篮，队员还可以加入欧洲步等各种终结方式。90秒后轮换队列。进阶：中路队转为防守，一路侧翼队无球进攻，形成实战2打1，每回合10秒，只能上篮。"},{"key":"U10|compete|2-on-1 Fast Break Game","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"2 on 1 and 3 on 2","kind":"activity","name":"2-on-1 Fast Break Game","nameZh":"2打1快攻游戏","howItRuns":"Two lines at half court, one with a ball, and a defender at the top of the key. The two attackers try to score in a 2 on 1 fast break. The player who shoots or turns the ball over becomes the next defender, and the others go to the back of the half-court lines. 3 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/), 10, 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"半场两路纵队，其中一路持球，弧顶站一名防守者。两名进攻者用2打1快攻设法得分。投篮或失误的队员成为下一名防守者，其他人回到半场纵队队尾。时长3分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Full Court Transition Outnumbered Game","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"2 on 1 and 3 on 2","kind":"activity","name":"Full Court Transition Outnumbered Game","nameZh":"全场以多打少转换游戏","howItRuns":"Two attackers inbound from the baseline and try to score at the far basket. One defender starts at the 3-point line on the inbound side and one at the far 3-point line, and each guards only their own half, so the attackers have a 2 on 1 in each half. A steal or the ball going out of bounds ends the game, and a new group rotates in: the attackers move to defence and two new attackers come on. Next step: add one attacker and one defender for 3 on 2 in each half. 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两名进攻者从底线发球入场，攻向对面篮筐。一名防守者从发球一侧的三分线出发，另一名从对面三分线出发，每人只防守自己的半场，因此进攻者在每个半场都是2打1。抢断或球出界则本局结束，换下一组：进攻者转为防守，再上两名新的进攻者。进阶：增加一名进攻者和一名防守者，每个半场打3打2。时长5分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|3 On 2 Advantage","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"2 on 1 and 3 on 2","kind":"activity","name":"3 On 2 Advantage","nameZh":"3打2优势进攻","howItRuns":"Three attackers start anywhere outside the perimeter and two defenders in the key; one defender has the ball. Play starts when that defender passes to an attacker. Attackers may not cut and must pass the ball around to get a good shot. After a score or a stop, the two defenders join one more player on offence and two new defenders come in. Next step: allow one attacker to cut, who must go back outside the 3-point line if they don't get the ball; or attackers may hold the ball for only one second before passing, shooting or dribbling, or the coach calls a turnover. 6 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三名进攻者在外线任意位置出发，两名防守者在限制区内，其中一名防守者持球。该防守者传球给一名进攻者，比赛开始。进攻者不能空切，必须通过传导球找到好的投篮机会。得分或防守成功后，两名防守者与另一名队员一起转为进攻，换上两名新防守者。进阶：允许一名进攻者空切，没接到球必须回到三分线外；或者进攻者持球只能停留一秒，之后必须传球、投篮或运球，否则教练判失误。时长6分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Shoot And Follow","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"Shoot And Follow","nameZh":"投篮跟进","howItRuns":"Groups of 3 with 2 balls at a basket; the coach sets the distance and type of shot. On \"start\", one player shoots and the second shoots right after. Shooters chase their own shot, rebound and pass to the open teammate, and the passer moves to a new spot for the next pass. After two minutes, groups change baskets, type of shot or side of the basket. Competitive version: teams count makes, and the most makes after a set time wins. The plan gives 3 x 2 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一组，每组2个球，在一个篮筐进行；教练指定投篮距离和方式。听到“开始”后，一人投篮，第二人紧接着投篮。投篮者追着自己的球抢篮板，然后传给空着的队友，传球者移动到新的位置准备下一次传球。两分钟后，各组换篮筐、换投篮方式或换到篮筐另一侧。比赛版：各队统计投进数，规定时间结束时投进最多的队获胜。教案安排：3组×2分钟。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Hit Games (Treff-Spiele)","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"Hit Games (Treff-Spiele)","nameZh":"命中比赛","howItRuns":"Groups spread across the baskets, one ball per group, and repeat the shooting technique. The first group to 10 baskets wins. A gross technique error, such as a two-handed shot, costs the group all its points. Next step: change the distance; score 1 for the ring and 3 for a basket; change the number of baskets to win or the number of balls; move groups to the next basket after each round; shoot lay-ups.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.7","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"各组分散到各个篮筐，每组一个球，重复练习投篮技术。先投进10个的组获胜。出现严重技术错误（例如双手投篮），该组所有得分清零。进阶：改变投篮距离；碰筐得1分、投进得3分；改变获胜所需的投进数或球的数量；每轮结束后各组换到下一个篮筐；改为上篮。"},{"key":"U10|compete|21","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"21","nameZh":"21分游戏","howItRuns":"Two teams, as even as possible, each with two balls, lined up at a set spot. A basket from the spot scores 2 points. A player who catches the rebound before it bounces may take a second shot, worth 1 point. The next player starts once the one ahead has scored or used both shots. The first team to at least 21 points wins.","source":"Mini p.22, item 10","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，实力尽量均衡，每队两个球，在指定位置排队。在指定位置投进得2分。在球落地前接住篮板的队员可以补投一次，投进得1分。前一名队员得分或用完两次投篮后，下一名队员出发。先达到（或超过）21分的队获胜。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Pressure Shot","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"Pressure Shot","nameZh":"压力投篮","howItRuns":"Two teams race to make 10 shots that the coach chooses, within the players' range. A team on 3 that misses its next shot goes back to zero; a team on 5 that misses its next shot loses 1 point.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 8","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队比赛，看谁先投进10个由教练指定、在队员投篮范围内的投篮。已有3分的队如果下一投投失，分数归零；已有5分的队如果下一投投失，扣1分。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Free Throw Golf","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"Free Throw Golf","nameZh":"罚球高尔夫","howItRuns":"Use as many baskets as possible, with one player shooting at a time. Each player shoots 2 free throws at a time and rotates until they have shot 10. Nothing but net scores minus 2, any other make minus 1, and a miss plus 1. The lowest score after 10 free throws wins. Competitive version: partner groups compete, and partners may distract the shooter but not block or touch them.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"尽量使用所有篮筐，每次只有一人投篮。每人每次罚球2个，然后轮换，直到每人投满10个。空心入网记负2分，其他方式投进记负1分，投失记正1分。10个罚球后总分最低者获胜。比赛版：两人一组对抗，搭档可以干扰投篮者，但不能封盖或碰到他。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Jump Stop Shooting Game","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"Jump Stop Shooting Game","nameZh":"跳步急停投篮游戏","howItRuns":"Up to 4 groups at shooting spots on the wings and slots, the first player in each line with a ball, and a cone a few feet from the basket. The first player dribbles to the cone, jump stops and shoots, rebounds their own shot and passes to the next in line. The first team to the target number of baskets wins. Work on a good, balanced jump stop at game speed.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"最多4组，分别站在两侧侧翼和45度位置的投篮点，每队排头持球，离篮筐不远处（几步之内）放一个标志桶。排头队员运球到标志桶，跳步急停后投篮，抢自己的篮板，传给队里下一人。先达到目标投进数的队获胜。要以比赛速度练出稳定、平衡的跳步急停。"},{"key":"U10|compete|2-Bounce Shooting Game","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"2-Bounce Shooting Game","nameZh":"两次落地投篮游戏","howItRuns":"Four players at a basket, each with a ball, start outside the 3-point line. Each takes one dribble toward the basket and shoots, then must get the rebound before the ball bounces twice; if it bounces twice, the basket does not count. After the rebound the player goes back out to the perimeter and repeats. The first to make 5 shots wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四名队员在一个篮筐，每人一球，从三分线外出发。每人朝篮筐运球一次后投篮，然后必须在球第二次落地之前抢到篮板；如果球落地两次，这个进球不算。抢到篮板后回到外线重复。先投进5个者获胜。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Cone Game (Hütchen-Spiel)","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"Cone Game (Hütchen-Spiel)","nameZh":"抢桶投篮","howItRuns":"At least 2 players per basket, a fixed shooting spot at each basket, and about half as many cones as groups in the middle. After making 5 press lay-ups, a group may take a cone, from the middle or from another group, and put it beside its marker; from then on it scores with shots from the cone, not lay-ups. Cones may not be fought over. A group that loses its cone must make 5 press lay-ups again before taking one. The first group to the agreed points total wins. BASPO's example: 22 players, 6 baskets, groups of 3 or 4, 2 balls per group, 3 cones, 10 points to win.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.7","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个篮筐至少2人，每个篮筐设一个固定投篮点，场地中间放的标志桶数量约为组数的一半。一组完成5次按球上篮后，可以从中间或从别的组那里拿一个标志桶，放在自己的标记旁边；从此该组改为在标志桶处投篮得分，不再上篮。不能争抢标志桶。标志桶被拿走的组，必须重新完成5次按球上篮，才能再拿一个。先达到约定总分的组获胜。BASPO的示例：22名队员，6个篮筐，每组3或4人，每组2个球，3个标志桶，10分获胜。"},{"key":"U10|compete|Shooting Ladders","age":"U10","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting contests","kind":"activity","name":"Shooting Ladders","nameZh":"投篮阶梯","howItRuns":"Partners share a ball, and several pairs can use one basket. Each basket has three spots: short (near the block), medium (near the free-throw line) and long (near the 3-point line). Partners take turns shooting at each spot, rebound their own shot and pass to the partner, and count how many times they complete the ladder. Move the spots closer or farther to suit the players. Next step: every shot off the dribble (pull-up, side step or step-back), and only a swish moves the shooter back to the next spot. Competitive version: waiting players or coaches contest the shots.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人共用一个球，一个篮筐可以安排多组。每个篮筐设三个点：近（低位卡位点附近）、中（罚球线附近）、远（三分线附近）。两人轮流在每个点投篮，抢自己的篮板后传给搭档，统计完成整个阶梯的次数。根据队员水平把各点移近或移远。进阶：每次都要运球后投篮（急停跳投、侧步或后撤步），且只有空心入网才能后移到下一个点。比赛版：等待的队员或教练上前干扰投篮。"},{"key":"U10|game|Line Ball (Linienball)","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Line Ball (Linienball)","nameZh":"过线球","howItRuns":"Two teams, one ball. A team scores by getting the ball behind the opponents' baseline using passes only. BASPO's school version plays across the hall in 2 to 4 fields with teams of 2 or 3: passing and pivoting only, no dribbling, and a point for placing the ball on the floor behind the line without travelling. Next step (school version): change the field size or team size, play a league or rotation tournament, or allow a set number of dribbles.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf) Lesson 6; [BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.9","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，一个球。只能通过传球把球带到对方底线后面才得分。BASPO的学校版本在场馆内横向分成2至4个场地，每队2或3人：只能传球和转身，不能运球，在不走步的前提下把球放到线后的地面上得1分。进阶（学校版本）：改变场地大小或每队人数，进行联赛或轮换赛，或允许规定次数的运球。"},{"key":"U10|game|Criss Cross Game","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Criss Cross Game","nameZh":"交叉换位游戏","howItRuns":"Teams of 3 on a half court, one ball. The defending team starts on the baseline; the attackers start outside the 3-point line on both wings and at the top of the key. The defenders pass along the baseline from far left to far right, and the far-right defender passes to the nearest attacking wing. The defenders then sprint out to guard the player diagonally opposite, the middle one taking the top, while the attackers reverse the ball from right to left. Play goes live once the ball reaches the far side. A team that scores stays on attack; a defence that gets a stop attacks next. Either way a new defence comes in. First to 3 points wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一队，在半场进行，一个球。防守队从底线出发；进攻队在三分线外的两侧侧翼和弧顶出发。防守者沿底线从最左侧向最右侧传球，最右侧的防守者传给离他最近的进攻侧翼。然后防守者冲刺出去防守斜对面的队员，中间的防守者防弧顶，同时进攻者把球从右向左转移。球到达另一侧后开始实战。得分的队继续进攻；防守成功的队下一回合进攻。无论哪种情况，都换上新的防守队。先得3分获胜。"},{"key":"U10|game|Scrimmage Activity","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Scrimmage Activity","nameZh":"攻防教学赛","howItRuns":"Two teams, two halves. In the first half one team attacks at one end and the other defends. When the defence gets the ball, it goes to the other end and shoots, with no defence, until it scores; then the ball comes back for another contested possession. At half time the defending team is probably ahead, since it scored every time it had the ball. The teams swap in the second half. The coach can change how a contested possession scores, for example getting the ball into the key or a shot hitting the ring.","source":"Start Coaching, Plan 9","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，分上下半场。上半场一队在一端进攻，另一队防守。防守方得球后，跑到另一端无人防守地投篮，直到投进为止；然后球回来，再进行一次有对抗的回合。到中场时，防守队很可能领先，因为它每次得球都得分。下半场两队互换。教练可以改变对抗回合的得分方式，例如把球带进限制区，或投篮碰到篮筐即得分。"},{"key":"U10|game|5 v 5 closing game (Spiel 5 gegen 5)","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 v 5 closing game (Spiel 5 gegen 5)","nameZh":"5对5收尾比赛","howItRuns":"Every J+S-Kids lesson ends with 15 minutes of 5 v 5. Where side baskets are available, play 3 v 3 across the width of the court instead.","source":"[J+S-Kids Basketball](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf) Lesson 6 (all lessons)","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2012/06/Basketball_Lektion-6_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每节J+S-Kids训练课都以15分钟的5对5结束。如果有侧面篮筐，就改为横向使用场地打3对3。"},{"key":"U10|game|Four 6-minute quarters","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Four 6-minute quarters","nameZh":"四节×6分钟","howItRuns":"The game length used at the 2026 China U10 national finals.","source":"[China Sports Daily via Sina](https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml)","sourceUrl":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"2026年中国U10全国总决赛采用的比赛时长。"},{"key":"U10|game|Equal time for three periods","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Equal time for three periods","nameZh":"前三节上场时间均等","howItRuns":"Equal playing time in periods 1 to 3; the coach decides in the 4th period and extra periods.","source":"[USA Basketball rules, ages 9–11](https://www.quickscores.com/downloads/mwrhuachucayouth_USA_Basketball_Youth_Guidelines__Rules_and_Standards.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://www.quickscores.com/downloads/mwrhuachucayouth_USA_Basketball_Youth_Guidelines__Rules_and_Standards.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"第1至第3节上场时间均等；第4节和加时赛由教练决定。"},{"key":"U10|game|Two different fives","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Two different fives","nameZh":"两套不同的五人阵容","howItRuns":"Five players play the 1st quarter and a different five play the 2nd.","source":"[Basketball Ireland rules, U11](https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/NationalUnderageRules.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/NationalUnderageRules.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"第1节由五名队员上场，第2节换另外五名队员上场。"},{"key":"U10|game|Full-court defence in the last period only","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Full-court defence in the last period only","nameZh":"仅最后一节可全场防守","howItRuns":"Player-to-player defence may extend full court only in the 4th period and extra periods. A team leading by 25 or more may not defend beyond half court.","source":"USA Basketball rules, ages 9–11","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"人盯人防守只有在第4节和加时赛中才可以扩展到全场。领先25分或以上的队不得在半场以外防守。"},{"key":"U10|game|All field goals count 2","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"All field goals count 2","nameZh":"所有投篮均计2分","howItRuns":"No 3-point shot; a basket from outside the line counts 2.","source":"USA Basketball rules, ages 9–11; Basketball Ireland U11–U12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"不设三分球；在三分线外投进也计2分。"},{"key":"U10|game|Travel called lightly","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Travel called lightly","nameZh":"走步从宽判罚","howItRuns":"Travel and illegal dribble are applied sparingly. The referee gives feedback on footwork, may stop play to explain, then gives the ball back to the same team.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"走步和违例运球从宽判罚。裁判对脚步动作给予反馈，可以暂停比赛进行讲解，然后把球交还给同一队。"},{"key":"U10|game|Fast break and possession","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Fast break and possession","nameZh":"快攻与球权","howItRuns":"A team that scores on a fast break keeps the points and gets the ball back at half way.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"快攻得分的队保留得分，并在半场线重新获得球权。"},{"key":"U10|game|No 8 second","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"No 8 second","nameZh":"不判8秒","howItRuns":"The 8-second violation is not called; the team keeps the ball and throws in from half way.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"不判8秒违例；该队保留球权，在半场线掷界外球。"},{"key":"U10|game|Free-throw line 1 m closer","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Free-throw line 1 m closer","nameZh":"罚球线前移1米","howItRuns":"Germany's U10 rule; players may not step over the line.","source":"[DBB Miniregeln](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"德国的U10规则；队员罚球时不得踩过罚球线。"},{"key":"U10|game|Keep score late in the stage","age":"U10","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U10","kind":"rule","name":"Keep score late in the stage","nameZh":"阶段后期再记分","howItRuns":"Canada does not recommend a visible score early in Learn to Train and suggests keeping score towards the end of the stage.","source":"[Canada Basketball ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) p.37","sourceUrl":"https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"加拿大不建议在“学习训练”（Learn to Train）阶段初期公开记分，建议到该阶段后期再开始记分。"},{"key":"U12|routine|SHRed Injuries Basketball warm-up","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Injury-prevention warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"SHRed Injuries Basketball warm-up","nameZh":"SHRed篮球防伤热身","howItRuns":"About 10 minutes, before the basketball warm-up, at all practices and games. Four parts; each exercise has a Level 1 and a Level 2. Aerobic: forward run with backward zig-zag side shuffle (L2 carioca); skipping forward and backward (L2 sideways); forward run building speed. Agility: single-leg hops forward and backward (L2 side to side); squat jumps (L2 skate jumps). Strength: front plank (L2 with alternating leg lifts); side plank (L2 with torso rotation); Nordic hamstring curl; walking lunges with torso rotation (L2 with arm and knee lifts); 3-D lunges (L2 side lunges with arm circles). Balance: single-leg balance with torso rotation (L2 with ball roll); with squat pass (L2 and jump catch). Reps and times are on the printed handout. In Calgary players aged 11–18, ankle and knee injury rates were 36% lower in the season it was used (a before-and-after comparison, not a randomised trial).","source":"[University of Calgary SHRed page](https://live-ucalgary.ucalgary.ca/shred-injuries/all-sports/basketball); [Emery 2022](https://doi.org/10.2519/jospt.2022.10959)","sourceUrl":"https://live-ucalgary.ucalgary.ca/shred-injuries/all-sports/basketball","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"约10分钟，在篮球专项热身之前进行，每次训练和比赛都要做。共四部分，每个动作分1级和2级。有氧：向前跑，接向后之字形侧滑步（2级：交叉步/卡里奥卡步）；向前、向后垫步跳（2级：侧向垫步跳）；向前跑并逐步加速。灵敏：单腿向前、向后跳（2级：左右跳）；深蹲跳（2级：滑冰跳）。力量：平板支撑（2级：加交替抬腿）；侧平板支撑（2级：加躯干旋转）；北欧挺（腘绳肌离心练习）；行进弓步加躯干旋转（2级：加摆臂和提膝）；三维弓步（2级：侧弓步加手臂画圈）。平衡：单腿站立加躯干旋转（2级：加滚球）；单腿站立加下蹲传球（2级：再加跳起接球）。组数和时间见印刷版讲义。在卡尔加里，11–18岁球员在使用这套热身的赛季中，踝关节和膝关节受伤率降低了36%（这是前后对比，不是随机对照试验）。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Dynamic Warm-Up Part 4","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Dynamic Warm-Up Part 4","nameZh":"动态热身 第4部分","howItRuns":"Each movement once, travelling from the baseline to half court or from half court to the baseline: Leg Swings, Knee Hugs, Imaginary Dunks, Backwards Run, Trunk Twists, Explosion Leap. The page gives no further instructions; the movements are shown on video.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/), 7, 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个动作做一趟，从底线行进到半场，或从半场行进到底线：摆腿、抱膝走、模拟扣篮、后退跑、转体、爆发式远跳。原页面没有更多说明，动作以视频示范。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Dynamic Warm-Up Part 5","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Dynamic Warm-Up Part 5","nameZh":"动态热身 第5部分","howItRuns":"Each movement once: The Bear Hold, Ankling, Carioca, Pogo Jumps, Leg Swings, Calf Raises. The page gives no distance or further instructions; the movements are shown on video.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个动作做一趟：熊式支撑（The Bear Hold）、踝关节小步跑（Ankling）、交叉步（Carioca）、弹簧跳（Pogo Jumps）、摆腿、提踵。原页面没有给出距离或更多说明，动作以视频示范。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Defensive stance and slides","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"defence","group":"Defensive footwork","kind":"activity","name":"Defensive stance and slides","nameZh":"防守站姿与滑步","howItRuns":"Start from the defensive stance and slides: lateral slides, zig-zag backward slides, and slides linked into a sprint and a change of direction. The report gives no set-up, times or numbers.","source":"[CBA U12 camp plan (media report)](https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260829A059G300)","sourceUrl":"https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260829A059G300","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"从防守姿势和滑步开始练：横向滑步、向后之字形滑步，以及滑步接冲刺和变向。原报告没有给出场地布置、时间或次数。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Gauntlet Dribbling","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Gauntlet Dribbling","nameZh":"闯关运球","howItRuns":"Cones split a half court into 3 lanes, with 2 to 3 defenders in each lane who may only move side to side. One attacker per lane starts at half court, dribbles through the defenders and finishes with a lay-up or jump shot. The defenders try to steal the ball or knock it out of bounds. Then the defender nearest half court joins the attacking line, every defender moves up one spot, and the finisher takes the spot nearest the hoop. When everyone has gone, the first player starts again in the opposite direction. Next step: limit the dribbles, or defenders dribble their own ball.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/), 9","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用标志桶把半场分成3条通道，每条通道里有2–3名防守人，防守人只能左右移动。每条通道一名进攻人从半场出发，运球突破防守人，最后上篮或跳投完成。防守人设法抢断，或把球打出界。之后，最靠近半场的防守人加入进攻队列，其余防守人各向前移一个位置，完成进攻的球员补到最靠近篮筐的位置。所有人都轮完后，从第一名球员开始，反方向再来。进阶：限制运球次数，或让防守人自己也运一个球。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Partner Decision Dribbling Game","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Partner Decision Dribbling Game","nameZh":"看手势决策运球","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball. The dribbler faces the hoop; the partner stands a few feet away with their back to the hoop and gives hand signals while the dribbler moves. \"Hands Up\" means pass, \"Hip Flip\" means drive to the basket, \"Step Backward\" means shoot. Next step: limit the dribbler to set moves, let the partner move side to side for new passing angles, or require a set shot (jump shot, lay-up or floater).","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一个球。运球者面向篮筐；搭档背对篮筐，站在几步外，在运球者移动时打手势。“举手”表示传球，“转胯”表示突破上篮，“后退一步”表示投篮。进阶：限定运球者只能用指定的运球动作；让搭档左右移动，制造新的传球角度；或指定投篮方式（跳投、上篮或抛投）。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Dribbling in the Counter-attack (Das Dribbling im Gegenangriff)","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Dribbling in the Counter-attack (Das Dribbling im Gegenangriff)","nameZh":"快攻推进运球","howItRuns":"Full court. Two players start together, dribble the length of the court at the same time and finish (lay-up, one step or Eurostep). Then the next pair goes. The maximum number of dribbles depends on level; the source gives no number. Next step: limit the dribbles, then alternate right and left hand on each dribble.","source":"[BASPO Training Forms](https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691761148/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-den-angriff-situationsangepasst-und-zielstrebig-aufbauen.pdf) p.14","sourceUrl":"https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691761148/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-den-angriff-situationsangepasst-und-zielstrebig-aufbauen.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全场。两名球员一起出发，同时运球推进全场并完成进攻（上篮、单步上篮或欧洲步）。然后下一组两人出发。最多运球次数根据水平而定，原资料没有给出具体数字。进阶：限制运球次数，再要求每运一次球左右手交替。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Between Cross Behind","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Between Cross Behind","nameZh":"胯下-变向-背后连续运球","howItRuns":"A ball each. On the coach's command, dribble the sequence between the legs, crossover, behind the back. A mistake sends the player back to start with \"between\". One full sequence is one rep; get as many reps as possible. 2 x 20 seconds. Saying the sequence aloud helps keep the order.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球。听教练口令，按“胯下—体前变向—背后”的顺序运球。出错就从“胯下”重新开始。完整做完一套算1次，尽量多做。2组×20秒。边做边大声念出顺序，有助于记住顺序。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Open Step Back Breakdown Drill","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Open Step Back Breakdown Drill","nameZh":"侧后撤步分解练习","howItRuns":"Pairs facing each other, one ball. Dribble with the right hand, wait until the bounce is nearly done, then push off the left foot to the side and back while collecting the ball. Pass to the partner, who does the same. Then the other direction. 3 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，面对面，一个球。右手运球，等这一下运球快结束时，左脚蹬地向侧后方撤步，同时收球。把球传给搭档，搭档做同样的动作。然后换另一个方向。3分钟。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Chaos Layups","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Chaos Layups","nameZh":"混乱上篮","howItRuns":"As many players with a ball as possible, split evenly across the baskets. Players start outside the three-point line and dribble the whole time. They may drive, but may shoot a lay-up only inside a set area (inside the lane lines or the restricted area), and after each attempt they dribble back outside the three-point line. The coach adds \"chaos\": weak-hand finishes only, or a time limit to see who makes the most. Next step: limit the lay-up area to one side of the basket, or add up scores in teams of three or four.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"尽可能让更多球员每人一球，平均分到各个篮筐。球员从三分线外出发，全程运球。可以突破，但只能在指定区域内上篮（限制区两条边线以内，或无撞人半圆区内），每次出手后都要运球回到三分线外。教练随时加入“混乱”规则：只能用弱侧手完成，或限时比谁投进最多。进阶：把上篮区域限定在篮筐一侧，或分成三四人一队累计得分。"},{"key":"U12|routine|1 on 1 Finishing Game","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"1 on 1 Finishing Game","nameZh":"1对1抢先终结","howItRuns":"Two players, each with a ball, on either side of the hoop, dribbling with a set hand. On the whistle both try to finish first, at the front of the rim or on the opposite side. Phase 1: only 1 dribble. Phase 2: finish on the opposite side of the rim. Phase 3: no backboard. Rotate quickly, bringing in two new players after a few rounds.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两名球员各持一球，分站篮筐两侧，用指定的手运球。哨响后，两人抢先完成进攻，在篮筐正面或对侧出手。第1阶段：只能运球1次。第2阶段：必须在篮筐对侧完成。第3阶段：不能打板。快速轮换，几轮后换两名新球员上场。"},{"key":"U12|routine|3-Person Shooting","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"3-Person Shooting","nameZh":"三人投篮","howItRuns":"Groups of three at one basket: shooter, passer and rebounder. The shooter takes 10 shots in a row. Then the shooter becomes the rebounder, the rebounder the passer and the passer the shooter. Continue until each player has taken the set number of shots; the plan prints 2 x 10 shots each.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组，一个篮筐：投篮者、传球者、篮板手。投篮者连续投10次。然后投篮者换成篮板手，篮板手换成传球者，传球者换成投篮者。一直进行到每人都投完规定次数；教案规定每人2组×10次。"},{"key":"U12|routine|2 Balls, 3 Shooters V-Cut Shooting","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"2 Balls, 3 Shooters V-Cut Shooting","nameZh":"两球三人V字切投篮","howItRuns":"Teams of three with two balls. Two players spread out and one starts near the rim with a ball. Each player makes a V-cut before receiving a pass from the teammate who has just rebounded their own shot. Shooters rebound their own shot and always pass to the same teammate: 1 to 2, 2 to 3, 3 to 1. Shoot from a different spot each time. Play one minute at a time and count makes. Next step: one dribble into a pull-up jump shot after the catch, or the passer closes out and contests.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队，两个球。两人拉开站位，一人持球站在篮下附近。每名球员先做V字切，再接刚抢到自己投篮篮板的那名队友的传球。投篮者自己抢自己的篮板，并且始终传给同一名队友：1传2，2传3，3传1。每次换一个位置投篮。每轮1分钟，统计投进数。进阶：接球后运一次球急停跳投；或传球者传球后扑防并干扰投篮。"},{"key":"U12|routine|Progression Shooting Competition","age":"U12","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Progression Shooting Competition","nameZh":"递进投篮比赛","howItRuns":"Teams spread across the baskets, one ball each. The first player takes the set shot, rebounds, passes to the next player and goes to the back of the line. Every make counts toward the team total at that spot. The progression is 8 lay-ups, 8 floaters, 8 mid-range catch-and-shoot, 8 one-dribble pull-ups starting at the 3-point line, and 8 catch-and-shoot 3s. The first team to make all shots from all spots wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"各队分散到各个篮筐，每队一个球。第一名球员按规定方式投篮，自己抢篮板，传给下一名球员，然后排到队尾。每个投进的球都计入全队在该点位的总数。递进顺序：上篮8个，抛投8个，中距离接球投篮8个，从三分线开始运一次球急停跳投8个，接球投三分8个。最先投进所有点位全部球数的队获胜。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|1 on 1 Dribble Duel","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"1 on 1 Dribble Duel","nameZh":"1对1运球对决","howItRuns":"Pairs face each other at the elbows or the top of the key, each with a ball. Both complete a dribbling task, for example 5 between-the-legs dribbles, or 2 crossovers and 2 behind-the-back. On the coach's \"Go\", or when the sequence is done, both race to finish at the rim. First to score wins. Next step: finish on the opposite side of the rim from the start, or go around a cone before finishing.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，在肘区或弧顶面对面站，各持一球。两人先完成一项运球任务，例如胯下运球5次，或体前变向2次加背后运球2次。教练喊“开始”，或做完规定动作后，两人冲向篮筐完成进攻。先投进者获胜。进阶：在出发一侧的篮筐对侧完成，或先绕过一个标志桶再完成。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|Line Battles","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Line Battles","nameZh":"禁区推进战","howItRuns":"Pairs or threes, one ball, playing inside the free-throw lane. The attacker starts on the baseline, guarded by a partner, and tries to reach the free-throw line as many times as possible in a set time or number of tries, staying inside the lane lines. Being forced out or losing the ball means restarting from the baseline. Reaching the free-throw line scores 1 point. Next step: weak hand only, or the defender starts a step ahead, shoulder to shoulder or trailing. Competitive version: a point counts only if the attacker goes into a scoring move after reaching the line.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/), 7, 10, 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人或三人一组，一个球，在限制区内进行。进攻人从底线出发，由搭档防守，在规定时间或次数内尽可能多次推进到罚球线，必须保持在限制区两条边线以内。被逼出边线或丢球，就回到底线重新开始。推进到罚球线得1分。进阶：只能用弱侧手；或防守人提前一步出发、与进攻人肩并肩出发、或从后面追防出发。比赛版：推进到罚球线后必须接着做得分动作，才算得分。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|1 on 1 – Cones","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"1 on 1 – Cones","nameZh":"1对1——摸桶","howItRuns":"Two lines at the top of the key, one nearer the wing, each with a cone on the baseline in front of it. The coach stands at the top with a ball. The first player in each line sprints to touch their cone, then sprints to the wing for 1 on 1. The player from the line nearer the wing attacks and the other defends. Maximum 3 dribbles per possession. Then the next two go. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"弧顶排两路纵队，其中一队更靠近侧翼，每队正前方的底线上各放一个标志桶。教练持球站在弧顶。两队排头分别冲刺摸自己的标志桶，再冲刺到侧翼打1对1。来自靠近侧翼那一队的球员进攻，另一人防守。每回合最多运球3次。然后下两人上。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|1 on 1 – Dribble Out","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"1 on 1 – Dribble Out","nameZh":"1对1——绕桶运球出击","howItRuns":"Two lines on the baseline near the sideline, one slightly nearer the top of the key, each with a cone in front of it between the three-point line and half court. The line nearer the sideline has the balls. On the coach's command the first two players go around their cones toward the middle, the ball handler dribbling the whole way, and then play 1 on 1. Then the next two go. Use the other side or other baskets for more turns. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在靠近边线的底线处排两路纵队，其中一队稍靠近弧顶方向，每队前方在三分线和半场之间各放一个标志桶。靠近边线的一队持球。听教练口令，两队排头绕过各自的标志桶向中路移动，持球人全程运球，然后打1对1。然后下两人上。可以利用另一侧或其他篮筐增加轮次。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|On the Block 1 on 1 Game","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"On the Block 1 on 1 Game","nameZh":"低位1对1","howItRuns":"Two lines on the baseline, with a player standing on each block. The coach has the ball at the free-throw line and passes to one of them. That player has at most 1 dribble to take a shot and may not move backwards. The player who did not get the pass defends. Play until the defence gets the ball or the attacker scores. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/), 10; All-Star Plan 4","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"底线排两路纵队，两侧低位卡位点各站一人。教练在罚球线持球，传给其中一人。接球者最多运球1次就要出手，而且不能后退。没接到球的人防守。打到防守方得球或进攻方得分为止。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|Elbows 1 on 1 Game","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Elbows 1 on 1 Game","nameZh":"肘区1对1","howItRuns":"Two lines on the baseline, with a player standing on each elbow. The coach has the ball at the top of the key and passes to one of them. That player has at most 2 dribbles to take a shot in the paint. The player who did not get the pass defends. Play until the defence gets the ball or the attacker scores. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"底线排两路纵队，两侧肘区各站一人。教练在弧顶持球，传给其中一人。接球者最多运球2次，必须在限制区内出手。没接到球的人防守。打到防守方得球或进攻方得分为止。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|Full Court 2 on 2","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Full Court 2 on 2","nameZh":"全场2对2","howItRuns":"The full court is divided into two halves, each with a line on the baseline and a line at or near half court. A baseline attacker with the ball, guarded by one defender, tries to reach half court while staying within the lane. There a second attacker and defender join, and the 1 on 1 becomes 2 on 2. The second attacker starts with a different advantage each time: the defender on the hip, or a few steps behind. Next step: the attacker who starts with the ball must pass and try to score off a pass and cut. The plan gives no win condition.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全场分成两个半场，每个半场在底线排一队，在半场线上或附近排一队。底线的进攻人持球，由一名防守人防守，在限制区宽度的通道内推进到半场。到半场后，第二名进攻人和防守人加入，1对1变成2对2。第二名进攻人每次以不同的优势出发：防守人贴在他髋侧，或落后几步。进阶：开始持球的进攻人必须传球，并通过传切配合得分。教案没有给出胜负规则。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|2 on 2 Around the Cone","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"2 on 2 Around the Cone","nameZh":"绕桶2对2","howItRuns":"A cone on the weak-side wing. One attacker starts in front of a defender under the rim; the second attacker is in the corner with their defender in help position. The ball handler dribbles around the cone with the defender trailing, which gives a live 2 on 2 with a slight advantage to the offence. After a few turns, move the second attacker from the corner to the wing. Next step: the second attacker may start anywhere inside the three-point line, a second cone goes in the opposite corner, and the ball handler chooses which cone to go around. The plan gives no win condition.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在弱侧侧翼放一个标志桶。一名进攻人站在篮下、防守人前面出发；第二名进攻人在底角，他的防守人站在协防位置。持球人运球绕过标志桶，防守人从后面追防，形成进攻方略占优势的实战2对2。几轮后，把第二名进攻人从底角移到侧翼。进阶：第二名进攻人可以从三分线内任意位置出发；在对侧底角再放一个标志桶，由持球人选择绕哪一个。教案没有给出胜负规则。"},{"key":"U12|smallGames|2 on 2 Slide Up (Nachrutschen)","age":"U12","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"2 on 2 Slide Up (Nachrutschen)","nameZh":"2对2依次补位","howItRuns":"Two 2 on 2 games side by side across the hall, with the other players on benches along the halfway line. The first team to score stays on. Two newcomers come on and new teams form, each winner with a newcomer. The losers go to the end of the benches and everyone moves up. A basket counts; if nobody scores, a hit on the rim or board may count. Next step: two or three hits to win, or 4 on 4.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.13","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"场地横向并排进行两场2对2，其余球员坐在中线旁的长凳上。先得分的队留在场上。两名新人上场，重新组队：每名胜者各搭配一名新人。输的人坐到长凳末尾，其他人依次往前挪。投进算得分；如果都投不进，打中篮筐或篮板也可以算。进阶：打中两次或三次才算赢，或改为4对4。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Pull Back 1 on 1 Game","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1 with the ball","kind":"activity","name":"Pull Back 1 on 1 Game","nameZh":"后拉步1对1","howItRuns":"Pairs, with three pairs spaced around the arc. The attacker pushes off the left foot and takes a long step forward on the right, swinging the ball low by the right foot to create space while the defender crowds without stealing. The attacker then pushes back off the right foot and pulls the ball back with one bounce, left foot as the pivot foot. Then the attacker shoots if there is space or attacks the basket, and it is live 1 on 1. Switch roles regularly and alternate pivot feet.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，三组沿三分弧分散站位。进攻人左脚蹬地，右脚向前跨一大步，把球低摆到右脚旁，拉开空间；防守人贴近施压，但不抢断。然后进攻人右脚蹬地后撤，运一次球把球拉回来，以左脚为中枢脚。接着有空间就投篮，否则突破攻篮，进入实战1对1。定期交换攻防，并交替使用左右中枢脚。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Pivot 1 on 1","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1 with the ball","kind":"activity","name":"Pivot 1 on 1","nameZh":"转身1对1","howItRuns":"Pairs inside the three-point line, one ball. The defender starts a few steps away and passes to the attacker to start. The attacker may not dribble and must pivot to create space for a shot while the defender pressures; the attacker tries to finish with a lay-up or shot. Switch after a shot or a steal. After a few rounds, allow 1 dribble before pivoting. Next step: change the starting spot, set a time limit to score, or name the pivot (front, reverse, step-through).","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，在三分线内，一个球。防守人站在几步外，传球给进攻人开始。进攻人不能运球，必须用转身制造投篮空间，防守人施压；进攻人争取上篮或投篮完成。出手或被抢断后交换。几轮后，允许转身前运球1次。进阶：改变出发位置；限定得分时间；或指定转身方式（前转身、后转身、跨步穿越）。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Three-quarter 1 on 1 (Dreiviertel 1 gegen 1)","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1 with the ball","kind":"activity","name":"Three-quarter 1 on 1 (Dreiviertel 1 gegen 1)","nameZh":"四分之三场1对1","howItRuns":"The court is halved lengthwise. Pairs with one ball start at the baseline, with space between groups. At about free-throw-line height the ball carrier hands or passes the ball to the partner and becomes the defender; the partner attacks the remaining three quarters. Three intensity levels: 50%, defend only up to the three-point line, then \"check\" and play 1 on 1; 75%, defend from the start and give the ball back after a steal; 100%, a steal ends the action. Next step: hand over only at half way, limit the dribbles, change direction, or play across to side baskets.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.11","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"球场纵向分成两半。两人一组一个球，从底线出发，各组之间留出间隔。大约到罚球线高度时，持球人把球递给或传给搭档，自己转为防守；搭档向剩下的四分之三场进攻。三种强度：50%——只防到三分线，然后交球确认（check）再打1对1；75%——从一开始就防守，抢断后把球还给对方；100%——一旦抢断，该回合结束。进阶：改为到半场才交球、限制运球次数、改变方向，或横向攻侧面的篮筐。"},{"key":"U12|compete|1 on 1 Half-court","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"oneOnOne","group":"1 on 1 with the ball","kind":"activity","name":"1 on 1 Half-court","nameZh":"半场1对1","howItRuns":"Pairs at or near half court, up to 4 pairs per half court. Against live defence, the attacker must dribble from half court to the baseline within 8 seconds, up and back 3 times. Round 1: the defender starts in front. Round 2: shoulder to shoulder. Round 3: slightly behind and a few steps to the side. Then switch roles. The attacker scores 1 point for each crossing within 8 seconds.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，在半场线上或附近，每个半场最多4组。面对实战防守，进攻人必须在8秒内从半场运球推进到底线，往返3次。第1轮：防守人在正前方出发。第2轮：两人肩并肩出发。第3轮：防守人稍落后，并偏向一侧几步出发。然后交换攻防。进攻人每在8秒内完成一次推进得1分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Call for and Receive the Ball on the Move (Den Ball aus der Bewegung heraus verlangen und annehmen)","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Moving without the ball","kind":"activity","name":"Call for and Receive the Ball on the Move (Den Ball aus der Bewegung heraus verlangen und annehmen)","nameZh":"移动中要球和接球","howItRuns":"Half court, with 2 to 3 players holding a ball and 6 to 7 without. Players without the ball move and offer a target to receive a pass. Progression: the quality of the stop and catch; then the timing of catch, pass, catch; then stop after the catch and start with a dribble; then start with a dribble after the catch and pass straight off the dribble.","source":"[BASPO Training Forms](https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691761148/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-den-angriff-situationsangepasst-und-zielstrebig-aufbauen.pdf) p.15–16","sourceUrl":"https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691761148/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-den-angriff-situationsangepasst-und-zielstrebig-aufbauen.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"半场，2–3名球员持球，6–7名球员不持球。无球球员跑动，为传球者提供接球目标。递进：先抓急停和接球的质量；然后抓接球—传球—接球的节奏；然后接球后急停，再运球启动；然后接球后运球启动，并在运球中直接传球。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Pass, Cut & Replace Drill","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Moving without the ball","kind":"activity","name":"Pass, Cut & Replace Drill","nameZh":"传切补位练习","howItRuns":"A line on each wing and one player with the ball at the top of the key. The top player passes to a wing and cuts to the basket looking for the return pass. The wing without the ball replaces the cutter at the top, and the cutter goes to the back of the line on that wing. The wing with the ball passes to the top; that player reverses the ball to the opposite wing and cuts, and the sequence repeats.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧侧翼各排一队，弧顶一名球员持球。弧顶球员传给一侧侧翼，然后空切篮下，寻找回传。另一侧没球的侧翼补到弧顶，空切者排到这一侧侧翼的队尾。持球的侧翼把球传回弧顶；弧顶球员把球转移到另一侧侧翼并空切，如此循环。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Purposeful movement, 4 on 4","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Moving without the ball","kind":"activity","name":"Purposeful movement, 4 on 4","nameZh":"有目的的跑动 4对4","howItRuns":"FIBA's teaching sequence for four players. Player 2 leads for the ball and faces the basket after the catch; player 1 cuts after passing. A defender is added, and 2 is encouraged to back cut when they cannot receive on the perimeter. After 2 back cuts, 3 replaces by cutting to the perimeter, and 2 moves to the spot 3 started from. Then 4 replaces 3, and 2 moves to where 4 started. Finish by reversing the ball from one side to the other. Start with no or few defenders, then let them play; give instructions on the run without stopping the activity, or stop for no more than a minute, as in a time-out. Start positions are shown in the manual's diagrams.","source":"Mini p.46–47","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"FIBA针对四名球员的教学步骤。2号上提要球，接球后面向篮筐；1号传球后空切。加入一名防守人，2号在外线接不到球时，鼓励他反跑（背切）。2号反跑后，3号切到外线补位，2号移到3号的起始位置。然后4号补3号的位置，2号移到4号的起始位置。最后把球从一侧转移到另一侧收尾。开始时不设或少设防守人，然后放开打；不停下练习，边打边指导，或者像暂停一样停下，但不超过1分钟。起始站位见手册中的示意图。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Get Open 1 on 1 from Wing","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Moving without the ball","kind":"activity","name":"Get Open 1 on 1 from Wing","nameZh":"侧翼摆脱1对1","howItRuns":"An attacker and a defender on each wing, with a coach or passer at the top of the key; up to 2 groups per half court. The attacker passes to the coach, and the defender denies the return pass. The attacker must get open in 5 seconds or less and catch near or behind the 3-point arc. When the coach passes back it is live 1 on 1, with 3 dribbles to score after the catch and finishes in the paint only. The attacker then defends and the defender goes out.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个侧翼一名进攻人和一名防守人，弧顶一名教练或传球者；每个半场最多2组。进攻人把球传给教练，防守人阻断回传线路。进攻人必须在5秒内摆脱，并在三分线附近或三分线外接球。教练回传后进入实战1对1，接球后最多运球3次得分，只能在限制区内完成出手。之后进攻人转防守，防守人下场。"},{"key":"U12|compete|3-Second Deny 1 on 1","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Moving without the ball","kind":"activity","name":"3-Second Deny 1 on 1","nameZh":"3秒绕前1对1","howItRuns":"An attacker and a defender on each wing, with a coach or player holding the ball at the top of the key; 2 groups per half court. The defender denies the ball for 3 seconds while the attacker cuts to the block and back out to the wing. After 3 seconds the passer tries to pass in, and it is live 1 on 1. The attacker then defends and the defender goes to the end of the line. Next step: 5 seconds to score after the catch. Competitive version: 1 point for a deflection and 3 for a steal, with each player keeping their own score.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个侧翼一名进攻人和一名防守人，弧顶一名教练或球员持球；每个半场2组。防守人绕前阻断传球3秒，进攻人切到低位卡位点再切回侧翼。3秒后，传球者设法把球传进去，进入实战1对1。之后进攻人转防守，防守人排到队尾。进阶：接球后5秒内必须得分。比赛版：碰球得1分，抢断得3分，每人自己记分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|3-Person Pass, Cut and Replace","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Moving without the ball","kind":"activity","name":"3-Person Pass, Cut and Replace","nameZh":"三人传切补位","howItRuns":"Teams of three: attackers on each wing and at the top of the key with the ball, each guarded by a defender who may not steal until the coach's whistle. The top player passes to a wing and cuts to the basket; the wing without the ball replaces at the top, and the cutter fills the empty wing. The offence repeats this while the defenders move with their players. On the whistle it is live. A score is 1 point, and that team stays on against a new defence. A steal or defensive rebound is a turnover, and a new defence comes in.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队：两侧侧翼和弧顶各一名进攻人，弧顶持球，每人对位一名防守人，教练吹哨前防守人不得抢断。弧顶球员传给一侧侧翼并空切篮下；另一侧无球的侧翼补到弧顶，空切者补到空出的侧翼。进攻方重复这个跑位，防守人跟着各自的对手移动。哨响后进入实战。得分得1分，该队留在场上，对抗新的防守队。被抢断或被对方抢到防守篮板算失误，换一组新的防守队上场。"},{"key":"U12|compete|3 on 3 Deny","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Moving without the ball","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 3 Deny","nameZh":"3对3绕前防守","howItRuns":"Teams of three, lined up outside the three-point line. Attackers may only dribble sideways around the arc and may not drive. Defenders deny every pass by overplaying the passing lanes. The offence may score only from a backdoor pass, and each possession lasts 5 to 7 seconds; once a backdoor cutter gets the ball, play is live. Each team gets 3 to 5 possessions in a row, then new teams rotate in. Scoring: a steal is 1 point, a lay-up off a backdoor cut 2 points, any other score 1 point.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队，站在三分线外。进攻人只能沿三分弧横向运球，不能突破。防守人对每一次传球都绕前，抢占传球线路。进攻方只能通过反跑（背切）接传球得分，每回合5–7秒；反跑的球员一接到球，就进入实战。每队连续打3–5个回合，然后换新队上场。计分：抢断1分，反跑上篮2分，其他得分1分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Defending the 2-on-1 Drill","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing, drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"Defending the 2-on-1 Drill","nameZh":"1防2练习","howItRuns":"One player at the top of the key with a ball, one in the short corner on the same side, and one defender starting at the block who must guard both. The top player either goes for a lay-up or passes. After a pass, the corner player must catch and shoot, and the defender works on contesting that shot.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一人持球在弧顶，同侧短底角一人，一名防守人从低位卡位点出发，要同时防这两个人。弧顶球员选择上篮或传球。传球后，底角球员必须接球就投，防守人练习干扰这次投篮。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Dunker Spot 2 on 1","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing, drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"Dunker Spot 2 on 1","nameZh":"扣篮区2打1","howItRuns":"Two attackers and one defender at each basket. The attackers start in the dunker spots, along the baseline just outside the lane but not quite in the short corner; the defender plays in the middle. The defender or a coach passes to one attacker to start, and the two play 2 on 1 to finish at the rim. Next step: 2 or 3 passes before a shot; no dribble or only one; or a third attacker near the free-throw line and a second defender for 3 on 2.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个篮筐两名进攻人、一名防守人。进攻人从扣篮区出发——沿底线、紧贴限制区外侧，但还没到短底角；防守人在中间。由防守人或教练传球给一名进攻人开始，两人2打1，在篮下完成。进阶：出手前要传2–3次球；不能运球或只能运一次；或在罚球线附近加第三名进攻人、加第二名防守人，打3打2。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Skip Pass 2 on 1","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing, drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"Skip Pass 2 on 1","nameZh":"跨场传球2打1","howItRuns":"Two lines, one on each wing; one line has the balls, and one defender starts under the basket. The player with the ball makes a skip pass to the opposite wing, and the receiver attacks the basket on the catch. At the same time the defender runs to touch either block, and then it is live 2 on 1. The attacker reads the defender and either drives to score or drives and kicks to the opposite wing. Maximum 2 passes. Next step: a defender on the ball for the skip pass, who steps off after it. FIBA says skip passes \"may not be suitable at this age group\" and that reversing the ball achieves the same result (Mini p.43).","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧侧翼各排一队，其中一队持球，一名防守人从篮下出发。持球人跨场传给对侧侧翼，接球者接球即攻篮。同时，防守人跑去摸任意一侧的低位卡位点，然后进入实战2打1。进攻人读防守人：自己突破得分，或突破分球给对侧侧翼。最多传2次。进阶：跨场传球时有一名防守人防持球人，传球出手后他退出。FIBA指出，跨场传球“可能不适合这个年龄段”，通过转移球也能达到同样的效果（Mini 第43页）。"},{"key":"U12|compete|2 on 1 Bunch Spacing Game","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing, drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 1 Bunch Spacing Game","nameZh":"2打1抱团拉开","howItRuns":"Groups of three, two attackers and one defender, all bunched together with one hand each on the ball. Play is live when an attacker grabs the ball. The offence must spread out at once, not lined up \"3 in a row\", then pass, move and look to score while keeping good spacing. The offence plays 3 or 4 possessions in a row, then roles change. Plan 11 plays it with no dribbling, so the offence must pass and cut. Next step: one side of the court only, or a second defender for 3 on 2. Competitive version: points for baskets or for keeping spacing for a set time.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/), 11, 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组，两攻一防，三人挤在一起，每人一只手放在球上。进攻人一把球抢到手，即进入实战。进攻方必须马上拉开，不能“三人站成一排”，然后传球、跑动、寻找得分机会，同时保持良好的间距。进攻方连续打3–4个回合，然后交换角色。教案第11课的版本不允许运球，进攻方必须靠传切。进阶：只用半边场地，或加第二名防守人打3打2。比赛版：投进得分，或在规定时间内保持好间距得分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|3 on 1 Drive and Kick Reaction","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing, drive and kick","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 1 Drive and Kick Reaction","nameZh":"3打1突破分球反应","howItRuns":"Three attackers around the three-point line (top and both wings). One defender in the middle holds a ball and passes to start. The offence passes until a wing drives to the basket, and the other two space themselves in reaction to the drive. The defender must take one of them away, and the driver passes based on the defender's position. For the first few reps the coach does not set the off-ball spacing. Change the set number of passes so the drive comes from a different spot each time. Next step: extra defenders for 3 on 2 or 3 on 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/), 4, 5","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三名进攻人站在三分线附近（弧顶和两侧侧翼）。一名防守人在中间持球，传球开始。进攻方传球，直到一名侧翼突破篮下，另外两人根据突破调整站位、拉开空间。防守人必须封住其中一人，突破者根据防守人的位置传球。前几次教练不规定无球人的站位。改变规定的传球次数，让每次突破从不同位置发起。进阶：增加防守人，打3打2或3对3。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Contested Shooting Game","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Contested Shooting Game","nameZh":"干扰投篮比赛","howItRuns":"An attacker on each elbow and a line under the hoop; use as many hoops as possible. One elbow player shoots and the other contests. The first player under the hoop passes to the shooter, and as soon as the pass leaves the passer's hand the defender sprints to contest. Rotate through the roles quickly. After a few rounds, the shooter takes one stationary dribble before shooting, and the defender may go only on the catch. Then change the contest angle to the baseline, or the shot spot. Count makes, individually or as teams, for a set time or to a set number.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧肘区各一名进攻人，篮下排一队；尽量多用篮筐。一侧肘区的球员投篮，另一侧的负责干扰。篮下排头传球给投篮者，球一离开传球者的手，防守人立刻冲刺扑防干扰。快速轮换角色。几轮后，投篮者原地运一次球再投，防守人只能在投篮者接球时启动。然后把干扰方向改为从底线一侧，或改变投篮点。按个人或分队统计投进数，限时进行或先达到规定数。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Hot Shot Shooting","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"Hot Shot Shooting","nameZh":"热手投篮","howItRuns":"Groups of three: shooter, defender and passer-rebounder. The defender starts facing the passer, with space between them and the shooter. The shooter moves one way to get free before the pass. The defender contests at the level the coach sets: guided (close out and contest without blocking) or live (may fully challenge the shot). Coaches may add one dribble before the shot, a drive on the catch, or a choice to shoot or drive. Bursts of five shots per player, with optional scoring such as 1 point per make.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组：投篮者、防守人、传球兼篮板手。防守人开始时面向传球者，与投篮者之间留出距离。投篮者先向一侧移动摆脱，再接传球。防守人按教练设定的强度干扰：引导式（扑防并干扰，但不盖帽）或实战式（可以全力封盖）。教练可以加入：投篮前运一次球、接球就突破，或自己选择投篮还是突破。每人连续投5次为一组，可选计分，例如投进一个得1分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|1 on 1 Create Space","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting against a defender","kind":"activity","name":"1 on 1 Create Space","nameZh":"1对1创造投篮空间","howItRuns":"Pairs, up to 3 per basket. The attacker starts with the ball outside the arc or in the mid-range, with the defender within arm's distance. The attacker may use up to 2 dribbles to create space for a pull-up jump shot and may not enter the paint. The defender may not steal but may distract the shooter in any way. Switch after 3 reps. Next step: the defender may not move until the attacker dribbles, and a false start that fools the defender earns a bonus point; later, the defender may steal.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，每个篮筐最多3组。进攻人持球从三分线外或中距离出发，防守人在一臂距离内。进攻人最多运球2次，为急停跳投创造空间，不能进入限制区。防守人不能抢断，但可以用任何方式干扰投篮者。做3次后交换。进阶：进攻人运球前防守人不能动，进攻人用假启动骗到防守人，奖励1分；之后允许防守人抢断。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Jump to the Ball Drill","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts and help defence","kind":"activity","name":"Jump to the Ball Drill","nameZh":"向球跳步防守练习","howItRuns":"One line on the baseline, a player on each wing, and the coach at the top with the ball. The first baseline player sprints to close out on the coach. The coach passes to either wing, and on the pass the defender jumps to the ball in a good defensive stance. The receiver takes 1 to 2 dribbles toward the middle, sees the defender, retreat-dribbles and drives baseline for a lay-up. The defender fills the open wing, and the wing player goes to the back of the baseline line. A new player passes to the coach and closes out. 4 times each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"底线排一队，两侧侧翼各一人，教练持球在弧顶。底线排头冲刺扑防教练。教练传给任意一侧侧翼，球一传出，防守人以良好的防守姿势向球跳步移位。接球者向中路运1–2次球，看到防守人后后撤运球，再沿底线突破上篮。防守人补到空出的侧翼，侧翼球员排到底线队尾。新的球员传球给教练并扑防。每侧4次。"},{"key":"U12|compete|2-Person Closeout Drill","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts and help defence","kind":"activity","name":"2-Person Closeout Drill","nameZh":"两人扑防练习","howItRuns":"A coach with the ball on one wing, another coach or player on the other wing, and two lines on the baseline. The defender guarding the ball calls \"ball, ball, ball!\". When the ball goes to the other wing, that defender jumps to help, calling \"help, help, help!\", and a player from the other line closes out on the ball. When the ball comes back, the closeout player becomes the helper, a new player closes out, and the first defender leaves. On the whistle or \"LIVE\", the player with the ball looks to drive and score, and it is live 2 on 2 to a score or a stop.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一名教练持球在一侧侧翼，另一名教练或球员在另一侧侧翼，底线排两队。防持球人的防守人喊“球、球、球！”。球传到另一侧侧翼时，这名防守人跳到协防位置，喊“协防、协防、协防！”，另一队的一名球员冲出扑防持球人。球传回来时，扑防的球员变成协防者，换一名新球员扑防，第一名防守人离开。听到哨声或“开打（LIVE）”后，持球人寻找突破得分机会，进入实战2对2，打到得分或防守成功为止。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Closeout 1 on 1 Drill","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts and help defence","kind":"activity","name":"Closeout 1 on 1 Drill","nameZh":"扑防1对1练习","howItRuns":"A passer at the top of the key, an attacker on the wing and a defender at the free-throw line; run several games at each hoop. The passer passes to the wing and the defender closes out. On the catch it is live, with 3 dribbles to score. The attacker scores two or three points for a basket; the defender gets one point for each stop (steal or rebound). Then the defender goes to the passing spot, the passer to the wing, the wing player off, and a new defender comes in.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"弧顶一名传球者，侧翼一名进攻人，罚球线一名防守人；每个篮筐可同时进行几组。传球者传给侧翼，防守人扑防。接球即进入实战，最多运球3次得分。进攻人投进得2分或3分；防守人每次防守成功（抢断或抢到篮板）得1分。之后防守人去传球位置，传球者去侧翼，侧翼球员下场，换一名新的防守人上来。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Tracing the Ball 2 on 2 Game","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts and help defence","kind":"activity","name":"Tracing the Ball 2 on 2 Game","nameZh":"跟球手2对2","howItRuns":"Two attackers stand 12 to 15 feet (about 3.5 to 4.5 m) from the basket and 5 to 6 feet (about 1.5 to 2 m) apart. Two defenders with balls start under the basket. The defenders pass to the attackers, close out and trace the ball. One attacker passes their ball to a coach, and it becomes live 2 on 2: the passer may cut at once, and the other attacker may dribble and attack or shoot. The offence has 5 seconds to score. Rotation as printed: the attackers become the defenders and two new defenders come in; the plan does not say who attacks next.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两名进攻人站在距篮筐约3.5–4.5米处，两人相距约1.5–2米。两名防守人各持一球，从篮下出发。防守人把球传给进攻人，随即扑防，并用手跟随球的移动（跟球手）。其中一名进攻人把自己的球传给教练，进入实战2对2：传球者可以马上空切，另一名进攻人可以运球进攻或投篮。进攻方有5秒得分。教案写的轮换方式是：进攻人转为防守人，换两名新防守人上来；教案没有说明下一轮由谁进攻。"},{"key":"U12|compete|2 on 2 Closeout","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts and help defence","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 2 Closeout","nameZh":"2对2扑防","howItRuns":"One attacker on the wing and one at the top of the key, two lines on the baseline across from them, and a coach with the ball. When the coach passes to one attacker, the first two baseline players close out to the ball or to help, and they play 2 on 2. Each team gets 1 shot. The attacking pair goes off, the defending pair attacks, and the next baseline pair closes out. Games to 5.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一名进攻人在侧翼，一名在弧顶，底线在他们对面排两队，教练持球。教练传给其中一名进攻人时，底线两队排头冲出，分别扑防持球人或协防，打2对2。每队只有1次出手机会。进攻组下场，防守组转进攻，底线下一组上来扑防。每局先得5分者胜。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Shell Drill – 4 on 4","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts and help defence","kind":"activity","name":"Shell Drill – 4 on 4","nameZh":"4对4贝壳防守（Shell）","howItRuns":"Teams of four, one on offence and one on defence. The offence has only perimeter players and no post players. After 5 passes the ball is live and the offence may try to score. Switch teams every possession. Next step: the offence may score only from a drive and kick-out.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四人一队，一队进攻，一队防守。进攻方只有外线球员，没有内线球员。传满5次球后转为实战，进攻方可以尝试得分。每个回合交换攻防。进阶：进攻方只能通过突破分球得分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|3-Second Box Out Game","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"rebounding","group":"Rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"3-Second Box Out Game","nameZh":"3秒卡位比赛","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball, placed on the floor. Players take four steps away from the ball, and the defender faces the attacker with their back to the ball. When the coach yells \"shot\", the defender makes contact and boxes out while the attacker tries to touch the ball; the defender tries to hold for 3 seconds. Switch roles. The defence gets 1 point for each 3-second hold; the offence gets 2 points each time it touches the ball. Play for 2 minutes, with players keeping their own score.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 11](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/11/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/11/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一个球放在地上。两人从球的位置走开四步，防守人背对球、面向进攻人。教练喊“投篮”时，防守人身体接触并卡位，进攻人设法摸到球；防守人争取卡住3秒。交换角色。防守方每卡住3秒得1分；进攻方每摸到一次球得2分。进行2分钟，球员自己记分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|1-on-1 Box Out Game","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"rebounding","group":"Rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"1-on-1 Box Out Game","nameZh":"1对1卡位比赛","howItRuns":"Groups of three with one ball; several groups can share a hoop. A shooter shoots from random spots, and the other two, one attacking and one defending, battle for the rebound. The rebounder tries to finish against the defender, and play goes on until a score or the coach calls \"time\". Rotate roles after a few rounds. 1 point for a rebound and 1 for a basket; after a set time the top scorer at each hoop wins. Next step: add a player guarding the shooter, so it becomes live 2 on 2 off the rebound, with the shooter's teammate named first.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组，一个球；几组可共用一个篮筐。投篮者在随机位置投篮，另外两人一攻一防争抢篮板。抢到篮板的人面对防守人继续完成进攻，打到得分或教练喊“停”为止。几轮后轮换角色。抢到篮板得1分，投进得1分；规定时间结束后，每个篮筐得分最高者获胜。进阶：加一名防守投篮者的球员，抢篮板后就变成实战2对2，事先指定投篮者的队友是谁。"},{"key":"U12|compete|2 on 2 Box Out Game / 3 on 3 Rebounding Battle","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"rebounding","group":"Rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 2 Box Out Game / 3 on 3 Rebounding Battle","nameZh":"2对2卡位 / 3对3篮板大战","howItRuns":"Two teams of two (Starter) or three (All-Star) start under the basket, moving in a circle, with no set offence or defence. The coach or a player throws the ball at the rim. Both teams box out, and the team that rebounds becomes the offence. If the other team steals or rebounds a miss, it must take the ball back behind the three-point line. Play until a score or the coach calls time, then two new teams come in. Each team gets 2 to 3 turns, and teams track scores to find the winner.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/), 7; All-Star Plan 4","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，每队两人（Starter级）或三人（All-Star级），从篮下出发，绕圈移动，不分固定攻防。教练或一名球员把球扔向篮筐。两队都卡位，抢到篮板的队转为进攻。如果另一队抢断或抢到投失的篮板，必须先把球带回三分线外。打到得分或教练喊停，然后换两支新队上场。每队轮2–3次，各队记分，决出胜者。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Square Rebounding","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"rebounding","group":"Rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Square Rebounding","nameZh":"四角篮板","howItRuns":"Four attackers in a square (both blocks and both elbows), each matched by a defender; the coach has the ball at the top of the key or on the wing. Before shooting, the coach calls a rotation: \"across\", \"up and down\" or \"diagonal\", and the defenders rotate and box out in that direction. On the coach's shot, make or miss, play is live. If the offence rebounds, it plays live half court to a score, stop or turnover. If the defence rebounds, it goes into live full-court transition.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四名进攻人站成正方形（两侧低位卡位点和两侧肘区），每人对位一名防守人；教练持球在弧顶或侧翼。投篮前，教练喊出轮转方式：“横向”“上下”或“对角”，防守人按该方向轮转并卡位。教练投篮后，不论投进还是投失，都进入实战。如果进攻方抢到篮板，继续打实战半场，直到得分、防守成功或失误。如果防守方抢到篮板，转入实战全场攻防转换。"},{"key":"U12|compete|Chaos Rebounding","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"rebounding","group":"Rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Chaos Rebounding","nameZh":"混战篮板","howItRuns":"2 on 2 or 3 on 3 in the half court, with extra players on the sideline to rotate in. The coach shoots, or passes to a player who must shoot at once; the defence does not contest this first shot. Once the shot goes up, play is live, and either team can rebound and try to score. Play to a score, or stay live on every rebound until a target such as the first team to two baskets. Next step: a 5-second shot clock, a pass before scoring, or the first shot from outside the lane. Competitive version: bonus points for offensive rebounds that lead straight to a basket.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"半场2对2或3对3，其余球员在边线等候轮换上场。教练投篮，或传给一名必须立即出手的球员；防守方不干扰这第一次投篮。球一出手就进入实战，双方都可以抢篮板并尝试得分。打到得分为止，或每个篮板后都继续实战，直到达成目标，例如先投进两球的队获胜。进阶：5秒进攻计时、得分前必须传一次球，或第一次投篮必须在限制区外。比赛版：抢到进攻篮板后直接得分，额外加分。"},{"key":"U12|compete|3-Cone Game (3-Hütchen-Spiel)","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Transition","kind":"activity","name":"3-Cone Game (3-Hütchen-Spiel)","nameZh":"三桶游戏","howItRuns":"Groups of three on the baseline with one ball; cones in the middle and on each side. 3 on 0: the ball carrier dribbles to touch the middle cone while the other two touch the side cones (never the same one), then they attack the basket with at most two passes. 3 on 1: one defender from the next group may start defending; their two teammates join only after that defender wins the ball or a basket is scored. 3 on 2: two defenders. 3 on 3: all three defenders must first touch a side marker; a far marker gives a fast break, a close one a 3 on 3 game.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.16","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组站在底线，一个球；中间和两侧各放一个标志桶。3打0：持球人运球去摸中间的标志桶，另外两人去摸两侧的标志桶（不能摸同一个），然后最多传两次球攻篮。3打1：下一组的一名防守人可以开始防守；他的两名队友要等他抢到球或进攻方投进后才加入。3打2：两名防守人。3对3：三名防守人都必须先摸一个侧面的标志物；摸远处的标志物就形成快攻，摸近处的就形成3对3比赛。"},{"key":"U12|compete|3 on 1 Transition","age":"U12","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Transition","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 1 Transition","nameZh":"3打1攻防转换","howItRuns":"Teams of four, each lined up in one of the four corners of the court; one ball. One player from each team starts: three on offence with the ball at half court, and one on defence guarding the hoop. The offence tries to score as quickly as possible. After the shot, the rebounder stays on offence and is joined by one player from each corner line on that side, and those three attack the other way. The shooter goes back on defence. After a score or turnover the drill resets with players from the corners. Competitive version: 1 point per steal or rebound; top scorer after a set time wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四人一队，每队排在球场四个角中的一个角；一个球。每队各出一人：三人持球在半场进攻，一人在篮下防守。进攻方尽快得分。投篮后，抢到篮板的人留在进攻方，该侧两个角的队伍各出一人与他会合，三人向另一端进攻。投篮者转为防守。得分或失误后，由各角的球员重新开始。比赛版：每次抢断或抢到篮板得1分，规定时间后得分最高者获胜。"},{"key":"U12|game|3 on 3 Continuous","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 Continuous","nameZh":"3对3连续攻防","howItRuns":"Teams of three, full court. One team starts at half court with the ball, and two teams start on defence, one at each end; extra teams line up on the baselines at both ends. The offence attacks one basket. A score earns 1 point and keeps the ball to attack the other way. A waiting baseline team replaces the defence that was scored on; if none is waiting, that defence stays on. Whenever a defence gets a stop, it takes the ball the other way. All-Star plays to 3 makes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/9/); All-Star Plan 1, 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队，全场。一队持球从半场出发进攻，另两队分别在两端防守；其余队伍在两端底线排队等候。进攻方进攻一个篮筐。投进得1分并保留球权，转向另一端进攻。被得分的防守队由底线等候的队伍替换；如果没有等候的队伍，该防守队留在场上。防守队一旦防守成功，就拿球向另一端进攻。All-Star级打到投进3球为止。"},{"key":"U12|game|3 on 3 – Defense Wins","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 – Defense Wins","nameZh":"3对3——防守为王","howItRuns":"Teams of three; use both baskets with four or more teams. The offence starts with a live ball and players move and play freely. After every change of possession the ball goes back to the top of the key. If the offence scores, it moves to defence and a new offence comes on. If the defence gets a stop, it earns 1 point, stays on defence, and a new offence comes on. Games to 4, with no \"check\" so play stays quick.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队；四队或以上时用两个篮筐。进攻方以活球开始，球员自由跑动、自由打。每次球权转换后，球都回到弧顶。进攻方投进，就转为防守，换一支新进攻队上场。防守方防守成功得1分，继续留守，换一支新进攻队上场。每局先得4分者胜，不做交球确认（check），保持比赛节奏快。"},{"key":"U12|game|3 on 3 No Dribble Game","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 No Dribble Game","nameZh":"3对3不运球比赛","howItRuns":"Teams of three; use as many hoops as possible. One team starts on offence at spots around the arc. Play live 3 on 3 with no dribbling by the offence. After a made basket or a turnover, the ball is inbounded. There is a 30-second shot clock. A team that scores twice wins the round, and new teams rotate in. Next step: 1 point for a defensive stop.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队；尽量多用篮筐。一队进攻，站在三分弧周围各点位。打实战3对3，进攻方不能运球。投进或失误后，掷界外球重新开始。进攻计时30秒。先得分两次的队赢下这一轮，然后换新队上场。进阶：防守成功得1分。"},{"key":"U12|game|Post 3 on 3 Game","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Post 3 on 3 Game","nameZh":"内线3对3","howItRuns":"Attackers and defenders on the block, the wing and the top of the key; one ball. The wing passes into the post, and once the ball is in the post it is live 3 on 3. If the defence steals or rebounds, it must clear the ball behind the three-point line. Play to a score or a set time. First team to 5 points wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"进攻人和防守人分别在低位卡位点、侧翼和弧顶；一个球。侧翼传球给内线，球一进内线，就进入实战3对3。如果防守方抢断或抢到篮板，必须先把球带出三分线外。打到得分或规定时间。先得5分的队获胜。"},{"key":"U12|game|Game on One Basket (Auf einen Korb)","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Game on One Basket (Auf einen Korb)","nameZh":"半场单篮比赛","howItRuns":"Half court, one basket; 2 on 2, 3 on 3 or 4 on 4 (4 on 4 uses one half court per game). Start with a \"check\": the attacker passes the ball low to the defender, who hands it back from below when ready. After a foul, violation, 3-second violation or out-of-bounds, the other team gets a check. After a basket play goes on, and the new attacking team must first pass or dribble outside the 3-point line. Defence is 1 on 1, no zone; the 3-second rule applies. Attackers stay at least 4 m apart and look for 1 on 1 drives first.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.14","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"半场，一个篮筐；2对2、3对3或4对4（4对4每场比赛用一个半场）。以交球确认（check）开始：进攻人把球低手传给防守人，防守人准备好后从下方把球递回。犯规、违例、3秒违例或出界后，由另一队交球确认（check）开始。投进后比赛继续，新的进攻队必须先把球传出或运出三分线外。防守为1对1人盯人，不许区域防守；执行3秒规则。进攻人之间至少相距4米，先寻找1对1突破。"},{"key":"U12|game|4 on 4 alignments","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"4 on 4 alignments","nameZh":"4对4阵型","howItRuns":"4 Out: an open post with no set post player; a player may post up after cutting to the basket, then go back out. It works on pass and cut, flash cuts and back cuts. Low Post Triangle: a post player is introduced; it works on passing to the post, cutting off the post and back cuts. High Post Triangle: the post moves to the high post; it works on back cuts, post moves facing the basket, cutting off the post and driving from the wing. All players get turns in the post and on the perimeter. Positions are in the manual's diagrams.","source":"Mini p.47; p.44","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四外（4 Out）：内线空出，不设固定内线球员；球员空切篮下后可以背身要位，然后再回到外线。练习传切配合、闪切和反跑。低位三角：加入一名内线球员；练习给内线传球、借内线切入和反跑。高位三角：内线移到高位；练习反跑、面框内线动作、借内线切入以及从侧翼突破。所有球员轮流打内线和外线。站位见手册示意图。"},{"key":"U12|game|4 on 4 Continuous with Constraints","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"4 on 4 Continuous with Constraints","nameZh":"4对4连续攻防（附加条件）","howItRuns":"Three teams of four (add substitutes to teams if numbers are odd), full court. One team starts at half court on offence; the other two defend, one at each end. After a score the offence quickly takes the ball and attacks the other basket; a defence that gets a stop becomes the offence and attacks the other basket. Constraints: a score within 7 seconds of gaining possession counts double; three defensive stops in a row win the game; once a team gains possession and crosses half court, it may switch baskets. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三队，每队四人（人数不能平均分配时给各队加替补），全场。一队在半场持球进攻；另两队分别在两端防守。得分后，进攻方迅速拿球攻向另一端；防守成功的队转为进攻，攻向另一端。附加条件：获得球权后7秒内得分，分数翻倍；连续三次防守成功即赢下比赛；一队获得球权并过半场后，可以换攻另一个篮筐。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U12|game|4 on 4 No Dribbles","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"4 on 4 No Dribbles","nameZh":"4对4不运球","howItRuns":"Teams of four play 4 on 4 with no dribbling. Encourage players to cut and move without the ball. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四人一队，打4对4，不允许运球。鼓励球员无球空切和跑动。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U12|game|5 on 5","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 on 5","nameZh":"5对5","howItRuns":"Teams of five, with substitutes if needed. Play until a team makes 3 shots, and encourage players to cut, move the ball and use the concepts they have learned. All-Star Plan 1 (\"5 on 5 Controlled\") plays 4-minute full-court games and, when a coaching point comes up, stops play, makes the point and restarts.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/), 5, 8, 12; All-Star Plan 1","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五人一队，必要时有替补。打到一队投进3球为止，鼓励球员空切、传导球，运用学过的战术概念。All-Star第1课（“5对5控制比赛”）打4分钟全场比赛，出现需要讲的要点时就停下比赛讲解，然后重新开始。"},{"key":"U12|game|5 on 5 With Constraints","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 on 5 With Constraints","nameZh":"5对5附加条件","howItRuns":"Teams of five. Only two dribbles are allowed each time a player catches the ball; more than two is a turnover. After one or two games with this rule, change it to no dribbles at all. Play 3 to 4 games of 3 minutes each. Starter Plan 11 also plays the no-dribble game on its own in 3-minute games, a dribble being a turnover; All-Star Plan 3 (\"5 on 5 Dictated – No Dribbles\") plays it full court to 3 made baskets.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/), 11; All-Star Plan 3","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五人一队。每次接球后最多运球两次；超过两次算失误。按这个规则打一两局后，改为完全不允许运球。打3–4局，每局3分钟。Starter第11课也单独进行不运球比赛，每局3分钟，运球算失误；All-Star第3课（“5对5指定规则——不运球”）打全场，先投进3球者胜。"},{"key":"U12|game|5 on 5 Dictated – Minimum 4 Passes","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 on 5 Dictated – Minimum 4 Passes","nameZh":"5对5指定规则——至少传4次","howItRuns":"Full-court games to 4 made baskets. No shot may be taken until the team with the ball has made 4 passes.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全场比赛，先投进4球者胜。持球队传满4次之前不能投篮。"},{"key":"U12|game|5 on 5 Half Court","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 on 5 Half Court","nameZh":"半场5对5","howItRuns":"Teams of five (more if there are substitutes but not enough for three teams), half court. One team defends for 5 possessions; with a third team, the offence changes every possession. A possession ends with a made shot, a rebound or a turnover; a deflection out of bounds does not end it. Each team gets 5 possessions on defence, and the team with the most stops wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五人一队（有替补但不够组成第三队时，每队可多于五人），半场。一队连续防守5个回合；如果有第三队，每个回合更换进攻队。投进、篮板或失误即结束一个回合；碰球出界不算结束。每队防守5个回合，防守成功次数最多的队获胜。"},{"key":"U12|game|8-minute quarters","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"8-minute quarters","nameZh":"每节8分钟","howItRuns":"The quarter length used at the 2026 China U12 national finals.","source":"[China Sports Daily via Sina](https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml)","sourceUrl":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-05-15/doc-inhxytzf3301813.shtml","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"2026年中国U12全国总决赛采用的每节比赛时长。"},{"key":"U12|game|Every player plays a full quarter","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"Every player plays a full quarter","nameZh":"每人至少打满一节","howItRuns":"Each player plays at least one full continuous quarter and at most two; five play the 1st quarter and a different five the 2nd.","source":"[Basketball Ireland rules, U12](https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/NationalUnderageRules.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/NationalUnderageRules.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名球员至少连续打满完整的一节，最多打两节；第1节由五人上场，第2节换另外五人上场。"},{"key":"U12|game|Press in the 4th quarter only","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"Press in the 4th quarter only","nameZh":"仅第4节可紧逼","howItRuns":"Pressing only in the 4th quarter, and not by a team leading by 15 points or more.","source":"Basketball Ireland rules, U12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"只有第4节允许紧逼防守，且领先15分及以上的球队不得紧逼。"},{"key":"U12|game|Score gap capped","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"Score gap capped","nameZh":"分差封顶","howItRuns":"The scoreboard does not show a difference of more than 20 points.","source":"Basketball Ireland rules, U12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"记分牌显示的分差最多为20分。"},{"key":"U12|game|Help defence, defensive 3 seconds","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"Help defence, defensive 3 seconds","nameZh":"允许协防，执行防守3秒","howItRuns":"Help defence is allowed; the defensive 3-second rule applies; player-to-player only, no double-teams.","source":"Basketball Ireland rules, U12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"允许协防；执行防守3秒规则；只能人盯人，不得包夹。"},{"key":"U12|game|No 3-point basket","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"No 3-point basket","nameZh":"不设三分球","howItRuns":"A score from outside the 3-point line counts 2.","source":"Basketball Ireland rules, U12","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在三分线外投进计2分。"},{"key":"U12|game|Bring in 3 seconds and backcourt step by step","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"Bring in 3 seconds and backcourt step by step","nameZh":"逐步引入3秒和回场规则","howItRuns":"From age 12, introduce the 3-second rule and the backcourt rule progressively, at a 3.05 m basket with a size 5 or 6 ball, in teams of 3 to 5 for the basic 3 on 3 school game.","source":"[BASPO Basketball at School](https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf) p.13","sourceUrl":"https://www.mobilesport.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/2018/11/MT_11_18_Basketball_d.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"从12岁起，逐步引入3秒规则和回场规则，使用3.05米篮筐和5号或6号球，以3–5人一队进行基础的3对3校园比赛。"},{"key":"U12|game|Performance-league U12","age":"U12","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U12","kind":"rule","name":"Performance-league U12","nameZh":"U12高水平联赛","howItRuns":"In Germany, a state's top (performance-level) U12 league may play 5 on 5 with the time rules (3, 5, 8, 14/24 seconds) and one time-out per half, but keep the 2.60 m basket and compulsory playing time for every child.","source":"[DBB Miniregeln](https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://basketball-bund.de/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/07/DBB_Jugend_Miniregeln_2024.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在德国，州级最高水平（竞技级）的U12联赛可以打5对5，并采用计时规则（3秒、5秒、8秒、14/24秒），每半场一次暂停，但仍保留2.60米篮筐，并保证每个孩子都有强制上场时间。"},{"key":"U14|routine|SHRed Injuries Basketball warm-up","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Injury-prevention warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"SHRed Injuries Basketball warm-up","nameZh":"SHRed篮球防伤热身","howItRuns":"As on the U12 tab: about 10 minutes before the basketball warm-up at every practice and game, Level 1 or Level 2 of each exercise.","source":"[University of Calgary SHRed page](https://live-ucalgary.ucalgary.ca/shred-injuries/all-sports/basketball)","sourceUrl":"https://live-ucalgary.ucalgary.ca/shred-injuries/all-sports/basketball","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"同U12页：每次训练和比赛时，在篮球热身之前进行约10分钟，每个动作选做第1级或第2级。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Explosion Leaps","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Explosion Leaps","nameZh":"爆发式远跳","howItRuns":"Start on the sideline in a low squat, knees bent, hips down and hands on the floor in front. On the coach's command, jump up and out as high and as far as possible, land balanced on two feet, and repeat to the opposite sideline. Once each way. The aim is height and distance with the body under control.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"从边线出发，低位深蹲：屈膝、臀部下沉、双手撑在身前地面。听教练口令，尽可能向上、向前跳，跳得又高又远，双脚平稳落地，连续跳到对侧边线。往返各一次。目标是在身体受控的前提下跳出高度和远度。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Closeout, Slide & Backpedal Drill","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"defence","group":"Defensive footwork","kind":"activity","name":"Closeout, Slide & Backpedal Drill","nameZh":"扑防、滑步、后退跑","howItRuns":"One line on the baseline where it meets the lane line. The first player sprints to a closeout at the elbow, defensive-slides across the lane to the other elbow, then backpedals to the baseline and joins the back of the line. The next player starts when the one ahead reaches the elbow. 2 minutes each way.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在底线与限制区边线交界处排成一路纵队。第一人冲刺到肘区做扑防，防守滑步横穿限制区到另一侧肘区，再后退跑回底线，排到队尾。前一人到达肘区时，下一人出发。每个方向各2分钟。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Zig Zag Defensive Slides – with Dribbler","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"defence","group":"Defensive footwork","kind":"activity","name":"Zig Zag Defensive Slides – with Dribbler","nameZh":"之字形防守滑步（带运球人）","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball, half the group in one baseline corner and half in the opposite corner. The defender starts in a stance with their back to the court. The dribbler goes side to side, changing direction at will, and the defender slides back at angles to cut them off for the length of the court. The next pair starts when the pair ahead reaches the free-throw line. Defenders push off the back foot and stay low with hands out; the coach sets the dribbler's speed to the group's level. 3 x down and back.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一球，一半人在一侧底线底角，另一半在对侧底角。防守人以防守姿势开始，背对球场方向。运球人左右来回运球，可随意变向；防守人斜向后滑步，堵截运球路线，一直防到全场另一端。前一组到达罚球线时，下一组出发。防守人后脚蹬地，保持低重心，双手张开；教练根据队员水平规定运球人的速度。往返3次。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Contact Dribble","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Contact Dribble","nameZh":"对抗运球","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball. One partner dribbles in a stationary stance, the way the coach specifies. The other gives contact by fouling the dribbler on the arms, shoulders, lower body and so on, in a natural way that serves the drill. The dribbler plays through the contact and keeps control. Swap roles after the time; 2 x 30 seconds each.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一球。一人按教练指定的方式原地运球；另一人以自然、贴合练习目的的方式，对运球人的手臂、肩膀、下肢等部位犯规式施加身体接触。运球人顶住接触，保持控球。时间到后交换角色；每人2组×30秒。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Catch a Second Ball Series","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Catch a Second Ball Series","nameZh":"接第二球系列","howItRuns":"Pairs with two balls. One player dribbles with one hand while the partner tosses the second ball to the free hand. The dribbler catches it under control with soft hands, not smacking it back, and tosses it back. Repeat with both hands, and both players take a turn. Next step: use a tennis ball, or make a dribble move before each catch. 4 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组两球。一人单手运球，搭档把第二个球抛向他空着的手。运球人用柔和的手稳稳接住，不要拍打回去，再把球抛回。左右手都要练，两人轮流。进阶：改用网球，或每次接球前先做一个运球动作。4分钟。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Rhythm Dribbling","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Rhythm Dribbling","nameZh":"节奏运球","howItRuns":"A ball each, spread out on the court. For the set time, players work on rhythm dribbling: standing tall and relaxed, then dropping low to make a move; changing speeds; taking several steps within one dribble; or dancing while they dribble. 3 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，在场上散开。在规定时间内练习节奏运球：身体挺直放松，再突然降低重心做动作；变换速度；一次运球内迈出多步；或边运球边跳舞。3分钟。"},{"key":"U14|routine|2-Ball Jab Drill","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"2-Ball Jab Drill","nameZh":"双球试探步练习","howItRuns":"Two balls each (or share with a partner), spread along the baseline in a good stance, pounding both balls at once. The coach stands at the free-throw line and raises the left or right hand. Players quickly jab the matching foot out to the side and bring it back under them. The coach keeps switching hands for the set time. 2 x 30 seconds.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人两球（或与搭档共用），沿底线散开，保持良好准备姿势，双球同时用力运球。教练站在罚球线，举起左手或右手，队员迅速把对应一侧的脚向侧面做试探步，再收回到身体下方。教练在规定时间内不断换手。2组×30秒。"},{"key":"U14|routine|2 Ball Alternate & React","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"2 Ball Alternate & React","nameZh":"双球交替运球反应","howItRuns":"Two balls each (or share with a partner), starting on the baseline in a good stance and dribbling the balls alternately. The coach starts at the free-throw line and stays in front. When the coach raises the left or right hand, players take one big explosive step forward with that foot first, still dribbling both balls. At half court they turn and come back, until time runs out. 2 x 30 seconds.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人两球（或与搭档共用），从底线出发，保持良好准备姿势，双球交替运球。教练从罚球线开始，始终站在队员前方。教练举起左手或右手时，队员先迈对应一侧的脚，向前爆发式跨出一大步，双球继续运球。到中线后转身返回，如此往复直到时间结束。2组×30秒。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Backdoor Pass Lay-Up Drill","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Backdoor Pass Lay-Up Drill","nameZh":"反跑传球上篮","howItRuns":"Two lines, one at the top and one on the wing or in the corner, with the balls in the top line; two groups or four lines per basket, based on numbers. The ball handler dribbles toward the wing. The wing player times the cut, steps up, then cuts backdoor, and the ball handler snaps a bounce pass to the cutter for a lay-up. Players rebound and switch lines. 20 makes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两路纵队，一路在弧顶，一路在侧翼或底角，球在弧顶一队；根据人数，每个篮筐分两组或排四路纵队。持球人向侧翼运球。侧翼队员把握切入时机，先上提，再反跑（背切），持球人快速击地传球给切入者上篮。队员抢篮板后交换队列。投进20个。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Filling the Corner Drill","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Filling the Corner Drill","nameZh":"填补底角","howItRuns":"One line on each wing, with a ball in one line. The ball handler drives baseline side, looking to score. As they drive, the player on the other wing drops to fill the corner. Near the basket the driver passes to the corner player, who is ready with hands up and knees bent, and who catches and shoots. Players rebound and switch lines. The team keeps going until it reaches the set number of makes, then repeats the other way. Printed as 2 games to 8.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 9","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧侧翼各一路纵队，球在其中一队。持球人沿底线一侧突破，寻找得分机会。突破的同时，另一侧侧翼队员下沉填补底角。接近篮下时，突破者传球给底角队员；底角队员双手举起、屈膝准备，接球投篮。队员抢篮板后交换队列。全队连续进行，直到投进规定数量，再换另一侧进行。原资料标为“2局，每局投进8个”。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Reverse Pivot Series","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Reverse Pivot Series","nameZh":"后转身系列","howItRuns":"Two lines on the wings with balls. The first player stands wide off the block facing the ball line, catches a pass, does the move, rebounds and goes to the back of the line; the passer is next. Then the other side. The eight moves: (1) reverse pivot rip for a lay-up; (2) reverse pivot rip opposite for a lay-up; (3) reverse pivot straight into a jab and shot; (4) reverse pivot opposite straight into a jab and shot; (5) reverse pivot, jab, attack opposite for a pull-up; (6) the same off the opposite foot; (7) reverse pivot, jab, attack opposite for a move of choice; (8) the same off the opposite foot. 2 each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧侧翼各一路纵队，持球。第一人站在低位卡位点外侧拉开，面向传球队列，接球后做动作，自抢篮板，排到队尾；传球人接着做。然后换另一侧。八个动作：（1）后转身抡球过身上篮；（2）后转身向反方向抡球过身上篮；（3）后转身后直接接试探步投篮；（4）反方向后转身后直接接试探步投篮；（5）后转身、试探步，向反方向突破急停跳投；（6）同上，换另一只脚做中枢脚；（7）后转身、试探步，向反方向突破后自选动作；（8）同上，换另一只脚做中枢脚。每侧各2次。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Mixed Drills – Footwork Focus","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Mixed Drills – Footwork Focus","nameZh":"综合练习——脚步重点","howItRuns":"Every player has a ball, within 15 feet (about 4.5 m) of the basket. The coach calls an action; players do three of it, then take a shot. The actions: 2 feet forward and backward; 2 feet side to side; 1 foot forward and backward; 1 foot side to side; 2-foot hop up and down (each foot); 1-foot hop up and down (each foot).","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，位于离篮筐约4.5米范围内。教练喊出一个动作，队员做三次，然后投篮一次。动作包括：双脚前后跳；双脚左右跳；单脚前后跳；单脚左右跳；双脚原地上下跳（每只脚都做）；单脚原地上下跳（每只脚都做）。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Backboard Form Shooting","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Backboard Form Shooting","nameZh":"擦板基础投篮","howItRuns":"A ball each (partner up if needed), at as many backboards as possible. Players stand a short distance from the basket, to the side of the rim, and shoot at the backboard, aiming high so the ball touches the board on the way down. 3 x 8.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球（必要时两人一组），尽量利用所有篮板。队员站在离篮筐不远、篮筐侧面的位置，向篮板投篮，瞄准高处，让球下落时碰板入筐。3组×8次。"},{"key":"U14|routine|Full Court Transition Shooting Drill","age":"U14","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Full Court Transition Shooting Drill","nameZh":"全场转换投篮","howItRuns":"At least 9 players, in three lines on one baseline: one side, middle, other side. One player from each line starts on the opposite baseline with a ball, and one at half court. The half-court player runs toward a baseline, catches a pass from the baseline player there, shoots, rebounds and joins that line. The passer sprints the length of the floor, catches a pass at the other end and shoots, then rebounds and becomes the passer there. The coach can vary the shot. When a team reaches the set number of makes, teams rotate spots. 3 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/), 6","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"至少9人，在一侧底线排成三路纵队：一侧、中路、另一侧。每路各派一人持球站在对面底线，另各派一人站在中线。中线队员跑向一侧底线，接该底线队员的传球后投篮，自抢篮板，加入该队。传球人冲刺跑全场，在另一端接球投篮，然后抢篮板，成为那一端的传球人。教练可变换投篮方式。某一队达到规定投进数后，各队轮换位置。3分钟。"},{"key":"U14|smallGames|Ball Tag Game","age":"U14","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Ball Tag Game","nameZh":"持球免捉","howItRuns":"Everyone starts and stays inside half court, with one basketball. One player is \"it\" and runs for the set time trying to tag others; after a tag, the tagger's turn is over. A player holding the ball cannot be tagged, so as the tagger comes close, the ball holder passes to the player about to be tagged. Coaches can adjust it to the team, for example 2 taggers or 2 balls.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/12/); [MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"所有人从头到尾都在半场内，只用一个篮球。一人当捉人者，在规定时间内追捉其他人；捉到一人后，该捉人者的回合结束。持球的人不能被捉，所以捉人者靠近时，持球人要把球传给快要被捉到的人。教练可根据队伍情况调整，例如2名捉人者或2个球。"},{"key":"U14|smallGames|Breakout Dribble","age":"U14","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Breakout Dribble","nameZh":"突围运球","howItRuns":"Four defenders stand on the corners of a square, with one dribbler in the centre. The defenders stay on the edge of the square and move side to side only, to contain. The dribbler tries to break out, without contact or force, within 5 to 8 seconds. If time runs out, the coach calls a change and a new dribbler comes in; after a breakout, the dribbler rotates out. Defenders rotate every 2 or 3 possessions. Next step: a second attacker in the square, or defenders dribble while they contain. Competitive version: 1 point per breakout, or less time to break out.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四名防守人站在一个方形区域的四角，一名运球人在中间。防守人只能在方形边上左右移动进行封堵。运球人要在5到8秒内冲出方形，不能靠身体接触或硬挤。若超时，教练喊“换”，换新的运球人进入；成功突围后，运球人轮换出去。防守人每2到3个回合轮换一次。进阶：方形内增加第二名进攻人，或防守人边运球边封堵。比赛版：每突围一次得1分，或缩短突围时间。"},{"key":"U14|smallGames|Partner Running Pass Drill","age":"U14","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Partner Running Pass Drill","nameZh":"两人跑动传球（带防守）","howItRuns":"Groups of three, up to three groups at a time, starting on the baseline. Two passers face each other with a defender between them. Against live defence, the passers pass back and forth as they run the court and try to score a lay-up; they must complete a set number of passes first. Roles switch on the way back. Next step: one dribble allowed after each catch. Passers do not drop passes, call each other's names and lead the receiver.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/); [MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组，每次最多三组，从底线出发。两名传球人面对面，中间站一名防守人。在积极防守下，两名传球人边跑全场边来回传球，力争上篮得分；必须先完成规定次数的传球。返回时交换角色。进阶：每次接球后允许运球一次。传球人不能漏接，要互喊名字，传球要传到接球人前方。"},{"key":"U14|smallGames|Around the World – Makes!","age":"U14","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Around the World – Makes!","nameZh":"环游世界投篮（投进才算）","howItRuns":"Five cones mark the shooting spots and players split evenly among them, the first in each line with a ball. Each player shoots, rebounds and goes to the back of the line. A team shoots from its spot until it makes 5, then rotates, until it has 5 makes at all five spots. Then the team must make a half-court shot. First team to finish wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用五个标志桶标出投篮点，队员平均分到各点，每队第一人持球。每人投篮、自抢篮板，排到队尾。每队在本点投进5个后轮换到下一点，直到五个点都各投进5个。然后全队必须投进一个半场球。最先完成的队获胜。"},{"key":"U14|smallGames|25 Point Free Throw Game","age":"U14","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"25 Point Free Throw Game","nameZh":"25分罚球赛","howItRuns":"One shooter per basket, at as many baskets as possible. Each player shoots 5 free throws in a row. Each shot scores: 5 for a swish that comes back so the shooter can catch it with one foot still on the line; 4 for any other swish; 3 for a make that touches the rim or board once; 2 for two touches; 1 for three touches or rolling around the rim; 0 for a miss. Highest score wins, out of 25.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个篮筐一名投篮人，尽量利用所有篮筐。每人连续罚5个球。每投计分：空心入网，且球弹回、投篮人一只脚仍踩在罚球线上就能接住——5分；其他空心入网——4分；碰筐或碰板一次后投进——3分；碰两次后投进——2分；碰三次或在筐上滚动后投进——1分；投失——0分。满分25分，得分最高者获胜。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Hook Pass Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Using screens","kind":"activity","name":"Hook Pass Drill","nameZh":"勾手传球","howItRuns":"A line on the wing, a ball each, with a cone or chair on the wing as the ball screen and the coach on the wing, closer to the corner than the screen. Each player dribbles off the ball screen and throws a hook pass to the coach, then flashes back toward the ball for a catch and finish, gets the rebound and goes to the back of the line. 5 each hand.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"侧翼排一路纵队，每人一球；侧翼放一个标志桶或椅子充当持球掩护，教练站在侧翼、比掩护更靠近底角的位置。每人借掩护运球，勾手传球给教练，然后迅速闪回球的方向接球终结，抢篮板后排到队尾。左右手各5次。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Using a Screen Shooting Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Using screens","kind":"activity","name":"Using a Screen Shooting Drill","nameZh":"借掩护投篮练习","howItRuns":"A passing line on the wing; on the opposite side, a shooter, a pretend defender and a screener. The shooter uses the screen to catch and shoot, then goes to the back of the line. Rotate: the defender becomes the shooter, the screener the defender, and the passer runs across to screen. The group works together to get many makes quickly. 10 makes each way.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"侧翼一路传球队列；对侧有一名投篮人、一名象征性防守人和一名掩护人。投篮人借掩护接球投篮，然后排到队尾。轮换：防守人变投篮人，掩护人变防守人，传球人跑到对侧做掩护。全组配合，尽快投进尽可能多的球。每个方向投进10个。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Using a Screen Shooting Game","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Using screens","kind":"activity","name":"Using a Screen Shooting Game","nameZh":"借掩护读防守投篮","howItRuns":"Groups of four: passer, screener, shooter, defender. The shooter starts in the corner and the screener comes from the wing to set a pin-down. On each rep the defender plays the screen a different way: under it (the shooter steps back into open space), trailing (the shooter curls and keeps the defender behind), or jumping over it (the shooter fades to the corner or cuts behind the screen to the hoop). No dribbles. 1 point for an open shot, 1 more for a make. Next step: the shooter at the top of the key with a flare screen from the weak-side wing, or on the wing with a cross screen from the top of the key.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四人一组：传球人、掩护人、投篮人、防守人。投篮人从底角开始，掩护人从侧翼下来做下掩护（pin-down）。每次练习防守人用不同方式应对掩护：从掩护下方绕过（投篮人后撤到空位）；紧跟追防（投篮人弧线绕切，让防守人始终在身后）；从掩护上方抢过（投篮人外飘到底角，或从掩护后方切向篮筐）。不允许运球。获得空位投篮得1分，投进再加1分。进阶：投篮人在弧顶，弱侧侧翼做外弹掩护（flare）；或投篮人在侧翼，弧顶做横掩护。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Using a Screen 2 on 1 Game","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Using screens","kind":"activity","name":"Using a Screen 2 on 1 Game","nameZh":"借掩护2打1","howItRuns":"A wing attacker and defender, a passer (player or coach) on the opposite wing, and a screener at the top of the key, at as many hoops as possible. The screener sets an off-ball screen for the wing attacker and may not receive the ball or score. The attacker has five seconds to use the screen, then plays live 1 on 1. Players then rotate roles. Scoring: open shot 1 point, made shot 2, a screen that leads to a shot 1; most points wins. Next step: 2 on 2 with a defender on the screener; the defence may not switch. 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"侧翼一名进攻人和一名防守人，对侧侧翼一名传球人（队员或教练），弧顶一名掩护人，尽量利用所有篮筐。掩护人为侧翼进攻人做无球掩护，自己不能接球或得分。进攻人有5秒时间利用掩护，然后打实战1对1。之后队员轮换角色。计分：获得空位投篮1分，投进2分，掩护促成投篮1分；得分最多者获胜。进阶：2对2，掩护人也有人防守；防守方不得换防。5分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Screening Reaction Bursts","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Using screens","kind":"activity","name":"Screening Reaction Bursts","nameZh":"掩护阅读短时对抗","howItRuns":"Half court: at least three attackers (passer, screener, cutter) against matched defenders (3 v 3) or fewer (3 v 2, 4 v 3). A pass from the screener or cutter to the passer starts it. The screener screens the cutter's defender and the cutter uses the screen to get open for a shot. Each burst runs on a timer (for example 2 minutes) or to a target number of screen-and-read actions (for example 3 to 5). Rotate after each burst of 3 to 5 possessions. Next step: other screen types (down, back), or at least 2 screens before a shot. Competitive version: points for screen-and-score actions or wide-open shots; add a trailing defender, or the defence switches.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"半场：至少三名进攻人（传球人、掩护人、切入者），对阵人数相同的防守（3对3）或更少的防守（3打2、4打3）。由掩护人或切入者传球给传球人开始。掩护人掩护切入者的防守人，切入者借掩护摆脱，获得投篮机会。每轮限时（例如2分钟），或完成目标次数的掩护阅读配合（例如3到5次）。每轮3到5个回合后轮换。进阶：换用其他掩护类型（下掩护、背掩护），或投篮前至少做2次掩护。比赛版：掩护后得分或获得完全空位投篮计分；增加一名追防的防守人，或防守方换防。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Post Pass & Screen Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"Post Pass & Screen Drill","nameZh":"内线传球加掩护","howItRuns":"A line near the top of the key with a ball; players on the wing and the block. The first player passes to the wing, who passes into the post and then screens for the top player. The top player cuts toward the wing while the screener slips to the basket, and the post passes to the cutter for a shot (or, as an option, to the screener). Rotate: post to the back of the line, screener to post, shooter to wing. Repeat to a set number of makes. Competitive version: add three defenders and play live 3 on 3 once the post catches, with double points for a score off the screen after the post entry. 8 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA Starter Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/starter/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"弧顶附近一路纵队持球；侧翼和低位卡位点各站一人。第一人传球给侧翼，侧翼传球给内线，然后为弧顶队员做掩护。弧顶队员向侧翼切出，掩护人提前顺下（slip）切向篮筐，内线传球给切出者投篮（也可选择传给掩护人）。轮换：内线到队尾，掩护人到内线，投篮人到侧翼。重复至投进规定数量。比赛版：加入三名防守人，内线接球后打实战3对3，内线接球后借掩护得分计双倍分。8分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|2 on 1 Post Passing Game","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 1 Post Passing Game","nameZh":"内线传球2打1","howItRuns":"Groups of three, at least two groups per hoop: one attacker on the post, one on the wing or top of the key, and one defender on the post. The post defender may play behind, front, or deny the pass from the side with an arm. The passer must get the ball into the post three times, and the post makes a scoring move based on the defence. Rotate after three sets. When everyone has played each role, the defender moves onto the passer and the game restarts. 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一组，每个篮筐至少两组：一名进攻人在内线，一名在侧翼或弧顶，一名防守人防内线。内线防守人可以绕后防守、绕前防守，或从侧面伸臂阻断传球线路。传球人必须把球传进内线三次，内线根据防守做得分动作。完成三组后轮换。每人都打过每个角色后，防守人改防传球人，游戏重新开始。5分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|2 on 2 With a Post","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 2 With a Post","nameZh":"带内线的2对2","howItRuns":"Four lines: one on each wing and one on each block. The first player in each wing and post line plays offence and the second plays defence. The wing starts with the ball and must make an entry pass to the post, and the post defender must play behind. Once the ball is in the post, play is live 2 on 2. Everyone takes turns on the wing and in the post. 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四路纵队：两侧侧翼和两侧低位卡位点各一路。侧翼和内线队列的第一人进攻，第二人防守。侧翼持球开始，必须传球进内线，内线防守人必须绕后防守。球进内线后，打实战2对2。每人轮流在侧翼和内线打。5分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Pound Pass Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing under pressure","kind":"activity","name":"Pound Pass Drill","nameZh":"重运球单手传球","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball, at least a lane width apart. The player with the ball pounds it, then makes a one-hand overhand pass with the hand behind the ball and fingers pointing up. The partner catches with one hand and passes back the same way. Work at an intense pace and change the dribble before the pass. 2 x 1 minute.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一球，相距至少一个限制区宽度。持球人用力运球，然后单手肩上传球，手在球后，手指朝上。搭档单手接球，用同样方式传回。高强度进行，每次传球前变换运球方式。2组×1分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Pound Pass 1 on 1","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing under pressure","kind":"activity","name":"Pound Pass 1 on 1","nameZh":"重运球单手传球1对1","howItRuns":"Partners at least a lane width apart; the attacker faces the hoop and starts with the ball. The attacker pounds the ball and makes a one-handed pass, and the partner catches with one hand and passes back the same way. After 3 passes the attacker may attack the basket and play is live. Change the dribble before the pass. Switch attack and defence after 1 minute, and change partners after another. Next step: the attacker starts with two balls and dribbles both before passing. 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/), 8","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，相距至少一个限制区宽度；进攻人面向篮筐，持球开始。进攻人用力运球后单手传球，搭档单手接球并用同样方式传回。传3次后，进攻人可以攻筐，转为实战。每次传球前变换运球方式。1分钟后攻防互换，再过1分钟更换搭档。进阶：进攻人持两球开始，双球运球后再传球。5分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Pressure Timing Bursts","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"passing","group":"Passing under pressure","kind":"activity","name":"Pressure Timing Bursts","nameZh":"压迫下把握传球时机","howItRuns":"Partners: a passing line at the top of the key and a cutting line under the basket. At the top, one player dribbles in a set area while the partner pressures. Under the basket, an attacker and a defender. The cutter picks a side and cuts toward that wing, and the top player must time the pass while the defenders try for deflections. On the catch, the cutter has 3 dribbles to score. Groups play bursts of 3 to 5 possessions and keep score.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组：弧顶一路传球队列，篮下一路切入队列。弧顶处一人在规定区域内运球，搭档对他施压。篮下一名进攻人和一名防守人。切入者选择一侧，向该侧侧翼切出，弧顶队员必须把握传球时机，防守人则争取碰球干扰。接球后，切入者最多运球3次完成得分。各组每轮打3到5个回合并计分。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Ball Up Ball Down Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts","kind":"activity","name":"Ball Up Ball Down Drill","nameZh":"举球降球扑防","howItRuns":"An attacker with a ball in each corner and on each wing, with a matching defender on the baseline. Defenders close out. On the coach's call, attackers lift the ball overhead (\"ball up\") or lower it into a low stance (\"ball down\"). On \"ball up\" the defender pushes off the back foot and steps closer with proper hand position; on \"ball down\" the defender pushes back off the front foot. Defenders move without wasted movement. 3 minutes each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧底角和侧翼各一名持球进攻人，底线上各站一名对应的防守人。防守人扑防。听教练口令，进攻人把球举过头顶（“举球”），或降低重心把球放低（“降球”）。“举球”时，防守人后脚蹬地上前一步，手位正确；“降球”时，防守人前脚蹬地后撤。防守人移动要干净利落，没有多余动作。每侧3分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Closeout to Prevent Middle","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts","kind":"activity","name":"Closeout to Prevent Middle","nameZh":"扑防阻止突破中路","howItRuns":"Two lines on the baseline and one player on each wing. The first in each line passes to the wing and closes out. The attacker may dribble twice in any direction while the defender works to stop a drive to the middle. After two dribbles the attacker picks up the ball and the defender pressures it. Rotate: the defender becomes the wing attacker and a new defender steps up from the baseline. 3 reps each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"底线排两路纵队，两侧侧翼各站一人。每路第一人传球给侧翼后扑防。进攻人可向任意方向运球两次，防守人努力阻止其向中路突破。运球两次后进攻人收球，防守人对球施压。轮换：防守人变侧翼进攻人，底线上新一名防守人上场。每侧3次。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Partner Closeout Shooting","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Closeouts","kind":"activity","name":"Partner Closeout Shooting","nameZh":"两人扑防投篮","howItRuns":"Partners in open space within their 1–2-dribble range, up to three pairs per half court. The defender starts with the ball, passes to the attacker and closes out. If the defender leaves space, the attacker shoots. If not, the attacker takes 1 or 2 dribbles into a pull-up or lay-up; if the defender cuts off the first dribble, the attacker counters the other way with a crossover or another move. Rotate after 3 or 4 bursts. Next step: the attacker catches on the move, for example running from the wing to the top of the key, and attacks the closeout. 3–4 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组在空场地上，位于进攻人运球1–2次即可出手的范围内，每个半场最多三组。防守人持球开始，传球给进攻人后扑防。若防守人留出空间，进攻人直接投篮；若没有，进攻人运球1或2次后急停跳投或上篮；若防守人封住第一次运球，进攻人用体前变向（交叉运球）或其他动作向另一侧反击。3或4轮后轮换。进阶：进攻人在移动中接球，例如从侧翼跑向弧顶，再攻击扑防。3–4分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Timing the Dribble","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"Timing the Dribble","nameZh":"把握运球节奏","howItRuns":"Guards in pairs with a ball in open court; bigs in pairs with a ball at the blocks. Guards: the defender matches the rhythm of the dribble and tries to steal as the ball leaves the dribbler's hand. Bigs: the attacker dribbles and bumps the defender for one or two dribbles to learn the timing; then the defender \"pulls the chair\" by stepping back, so the attacker loses balance, loses the ball or travels. Partners take turns. 3 x.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"后卫两人一组一球，在开阔场地；内线两人一组一球，在低位卡位点。后卫：防守人跟上运球节奏，在球离开运球人手的瞬间尝试抢断。内线：进攻人运球，并用身体顶靠防守人一到两次运球，体会节奏；然后防守人突然后撤“抽椅子”，让进攻人失去平衡、丢球或走步。搭档轮流。3次。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Hand on Top Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"Hand on Top Drill","nameZh":"手臂压上练习","howItRuns":"Pairs with one ball, up to three lines at a basket (both wings and the top). As the attacker drives, the defender moves with them and puts an arm on their body. The attacker tries to get the inside arm on top of and in front of the defender's arm, drives past and shoots. Partners switch until the shot count is reached. 3 each way.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一球，每个篮筐最多三路（两侧侧翼和弧顶）。进攻人突破时，防守人跟随移动，手臂贴住其身体。进攻人努力把内侧手臂压到防守人手臂上方并抢到其前方，突破过人后投篮。搭档轮换，直到完成规定投篮次数。每个方向各3次。"},{"key":"U14|compete|1 v 1: close the driving line (1:1 Durchbruchslinie schliessen)","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"1 v 1: close the driving line (1:1 Durchbruchslinie schliessen)","nameZh":"1对1：封堵突破路线","howItRuns":"1 v 1. The attacker starts, and the defender may act only after the ball first touches the floor. The defender tries to force a change of hand or direction and keep the attacker out of the key. The action ends with a steal, a rebound or a basket. Next step: 2 v 2, with an extra attacker in the weak-side corner and the defender in help position in the key; then 3 v 3, adding an attacker and a defender on the weak-side wing.","source":"[BASPO Training Forms](https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691764795/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-kompakt-und-situationsangepasst-verteidigendefensive-duelle-erfolgreich-bestreiten.pdf) p.6–8","sourceUrl":"https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691764795/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-kompakt-und-situationsangepasst-verteidigendefensive-duelle-erfolgreich-bestreiten.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"1对1。进攻人先动，防守人只有在球第一次触地后才能行动。防守人努力迫使进攻人换手或变向，不让其进入限制区。以抢断、篮板或得分结束本回合。进阶：2对2，弱侧底角增加一名进攻人，其防守人在限制区内的协防位置；再进阶到3对3，在弱侧侧翼增加一名进攻人和一名防守人。"},{"key":"U14|compete|1 v 1 for five seconds (1:1 während fünf Sekunden)","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"1 v 1 for five seconds (1:1 während fünf Sekunden)","nameZh":"5秒1对1","howItRuns":"The coach has the ball, with one attacker and one defender. The attacker tries to get free, receive and play 1 v 1. The defender must deny the catch for at least five seconds; if they do, roles switch. If not, the attacker plays 1 v 1 to a finish. Next steps: catch on the wing (45°) with no backdoor cut; then with the backdoor; then in the corner; then anywhere in the quarter court except the key; then anywhere in the quarter court; then Winners' Ball (whoever wins the ball attacks next).","source":"[BASPO Training Forms](https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691764795/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-kompakt-und-situationsangepasst-verteidigendefensive-duelle-erfolgreich-bestreiten.pdf) p.9–10","sourceUrl":"https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691764795/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-kompakt-und-situationsangepasst-verteidigendefensive-duelle-erfolgreich-bestreiten.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练持球，一名进攻人、一名防守人。进攻人设法摆脱、接球并打1对1。防守人必须阻断接球至少5秒；做到则攻防互换。做不到，进攻人打1对1直到回合结束。进阶顺序：在侧翼（45°）接球，不允许反跑；然后允许反跑；然后在底角接球；然后在四分之一场内除限制区外的任意位置；然后四分之一场内任意位置；最后“赢者控球”（谁赢得球权，谁下一回合进攻）。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Deny Layup Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"Deny Layup Drill","nameZh":"阻断传球转上篮","howItRuns":"A line with balls on each wing, the coach at the top, one attacker and one defender on court. The defender denies the attacker for a few seconds while the coach tries to pass to the attacker. After deflecting the pass, the defender goes the other way for a lay-up, and the former attacker contests it. 3 minutes each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧侧翼各一路持球纵队，教练在弧顶，场上一名进攻人、一名防守人。教练尝试传球给进攻人，防守人阻断几秒。碰掉传球后，防守人向反方向推进上篮，原进攻人追防干扰。每侧3分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|1 on 1 – 3 Stops","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"1 on 1 – 3 Stops","nameZh":"1对1——连续3次防守成功","howItRuns":"A player on each wing and one at the top, with the defender starting in the paint and extra players at the end of a wing line. The defender must get three 1 on 1 stops: against one wing, then the top, then the opposite wing. Then rotate: the defender to the back of the wing line, the front of that line to the top, the top player to the opposite wing, and that wing player becomes the defender.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧侧翼和弧顶各一名队员，防守人从限制区内出发，其余队员排在一侧侧翼队尾。防守人必须完成三次1对1防守成功：先防一侧侧翼，再防弧顶，再防另一侧侧翼。然后轮换：防守人到侧翼队尾，该队第一人到弧顶，弧顶队员到对侧侧翼，对侧侧翼队员成为防守人。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Full Court Man to Man","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"Full Court Man to Man","nameZh":"全场人盯人","howItRuns":"Pairs matched by skill and position, a ball per pair, half the pairs on each baseline. The court is split lengthways on the lane line and players may not cross the middle. The defender tries to force as many changes of direction as possible, sliding to stay in front or running to get back in front if beaten. The attacker tries to score at the far basket. The next pair starts when the one ahead reaches half court. At the far end, pairs join that line and swap roles. 3 x each.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"按水平和位置匹配两人一组，每组一球，一半组在一侧底线，另一半在对侧底线。沿限制区边线把场地纵向分开，队员不得越过中间。防守人努力迫使进攻人尽可能多地变向，滑步保持在其正前方，被突破时快跑回到其前方。进攻人力争在远端篮筐得分。前一组到达中线时，下一组出发。到另一端后，加入该端队列并交换攻防角色。每人3次。"},{"key":"U14|compete|2 v 2 and 3 v 3 without dribbling (2:2 und 3:3 ohne Dribbling)","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"1 on 1 defence and denying","kind":"activity","name":"2 v 2 and 3 v 3 without dribbling (2:2 und 3:3 ohne Dribbling)","nameZh":"2对2和3对3不运球","howItRuns":"2 v 2 in a quarter court. The attackers try to score without dribbling. If the defence wins the ball, it tries to score too. The defenders pressure the ball carrier, deny direct passes and break fast after a steal. Next steps: half court without fixed roles; then full court with transition. The title names 3 v 3, but the description covers 2 v 2 only.","source":"[BASPO Training Forms](https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691764795/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-kompakt-und-situationsangepasst-verteidigendefensive-duelle-erfolgreich-bestreiten.pdf) p.3–5","sourceUrl":"https://assets01.sdd1.ch/assets/lbwp-cdn/mobilesport/files/1691764795/mobilesport-basketball--trainingsformen-kompakt-und-situationsangepasst-verteidigendefensive-duelle-erfolgreich-bestreiten.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在四分之一场打2对2。进攻方不运球，设法得分。防守方若抢到球，也设法得分。防守人对持球人施压，阻断直传，抢断后快速反击。进阶：扩大到半场，不固定角色；再到全场，加入攻防转换。标题写有3对3，但说明只涉及2对2。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Tag & Pursue Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Tag & Pursue Drill","nameZh":"触人追球","howItRuns":"Groups of three at a basket (two attackers with one ball, one defender), at least two groups per basket. The defender guards the player without the ball from help position, calling \"help, help, help\". The ball goes to that player and the defender closes out calling \"ball, ball, ball\"; the ball goes back and the defender returns to help, calling \"help\". The attacker shoots, and the defender finds their own player, tags them and pursues the ball. In MVP Plan 4 the defender finds the shooter instead.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/); [MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个篮筐三人一组（两名进攻人一球，一名防守人），每个篮筐至少两组。防守人在协防位置防守无球队员，并喊“协防、协防、协防”。球传给该队员时，防守人扑防并喊“球、球、球”；球传回后，防守人回到协防位置，喊“协防”。进攻人投篮，防守人找到自己的防守对象，用手触碰他，然后追抢篮板球。在MVP第4课中，防守人改为找投篮人。"},{"key":"U14|compete|4 on 4 Rebounding","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"4 on 4 Rebounding","nameZh":"4对4篮板","howItRuns":"Lines on the perimeter inside the 3-point line and on the baseline at the post; the coach has the ball. The first player in each line defends and the next steps in on offence. The coach passes or shoots so the defenders adjust to the ball, and the defenders pass back to the coach. After a short time the coach shoots and the defenders box out, or tag and pursue. If the offence rebounds it may try to score, and the defence stays on; either way a new offence comes in. A defence must get 5 rebounds in a row before rotating off.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/), 6","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在三分线内的外线位置和底线附近的内线位置各排一路纵队；教练持球。每路第一人防守，下一人上场进攻。教练传球或投篮，让防守人根据球的位置调整站位，防守人再把球传回教练。片刻后教练投篮，防守人卡位，或触人后追球。进攻方抢到篮板可以继续进攻，防守方留在场上；无论哪种情况，都换新的进攻方上场。防守方必须连续抢到5个篮板才能轮换下场。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Rebound & Score","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Rebound & Score","nameZh":"抢板得分","howItRuns":"Three players in the paint and a line on the baseline. The coach shoots and all three go for the rebound; whoever gets it tries to score and the other two defend. All shots are in the paint and \"limited fouls are called\". A player who scores 3 times comes out and the next in line jumps straight in. No pauses: the ball is always live, even as it goes through the net.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"限制区内三名队员，底线排一路纵队。教练投篮，三人争抢篮板；抢到的人设法得分，另外两人防守。所有投篮都在限制区内，“只吹少量犯规”。得分满3次的队员下场，排头队员立即上场。不停顿：球始终是活球，球穿网而下时也一样。"},{"key":"U14|compete|4 on 4 Shell to Rebound","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"4 on 4 Shell to Rebound","nameZh":"4对4贝壳防守接篮板","howItRuns":"Groups of four, one team on offence and one on defence. The offence has only perimeter players, no posts, and may only pass and cut, with no screens. After 5 passes the ball is live and the offence may try to score, still without screens. A defensive rebound ends the possession. After each possession the defence steps off and the offence goes to defence. First team to 5 defensive rebounds wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四人一组，一队进攻、一队防守。进攻方只有外线队员，没有内线，只能传切，不能掩护。传满5次后成为活球，进攻方可以尝试得分，仍不得掩护。抢到防守篮板即结束本回合。每个回合后防守方下场，进攻方转为防守。最先抢到5个防守篮板的队获胜。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Shell Drill 5 On 5 – with Post","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"Shell Drill 5 On 5 – with Post","nameZh":"5对5贝壳防守（含内线）","howItRuns":"Groups of five, one team on offence and one on defence. The offence has perimeter players and one post, and may pass and cut but not screen. After 5 passes the ball is live and the offence may try to score, still without screens. Switch teams every possession. The emphasis is post defence and how to help on a post player.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/), 11; [MVP Plan 11](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/11/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五人一组，一队进攻、一队防守。进攻方有外线队员和一名内线，可以传切，但不能掩护。传满5次后成为活球，进攻方可尝试得分，仍不得掩护。每个回合交换攻守。重点是内线防守，以及如何对内线球员协防。"},{"key":"U14|compete|3 on 3 from Help the Helper","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and rebounding","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 3 from Help the Helper","nameZh":"协防补位3对3","howItRuns":"Teams of three; use both baskets with four or more teams. Each possession starts with a baseline drive: a help defender stops the ball and the third defender helps the helper. The driver must kick the ball out, then play is live. After every change of possession the ball goes back to the top of the key. A team that scores keeps the ball. No check, to keep it quick.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/), 9; [MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队；四队及以上时使用两个篮筐。每个回合从底线突破开始：一名协防人堵球，第三名防守人为协防人补位。突破者必须把球分出，然后转为实战。每次球权转换后，球回到弧顶。得分方继续控球。不用交球确认（check），保证节奏快。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Half Court Spacing Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing and transition","kind":"activity","name":"Half Court Spacing Drill","nameZh":"半场拉开空间练习","howItRuns":"Tape on the floor marks the offensive spots, for example 3 around 2, 4 around 1, or 5 out, with a line at each spot; groups of five and a ball. One group at a time passes, cuts and fills open spots, keeping all five spots filled. After a set time the coach calls for a shot; the group shoots and the next group rotates in. 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"用胶带在地上标出进攻站位，例如3外2内、4外1内或5外，每个站位排一队；五人一组，一个球。每次一组上场，传球、空切并填补空位，始终保持五个位置都有人。规定时间后教练喊投篮，该组投篮，下一组轮换上场。5分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|5 on 0 Fast Break","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing and transition","kind":"activity","name":"5 on 0 Fast Break","nameZh":"五人无防守快攻","howItRuns":"Five lines on the baseline: the middle, one each side of the middle, and two wide. The first two players in the middle line each have a ball. All sprint to the far basket. The middle player passes to the nearest player on the right, who passes to the player left of the middle line, who passes to the wide player on the right for a lay-up; that player swings through to switch sides with the left-wing runner. The middle player rebounds without letting the ball bounce, and the players nearest the middle line switch sides inside the paint. Repeat straight away coming back, then the next group goes. Players rotate through every starting spot. 5 x.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"底线排五路纵队：中路、中路两侧各一路、两侧边路各一路。中路队列前两人各持一球。所有人冲刺到远端篮筐。中路队员传给右侧最近的队员，他传给中路左侧的队员，再传给右侧边路队员上篮；该队员穿过篮下，与左侧边路跑动的队员交换位置。中路队员在球落地前抢下篮板，靠近中路的两名队员在限制区内交换位置。返回时立即再做一次，然后下一组出发。队员轮换所有出发位置。5次。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Balance the Floor Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing and transition","kind":"activity","name":"Balance the Floor Drill","nameZh":"平衡场地练习","howItRuns":"The five lines of 5 on 0 Fast Break, numbered 1 to 5; one ball and the coach. The first group gives the coach the ball. The coach passes to one player and calls 2 or 3 numbers. Those players run the court calling out where the ball and their teammates are, so the floor is balanced; the catcher dribbles or passes to help. Once balanced, they take a quick shot or practise drive and kick, as the coach decides. 5 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"沿用“五人无防守快攻”的五路纵队，编号1到5；一个球、一名教练。第一组把球交给教练。教练传球给一名队员，并喊出2或3个号码。被喊到的队员跑全场，边跑边喊出球和队友的位置，使场上站位平衡；接球人运球或传球配合。站位平衡后，按教练要求快速投篮或练习突破分球。5分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|3 on 0, 2 on 1","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing and transition","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 0, 2 on 1","nameZh":"三人无防守接2打1","howItRuns":"Three lines on the baseline, with 2 balls in the middle line. The first three run the court passing, outside players wide: the middle player passes to one side and gets it back, to the other side and gets it back, then to the first side for a lay-up. The shooter sprints back to defend. The middle passer must get both feet in the paint, then attacks the other way 2 on 1 with the wing who did not shoot, who takes the rebound. After one shot, the next three start. 6 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"底线三路纵队，中路队列有2个球。前三人传球跑全场，两边队员拉开：中路传给一侧再接回，传给另一侧再接回，再传给第一侧上篮。投篮人冲刺回防。中路传球人必须双脚踩进限制区，然后与没有投篮的边路队员向另一端2打1进攻，由这名边路队员抢篮板。投一次篮后，下一组三人出发。6分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|3 on 2, 2 on 1 Modified","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing and transition","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 2, 2 on 1 Modified","nameZh":"3打2接2打1（变化版）","howItRuns":"Three attackers spread outside the 3-point line in the half court, one with the ball; two defenders near the basket. Play is live when the ball handler attacks the hoop: 3 on 2 until a score or turnover. The player who shot or turned the ball over goes back on defence on the opposite side, and the other two attackers become the new defenders. The two defenders bring the ball back and try to score 2 on 1. The next possession starts with three new attackers in new half-court spots. Next step: the 2 on 1 stays on one side of the court; crossing is a turnover. 4 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三名进攻人在半场三分线外拉开，一人持球；两名防守人在篮下附近。持球人攻筐时转为实战：3打2，直到得分或失误。投篮或失误的队员到对侧回防，另外两名进攻人成为新的防守人。原来两名防守人把球带回，尝试2打1得分。下一回合由三名新进攻人在半场新的位置开始。进阶：2打1只能在场地的左侧或右侧一边进行，越过中间算失误。4分钟。"},{"key":"U14|compete|3 on 2, 2 on 1","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing and transition","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 2, 2 on 1","nameZh":"3打2接2打1","howItRuns":"Full court. Three lines on the baseline (two wings and the middle, with the balls) and two defenders at the far end. The first player in each line attacks 3 on 2, with only one shot. Whoever shoots or turns the ball over gets back on defence; the other two attackers stay as the new defenders. The two original defenders bring the ball back 2 on 1. The next three start from the baseline, and finished players go to the back of the lines.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 11](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/11/); [MVP Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/11/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全场。底线三路纵队（两侧边路和中路，球在中路），两名防守人在远端。每路第一人进行3打2进攻，只有一次投篮机会。投篮或失误的队员回防；另外两名进攻人留下，成为新的防守人。原来两名防守人把球带回，打2打1。下一组三人从底线出发，打完的队员到队尾。"},{"key":"U14|compete|Line Up Transition Defense Drill","age":"U14","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Spacing and transition","kind":"activity","name":"Line Up Transition Defense Drill","nameZh":"列队转换防守","howItRuns":"Two teams: five on the baseline, five on the extended free-throw line facing them; one ball and the coach. The coach passes to a baseline player, whose team attacks the far basket. The player on the free-throw line directly across from the ball handler sprints to the baseline in front of them, turns and sprints back into play. The defence must stop the ball and match up, playing 5 on 4 until that player gets back. Teams switch positions after each possession. First team to the set number of defensive stops wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/), 7, 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队：五人站在底线，五人站在罚球线延长线上，面对他们；一个球、一名教练。教练传球给一名底线队员，该队向远端篮筐进攻。罚球线上正对持球人的那名队员冲刺到他们前面的底线，转身再冲刺回到场上。防守方必须堵住球并完成对位，在该队员回来之前以4防5。每个回合后两队交换位置。最先达到规定防守成功次数的队获胜。"},{"key":"U14|game|3 on 3 Dictated","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 Dictated","nameZh":"指定开局3对3","howItRuns":"Teams of three; use both baskets with four or more teams. The coach dictates the first action and players must start the possession that way; after it, the ball is live and players play freely. Set versions: every possession starts with a pass and cut or a pass and ball screen (All-Star Plan 2), or with a down screen (All-Star Plan 11; MVP Plans 3, 11). After every change of possession the ball goes back to the top of the key. A team that scores keeps the ball. No check. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/), 9, 11; [MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三人一队；四队及以上时使用两个篮筐。教练指定第一个动作，队员必须以此开始回合；之后成为活球，自由比赛。设定版本：每个回合以传切或传球后持球掩护开始（All-Star第2课），或以下掩护开始（All-Star第11课；MVP第3、11课）。每次球权转换后，球回到弧顶。得分方继续控球。不用交球确认（check）。每局先得3分者胜。"},{"key":"U14|game|3 on 3 Kings Court","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 Kings Court","nameZh":"3对3王者场","howItRuns":"Teams of 3 or 4 (larger teams substitute), on as many baskets as possible, all games at once. One court is the Kings Court, where a win is worth 3 points. When the Kings Court game ends, every game ends. The team with the highest score among the other courts' winners then plays the Kings Court winner. Teams track their scores over a set period, such as 10 minutes. The page does not say what a win on the other courts is worth.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3或4人一队（人多的队轮换上场），尽量利用所有篮筐，所有场地同时比赛。其中一个场地为“王者场”，在王者场获胜得3分。王者场比赛结束时，所有比赛同时结束。随后，其他场地胜者中得分最高的队挑战王者场胜者。各队在规定时间内（例如10分钟）累计得分。原资料未说明在其他场地获胜得几分。"},{"key":"U14|game|3 on 2 Trailer Game","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 2 Trailer Game","nameZh":"3打2加回防人","howItRuns":"Two teams, full court. Each team always defends the same basket with two players and has a player or line on the sideline at half court. When the three attackers cross half court, the defending team's sideline player runs to the middle of half court, touches the floor and joins the defence. After a score or a stop, those three defenders attack the other way, and the other team's sideline player does the same as they cross half court. The aim is to score in the 3 on 2 before the third defender arrives. Games to 5 makes.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队，全场。每队始终用两名队员防守同一个篮筐，并在中线与边线交界处安排一名队员或一队队员。三名进攻人过半场时，防守方的边线队员跑到中线中点，用手触地后加入防守。得分或防守成功后，这三名防守人向另一端进攻，对方的边线队员在他们过半场时同样操作。目标是在第三名防守人赶到前完成3打2得分。每局先投进5球者胜。"},{"key":"U14|game|11-Person Transition Drill","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"11-Person Transition Drill","nameZh":"11人攻防转换","howItRuns":"Two defenders wait at each basket, three attackers start near half court and the other players wait on the sidelines. The three attack one basket 3 on 2. After a shot or turnover, whoever gets the ball goes straight on offence with the sideline players on that half, dribbling or passing up the court to attack the other basket 3 on 2, and play continues. Players not in play fill open spots as the coach directs. Next step: start each possession with an outlet pass to a sideline player; at most two passes before a shot. Competitive version: each player scores 1 point for a rebound or live-ball steal and 1 when their team scores.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/), 11; [MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个篮筐下各有两名防守人等候，三名进攻人从中线附近出发，其余队员在边线等候。三人向一侧篮筐3打2进攻。投篮或失误后，得到球的人立即与该半场边线上的队员转为进攻，运球或传球推进，向另一端篮筐3打2，比赛连续进行。未上场的队员按教练指示填补空位。进阶：每个回合以传给边线队员的一传开始；投篮前最多传两次。比赛版：每名队员抢到篮板或活球抢断得1分，所在队得分时也得1分。"},{"key":"U14|game|5 on 1 Build Up","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 on 1 Build Up","nameZh":"5打1逐步加人","howItRuns":"Five attackers in any alignment (for example 5 out, 4 out 1 in, or staggered); five defenders in a row behind the baseline; one ball. The first defender passes to any attacker and closes out. After each pass the next defender is released, so the game builds from 5 on 1 to 5 on 5; once the fifth defender is in, play is live. The offence moves the ball quickly to use its advantage before the defence recovers. Next step: keep the offence on for a 3-minute burst, changing alignment each possession; change the order the defenders enter; or the offence must finish on a paint touch.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五名进攻人以任意阵型站位（例如5外、4外1内或交错站位）；五名防守人在底线外排成一排；一个球。第一名防守人传球给任意进攻人并扑防。每传一次球，放出下一名防守人，比赛从5打1逐步增加到5对5；第五名防守人上场后转为实战。进攻方快速转移球，在防守方到位前利用人数优势。进阶：进攻方连续打3分钟，每个回合变换阵型；改变防守人上场顺序；或进攻方必须先触及限制区才能终结。"},{"key":"U14|game|3 Trips & Flip","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 Trips & Flip","nameZh":"三回合后互换","howItRuns":"Two or more teams, full court. The offence starts a half-court possession and can keep trying to score off its own rebounds. After a score, a defensive rebound or a steal, play goes live for one possession the other way. Then the team that started with the ball brings it back to its starting basket, completing the three trips. The teams then flip, so the other team starts in the half court. The coach can dictate a play or action. Games to 5 makes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队或多队，全场。进攻方开始一次半场进攻，可以利用自己的进攻篮板持续尝试得分。得分、防守篮板或抢断后，向另一端打一个实战回合。然后最初持球的队把球带回自己的起始篮筐，完成三个回合。之后两队互换，由另一队在半场开始进攻。教练可指定战术或动作。每局先投进5球者胜。"},{"key":"U14|game|Half Court 5 on 5 – 3 seconds","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Half Court 5 on 5 – 3 seconds","nameZh":"半场5对5——3秒","howItRuns":"Teams of five, half court, games to 5 makes. After the first pass, any player who holds the ball longer than 3 seconds commits a turnover. A team that scores keeps the ball.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"五人一队，半场，每局先投进5球者胜。第一次传球后，任何队员持球超过3秒即判失误。得分方继续控球。"},{"key":"U14|game|5 on 5 Situational Play","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 on 5 Situational Play","nameZh":"5对5情景比赛","howItRuns":"Teams are given a specific game situation, for example: a team has the ball and leads by 1 with 45 seconds left; or a team has the ball and trails by 2 with 2:30 left. The situations teach game and clock management, and the coach reinforces key points as they come up.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/), 6; [MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"给各队设定具体比赛情景，例如：一队控球，领先1分，剩45秒；或一队控球，落后2分，剩2分30秒。这些情景用来教比赛管理和时间管理，教练在关键点出现时及时强调。"},{"key":"U14|game|Small-sided ladder","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Small-sided ladder","nameZh":"小场比赛阶梯","howItRuns":"1 on 1 to 5 on 5 on courts sized to the numbers: 15 × 6 m, 22 × 8 m, 24 × 11 m, 26 × 13 m and 28 × 15 m. Two bouts of 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5 minutes respectively, with 2 minutes' rest. FIBA rules, except a foul gives loss of possession. In national-level U14 and U16 players, the smaller formats gave more technical actions per minute; 2 on 2 gave the most shots.","source":"[Clemente 2020](https://doi.org/10.2478/hukin-2019-0082)","sourceUrl":"https://doi.org/10.2478/hukin-2019-0082","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"从1对1到5对5，场地大小与人数对应：15×6米、22×8米、24×11米、26×13米和28×15米。每种形式打两节，每节时长依次为1、2、3、4、5分钟，间歇2分钟。采用FIBA规则，但犯规判丢失球权。在国家级U14和U16球员中，人数越少的形式每分钟技术动作越多；2对2的投篮次数最多。"},{"key":"U14|game|2 on 2 full-court bouts","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"2 on 2 full-court bouts","nameZh":"2对2全场对抗","howItRuns":"Full court, player-to-player defence, 3 bouts of 4 minutes with 2 minutes' passive rest. In U15 players, 2 on 2 gave a higher heart rate and more dribbles, shots and rebounds than 4 on 4, with no significant difference in passes.","source":"[Conte 2017](https://doi.org/10.3390/sports5010003)","sourceUrl":"https://doi.org/10.3390/sports5010003","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全场，人盯人防守，3节×4分钟，节间被动休息2分钟。在U15球员中，2对2比4对4心率更高，运球、投篮和篮板更多，传球次数无显著差异。"},{"key":"U14|game|Shot clock from the front court","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"Shot clock from the front court","nameZh":"前场开始进攻计时","howItRuns":"Start the shot clock only when the offence has the ball in its front court, for at most 32 seconds.","source":"Mini p.34","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"只有当进攻方在前场控球时才开始进攻计时，最长32秒。"},{"key":"U14|game|30-second shot clock","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"30-second shot clock","nameZh":"30秒进攻计时","howItRuns":"The USA Basketball standard for ages 12–14.","source":"[USA Basketball rules](https://www.quickscores.com/downloads/mwrhuachucayouth_USA_Basketball_Youth_Guidelines__Rules_and_Standards.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://www.quickscores.com/downloads/mwrhuachucayouth_USA_Basketball_Youth_Guidelines__Rules_and_Standards.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"USA Basketball 对12–14岁的标准。"},{"key":"U14|game|No zone","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"No zone","nameZh":"禁止区域防守","howItRuns":"Player-to-player defence only.","source":"Mini p.34; [Basketball Ireland U14](https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/NationalUnderageRules.pdf); [Basketball New Zealand U14](https://nz.basketball/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BBNZ-Regs-Bk-3-Competition-as-of-5-Mar-2026.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/NationalUnderageRules.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"只允许人盯人防守。"},{"key":"U14|game|No double-teams","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"No double-teams","nameZh":"禁止包夹","howItRuns":"Help defence allowed, double-teaming not.","source":"Basketball Ireland U14","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"允许协防，不允许包夹。"},{"key":"U14|game|Press, but not when far ahead","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"Press, but not when far ahead","nameZh":"可紧逼，大比分领先除外","howItRuns":"Pressing allowed in all four quarters, but not by a team leading by 15 or more (Ireland) or 25 or more (USA Basketball).","source":"Basketball Ireland U14; USA Basketball rules","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"四节都允许紧逼，但领先15分及以上（爱尔兰）或25分及以上（USA Basketball）的队不得紧逼。"},{"key":"U14|game|Groups A and B","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"Groups A and B","nameZh":"A、B两组","howItRuns":"Split the squad into two groups that each play half of the 1st and 2nd quarters, as China's junior high league does.","source":"[Shaanxi notice](https://finance.sina.com.cn/wm/2026-05-25/doc-inhzchzh3486712.shtml)","sourceUrl":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/wm/2026-05-25/doc-inhzchzh3486712.shtml","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"把全队分成两组，第1节和第2节每组各打半节，与中国初中联赛的做法一致。"},{"key":"U14|game|Everyone plays a full quarter","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"Everyone plays a full quarter","nameZh":"每人至少打满一节","howItRuns":"Each player plays at least one full continuous quarter and at most three.","source":"Basketball Ireland U13–U14","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名队员至少连续打满一整节，最多打三节。"},{"key":"U14|game|Four 8-minute quarters","age":"U14","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U14","kind":"rule","name":"Four 8-minute quarters","nameZh":"四节×8分钟","howItRuns":"Used by USA Basketball (12–14), Basketball New Zealand U14 and China's junior high league.","source":"As above","sourceUrl":null,"fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"USA Basketball（12–14岁）、新西兰篮球协会（Basketball New Zealand）U14和中国初中联赛采用此赛制。"},{"key":"U16|routine|SHRed Injuries Basketball warm-up","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Injury-prevention warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"SHRed Injuries Basketball warm-up","nameZh":"SHRed篮球防伤热身","howItRuns":"As on the U12 tab: about 10 minutes before the basketball warm-up at every practice and game, Level 1 or Level 2 of each exercise.","source":"[University of Calgary SHRed page](https://live-ucalgary.ucalgary.ca/shred-injuries/all-sports/basketball)","sourceUrl":"https://live-ucalgary.ucalgary.ca/shred-injuries/all-sports/basketball","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"同U12页：每次训练和比赛前，在篮球热身之前做约10分钟，每个动作选做第1级或第2级。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Follow the Leader Warm-Up","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Follow the Leader Warm-Up","nameZh":"跟着队长热身","howItRuns":"All players spread out on the baseline. Each player takes a turn leading the team in a stretch or active movement from the baseline to half court and back, once each. Encourage players to pick a movement that has not been used yet. The plan calls it a way to develop leadership and comfort having a voice among teammates.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"全体球员在底线散开站好。每人轮流带领全队做一个拉伸或动态动作，从底线到半场再返回，每人带一次。鼓励球员选一个还没人做过的动作。教案说明，这是培养领导力、让球员敢在队友面前发声的方法。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Dynamic Warm-Up Part 11","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Dynamic Warm-Up Part 11","nameZh":"动态热身 第11部分","howItRuns":"Each movement once: Bear Hold, Stationary A Skip, Pogo Jumps, Forward Walking Lunge, Lateral Chop, Carioca. The plan prints only the movement names, with a video, and gives no written description.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个动作做一次：熊式支撑（Bear Hold）、原地A字跳步（Stationary A Skip）、弹簧跳（Pogo Jumps）、向前行进弓步、侧向碎步（Lateral Chop）、交叉步（Carioca）。教案只列出动作名称并附视频，没有文字说明。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Dynamic Warm-Up Part 14","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"warmup","group":"Movement warm-up","kind":"activity","name":"Dynamic Warm-Up Part 14","nameZh":"动态热身 第14部分","howItRuns":"Each movement once, from the baseline to half court or the other way: Walking Hamstrings, Knee Hugs, Jump to Stick, Lateral Squat Hold, Quick Feet, 2 Foot Hops. The plan prints only the movement names, with a video.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每个动作做一次，从底线到半场，或反方向进行：行进间腿后侧拉伸（Walking Hamstrings）、抱膝走（Knee Hugs）、跳起落地定住（Jump to Stick）、侧蹲静撑（Lateral Squat Hold）、快速小碎步（Quick Feet）、双脚连续跳（2 Foot Hops）。教案只列出动作名称，并附视频。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Early-Cross Jab Series","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Early-Cross Jab Series","nameZh":"提前换手接试探步","howItRuns":"Pairs. The ball carrier dribbles at the partner, who acts as the defender, and switches hands before getting too close. Right after the switch, the carrier drops into a jab step that takes them past the defender in the opposite direction. Work both hands and swap roles.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组。持球人向搭档运球推进，搭档扮演防守人；持球人在离防守人太近之前换手运球。换手后立即接一个试探步（jab step），借此从相反方向越过防守人。左右手都练，然后交换角色。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Hard Step, Hard Pound Breakdown Drill","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Hard Step, Hard Pound Breakdown Drill","nameZh":"重踏步重拍球急停分解","howItRuns":"A ball each, starting on the baseline. Players take two fast dribbles forward with the right hand, then stop hard, with a forceful right-hand dribble and a forceful step landing together. Work both sides.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，从底线出发。右手向前快速运球两次，然后用力急停：右手用力拍一次球，同时用力踏出一步，拍球和落脚同时完成。左右两侧都练。"},{"key":"U16|routine|2 Ball Resistance Dribbling","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"2 Ball Resistance Dribbling","nameZh":"双球抗阻运球","howItRuns":"Pairs with 2 balls, on the baseline. The dribbler holds a strong, firm stance and alternates the two balls while the partner applies resistance to the shoulders, hips and outside of the knees. Halfway through the time, the dribbler changes to dribbling both balls at the same time. The partner then moves in front, puts two hands on the dribbler's shoulders and resists as the dribbler drives forward dribbling. Then partners switch.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，两个球，在底线进行。运球人保持稳固、扎实的姿势，两球交替运球；搭档在其肩部、髋部和膝盖外侧施加阻力。时间过半时，运球人改为两球同时运球。之后搭档站到运球人正前方，双手按住其双肩施加阻力，运球人一边运球一边向前推进。然后搭档交换。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Over the Line Dribble Drill","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Over the Line Dribble Drill","nameZh":"跨线单手运球","howItRuns":"A ball each. Straddle a line, one foot on each side, knees bent in an athletic stance. Dribble with the right hand on the right side of the line, then control the ball so the next bounce lands on the left side, changing sides every dribble with one hand. Then switch hands.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球。双脚分开跨在一条线两侧，一侧一只脚，屈膝成准备姿势。右手在线的右侧运球，然后控制球让下一次落地在线的左侧，单手每运一次换一侧。然后换手。"},{"key":"U16|routine|In & Out Overs Drill","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"In & Out Overs Drill","nameZh":"过手臂内外运球","howItRuns":"Pairs, one ball. One partner holds an arm straight out at about waist height. After 1 or 2 dribbles, the dribbler makes an in-and-out move over the arm, bounces the ball under it and brings it back to the starting hand. Keep going for 30 seconds, then switch hands and roles.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 10](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/10/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/10/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一个球。一人把一只手臂向前伸直，高度约齐腰。运球人运1–2次球后，手从手臂上方做一个内外运球（假变向）动作，让球从手臂下方弹过，再回到原来的手上。连续做30秒，然后换手、交换角色。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Figure 8 Dribble 4","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"Figure 8 Dribble 4","nameZh":"四拍8字运球","howItRuns":"A ball each, lined up with space on the baseline. Players dribble a figure 8 using 4 dribbles: on the right side with the right hand, between the legs from right to left, on the left side with the left hand, then between the legs from left to right. Keep the pattern going for 2 x 20 seconds.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，在底线拉开间距站成一排。用4次运球完成8字运球：右手在右侧运一次，从右到左胯下运球一次，左手在左侧运一次，再从左到右胯下运球一次。连续循环，2组×20秒。"},{"key":"U16|routine|1-Ball Pound, 1-Ball Control","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"dribbling","group":"Dribbling","kind":"activity","name":"1-Ball Pound, 1-Ball Control","nameZh":"一拍一控双球练习","howItRuns":"Two balls each, spread out facing the coach. One ball stays on the floor under one hand while the player holds a good stance and dribbles the other with eyes and chest up. The coach calls numbers 1 to 4, each a direction for moving the floor ball out and back: on \"3!\" players keep dribbling and move the floor ball to the 3 spot and back. Use both hands. The plan's text does not say which direction each number means.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人两个球，面向教练散开站好。一个球放在地上，用一只手按住；保持良好姿势，另一只手运另一个球，抬眼挺胸。教练喊1到4的数字，每个数字代表一个方向，把地上的球推出去再拉回来：喊“3！”时，球员继续运球，同时把地上的球移到3号位再拉回。双手都练。教案没有写明每个数字对应哪个方向。"},{"key":"U16|routine|In & Out Around the Lane","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"In & Out Around the Lane","nameZh":"沿限制区内外运球上篮","howItRuns":"A ball each, in one line on the baseline where it meets the lane line; use more baskets if needed. The first player dribbles up the lane line with a quick in-and-out move, repeating it 2 to 3 more times until past the elbow. Above the elbow they turn back toward the basket and attack for a lay-up. The next player starts when the one ahead is halfway up the lane. 3 each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，在底线与限制区边线交界处排成一路纵队；人多可多用几个篮架。排头沿限制区边线向上运球，做一次快速内外运球，再重复2–3次，直到运过肘区。过肘区后折返朝篮筐进攻上篮。前一人运到限制区一半时，下一人出发。每侧3次。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Floater Series","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Floater Series","nameZh":"抛投组合练习","howItRuns":"Small groups, one basket and one ball per group. Each player shoots 3 reps of 4 types of floater. First, right hand off the left leg; once everyone has taken 3, left hand off the right foot. Then floaters off two feet: 3 with the right hand, then 3 with the left. 2 sets.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/), 10","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分小组，每组一个篮架、一个球。每人练4种抛投，每种3次。先是左脚起跳右手抛投；所有人都完成3次后，换右脚起跳左手抛投。然后练双脚起跳抛投：右手3次，再左手3次。共2组。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Jump Through the Hips & Finish","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Jump Through the Hips & Finish","nameZh":"转髋跳步上篮","howItRuns":"Lines, with a couple of balls at the front of each. Players dribble in as for a normal lay-up. Before reaching the basket they imagine a defender cutting in front, take a hard last dribble while jumping and twisting the hips toward the middle of the floor, land, and jump straight back up to shoot. 3 minutes each way, on both sides of the court.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"排成几路纵队，每队排头放几个球。球员像正常上篮一样运球切入。快到篮下时，想象有防守人横切到身前，用力运最后一次球，同时起跳并把髋部转向球场中路，落地后立即原地向上起跳投篮。每个方向3分钟，球场两侧都练。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Finishing Through Contact","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"layups","group":"Lay-ups and finishing","kind":"activity","name":"Finishing Through Contact","nameZh":"对抗中上篮","howItRuns":"A line on the wing, each player with a ball; a coach with a pad. Each player makes a dribble move and drives for a lay-up. As the player goes up to finish, the coach makes contact, with a pad or otherwise. The player rebounds and goes to the end of the line. The plan's point: finish through contact by jumping off two feet to keep balance and strength. 3 each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在侧翼排成一路纵队，每人一球；一名教练手持护垫。每人做一个运球动作后突破上篮。球员起跳上篮时，教练用护垫或其他方式进行身体接触。球员自抢篮板后回到队尾。教案要点：双脚起跳，保持平衡和力量，顶住对抗完成上篮。每侧3次。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Hard Step & Shoot","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Hard Step & Shoot","nameZh":"重踏步急停投篮","howItRuns":"Three lines at the top, each player with a ball. The first player in each line takes two hard, fast right-hand dribbles, makes a quick stop combining a hard dribble and a hard step, shoots, rebounds and goes to the back of the line. Work both sides, 4 minutes each way.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在弧顶排三路纵队，每人一球。每队排头右手用力快速运球两次，以一次用力拍球加一次用力踏步完成快速急停，投篮，自抢篮板后回到队尾。左右两侧都练，每个方向4分钟。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Loop Shooting Drill","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Loop Shooting Drill","nameZh":"绕跑投篮","howItRuns":"Two lines, 2 balls in each, and one shooter on the court at the block. The first player in a line passes to the shooter, who shoots, rebounds, gives the ball back to the line it came from and goes to the back of that line. The passer loops around the outside of the shooter to the far side of the lane, catches from the other line and shoots. Keep looping. The coach sets the shooting distances.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两路纵队，每队2个球；一名投篮人站在场上低位卡位点。一队排头传球给投篮人，投篮人投篮、自抢篮板，把球还给这一队，然后排到这一队的队尾。传球人从投篮人外侧绕过，跑到限制区另一侧，接另一队的传球投篮。如此循环绕跑。投篮距离由教练设定。"},{"key":"U16|routine|Up & Out Shooting","age":"U16","block":"routine","type":"shooting","group":"Shooting","kind":"activity","name":"Up & Out Shooting","nameZh":"上提外切投篮","howItRuns":"One line on the baseline under the basket; the first player has no ball and the next few have one. The first player runs to the top of the key, then makes a straight-line cut to the wing. The next player passes; the cutter catches and shoots, or takes another designated shot, rebounds, gives the ball to the next player without one and goes to the back of the line. The passer runs to the top of the key and cuts straight to the opposite side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在篮下底线排成一路纵队；排头不拿球，后面几人各拿一球。排头跑到弧顶，然后直线切向侧翼。下一人传球；切入者接球投篮，或完成另一种指定投篮，自抢篮板，把球交给后面下一个没球的队员，然后回到队尾。传球人随后跑到弧顶，直线切向另一侧。"},{"key":"U16|smallGames|1st to 50","age":"U16","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"1st to 50","nameZh":"先传满50次","howItRuns":"Two teams of 5, one ball. The team with the ball may not dribble, screen or shoot; every pass counts toward 50, and the first team to 50 wins. A steal, turnover or deflection gives the other team the ball, and they start counting their passes. A team that wins the ball back carries on from its own count: a team that had 12 restarts at 12. The defence can pressure aggressively, so passes must be strong and accurate.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队各5人，一个球。持球队不能运球、掩护或投篮；每传一次球计1次，先累计到50次的队获胜。出现抢断、失误或碰球（干扰），球权交给对方，对方开始累计自己的传球数。重新夺回球权的队接着自己原来的数继续：原来是12次，就从12次接着数。防守方可以积极施压，所以传球必须有力、准确。"},{"key":"U16|smallGames|Circle Trap 3 on 3","age":"U16","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Circle Trap 3 on 3","nameZh":"圆圈包夹3对3","howItRuns":"Three attackers in a circle on the perimeter with one ball; three defenders inside it. Two defenders trap and go for a steal, deflection or forced turnover; solo traps are not allowed. The third is the interceptor, reading passes. The attackers move the ball quickly; the two without it adjust their spacing for better passing angles. Any steal, deflection or defensive touch switches roles. With more than 2 teams, a new three comes on as offence, the offence moves to defence and the defence goes off. Next step: change the number of defenders, such as 4 v 3; add a shot clock or touch count; or, on a turnover or the coach's call, flow into live full-court 3 v 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA All-Star Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/all-star/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"三名进攻人在外围站成一圈，一个球；三名防守人在圈内。两名防守人包夹，力争抢断、碰球或逼出失误；不允许一人单独包抢。第三名防守人负责拦截，判断传球。进攻方快速转移球；两名无球队员调整站位间距，创造更好的传球角度。出现抢断、碰球或防守方碰到球，攻防互换。超过2队时，新上场的三人进攻，原进攻方转防守，原防守方下场。进阶：改变防守人数，如4防3；加入进攻计时或触球次数限制；或在失误或教练喊口令时，直接转入全场3对3实战。"},{"key":"U16|smallGames|Beating 2 Defenders","age":"U16","block":"smallGames","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Beating 2 Defenders","nameZh":"1打2突破","howItRuns":"Groups of 3 with one ball, starting at the centre of half court. One player attacks; the other two defend from just above the 3-point line. The attacker has 10 seconds to make a move and get a shot off against both. Then the next group comes on. The three rotate every possession so each gets a turn on offence. Keys from the plan: attack the weaker defender, split the defenders if they leave space, and create space.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一组，一个球，从半场线中点出发。一人进攻，另两人在三分线稍外处防守。进攻人有10秒时间做动作，在两人防守下完成出手。然后换下一组上场。三人每回合轮换，每人都轮到进攻。教案要点：攻击较弱的防守人；两名防守人之间留出空当就从中间切开；创造空间。"},{"key":"U16|compete|In & Out Crossover to Shot","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shots off the dribble","kind":"activity","name":"In & Out Crossover to Shot","nameZh":"内外运球变向投篮","howItRuns":"Several lines at a basket; the first 1 or 2 players in each line have a ball. The first player makes an in-and-out crossover, shoots, rebounds and passes to the next player in line, who repeats. Work in both directions, 3 minutes each way. Competitive version: keep score.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一个篮架前排几路纵队，每队前1–2人持球。排头做一次内外运球接体前变向，投篮，自抢篮板后传给本队下一人，下一人重复。两个方向都练，每个方向3分钟。比赛版：计分。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Slide to Open Step Back","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"shooting","group":"Shots off the dribble","kind":"activity","name":"Slide to Open Step Back","nameZh":"侧滑运球接后撤步投篮","howItRuns":"Two lines on the wing with 2 balls in each line; use other baskets if needed. Each player takes 2 to 3 slide dribbles toward the baseline, chest facing the basket. After the last slide dribble they make an open step back or side step and shoot a jump shot from inside the 3-point line, rebound their own shot and pass to the next player. The two lines race to 4 makes, then switch sides.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在侧翼排两路纵队，每队2个球；需要时可用其他篮架。每人向底线方向做2–3次滑步运球，胸口始终朝向篮筐。最后一次滑步运球后，做一个开放式后撤步或侧步，在三分线内跳投，自抢篮板，传给下一人。两队比赛谁先投进4球，然后交换到另一侧。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Curl & Pop Drill","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Screens","kind":"activity","name":"Curl & Pop Drill","nameZh":"绕切与外弹","howItRuns":"Two lines, one at the elbow and one on the same-side wing; the coach at the top; balls. The elbow player tosses a ball to the coach and goes to screen for the wing player. The wing curls hard, expecting the defender to go over the top. The screener expects the defender to help on the curl and pops back to the ball, and the coach passes to the screener for the designated shot. Switch lines and repeat to 15 makes, then switch sides.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两路纵队，一队在肘区，一队在同侧侧翼；教练在弧顶；准备若干球。肘区队员把球抛给教练，然后去给侧翼队员做掩护。侧翼队员假定防守人从掩护上方追防，用力绕切。掩护人假定自己的防守人去协防绕切者，于是外弹回到球的方向，教练传给掩护人，完成指定投篮。两队交换后重复，投进15球后换另一侧。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Pick & Pop Shooting","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Screens","kind":"activity","name":"Pick & Pop Shooting","nameZh":"挡拆外弹投篮","howItRuns":"Every player has a ball; posts start on the block and guards above the opposite wing; a coach passes and names the shots. The first post passes to the coach and sets a ball screen for a guard. The guard comes off the screen and passes to the popping post, who takes the coach's designated shot, rebounds and goes to the back of the post line. The guard relocates to a spot the coach chooses, catches from the coach, takes the designated shot, rebounds and goes to the back of the guard line. 20 makes each way, timed.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球；内线队员从低位卡位点出发，后卫站在对侧侧翼的上方；一名教练负责传球并指定投篮。第一名内线传球给教练，然后为一名后卫做持球掩护。后卫借掩护而出，传给外弹的内线，内线完成教练指定的投篮，自抢篮板，排到内线队尾。后卫移动到教练指定的位置，接教练传球，完成指定投篮，自抢篮板，排到后卫队尾。每个方向投进20球，计时。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Pocket Pass & Shoot","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Screens","kind":"activity","name":"Pocket Pass & Shoot","nameZh":"口袋传球投篮","howItRuns":"Every player has a ball; posts start on the block and guards above the opposite wing; a coach. The first post passes to the coach and sets a ball screen for the guard. The guard comes off the screen and makes a pocket pass to the big, who catches, finishes in the paint, rebounds and goes to the back of the post line. The guard relocates to a spot the coach names, catches from the coach, takes the shot the coach names, rebounds and goes to the back of the guard line. 20 each way.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球；内线队员从低位卡位点出发，后卫站在对侧侧翼的上方；一名教练。第一名内线传球给教练，然后为后卫做持球掩护。后卫借掩护而出，用口袋传球（挡拆中给顺下内线的短传）传给内线，内线接球在限制区内完成终结，自抢篮板，排到内线队尾。后卫移动到教练指定的位置，接教练传球，完成教练指定的投篮，自抢篮板，排到后卫队尾。每个方向20次。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Slip Pass Drill","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Screens","kind":"activity","name":"Slip Pass Drill","nameZh":"提前顺下传球（Slip）","howItRuns":"A passing line at the top of the key, a screening line on the wing and a shooting line on the same baseline; a coach defends the screener. As the screen is set, the coach either drops back to defend the screen or steps up to jump the shooter coming off it. If the coach drops, the passer hits the shooter coming off the screen; if the coach steps up, the screener slips to the basket for the pass. Rotate passer to screener to shooter to passer. A player can take the coach's role.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/), 2, 5","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"弧顶一路传球队，侧翼一路掩护队，同侧底线一路投篮队；教练防守掩护人。掩护建立时，教练要么后撤防掩护，要么上前抢截借掩护出来的投篮人。教练后撤，传球人就传给借掩护出来的投篮人；教练上前，掩护人就提前顺下（slip）冲向篮下接传球。轮换顺序：传球人→掩护人→投篮人→传球人。教练的角色也可以由一名球员担任。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Side Ball Screen Drill","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"teamPlay","group":"Screens","kind":"activity","name":"Side Ball Screen Drill","nameZh":"侧翼持球掩护练习","howItRuns":"Guards, paired by ability, in two lines high on each wing near half court; bigs, paired, in two lines where the lane line meets the baseline. On one side the first guard pair and first big pair take offence and defence. The big sets a ball screen when the guard signals, and the four play one 2 on 2 possession off the side screen. Then the other side goes. Players rotate sides and swap offence and defence with their partners. Coaches may add restrictions and set how to defend the pick and roll. 10 minutes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"后卫按水平两两配对，在两侧侧翼靠近半场的高位各排一队；内线两两配对，在限制区边线与底线交界处排两队。一侧先由第一对后卫和第一对内线上场，每对中一人进攻、一人防守。后卫示意时内线做持球掩护，四人利用侧翼掩护打一个2对2回合。然后换另一侧。球员轮换场地两侧，并与搭档交换攻防。教练可以增加限制条件，并规定如何防守挡拆。10分钟。"},{"key":"U16|compete|GUARDS: Same Hand, Same Foot Finishes","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"guards","group":"GUARDS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"GUARDS: Same Hand, Same Foot Finishes","nameZh":"后卫：同手同脚上篮","howItRuns":"Small groups in a line on each side of the basket; the first two players in each line have a ball; use more baskets. The first player dribbles to the basket and finishes with the hand on the side they approach (right hand on the right, left on the left), jumping off the foot on the same side as the shooting hand (right foot for a right-hand finish). Complete the reps, then switch sides. The plan notes this finish may feel awkward at first.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"分小组，篮筐两侧各排一路纵队，每队前两人持球；可多用几个篮架。排头运球到篮下，从哪一侧进就用哪一侧的手上篮（右侧用右手，左侧用左手），起跳脚与出手手同侧（右手上篮用右脚起跳）。完成规定次数后换另一侧。教案提示，这种上篮一开始可能会觉得别扭。"},{"key":"U16|compete|GUARDS: Rebound, Sprint & Shoot","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"guards","group":"GUARDS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"GUARDS: Rebound, Sprint & Shoot","nameZh":"后卫：摸板冲刺投篮","howItRuns":"Two lines under the basket, each player with a ball; a coach. The first player tosses the ball to the coach, jumps and touches the backboard, sprints wide to touch where half court meets the sideline, then sprints back to the same-side corner to catch from the coach and take the designated shot. The player in the other line starts right after. Guards run the floor wide and are ready to shoot on the catch.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"篮下两路纵队，每人一球；一名教练。排头把球抛给教练，起跳摸篮板，然后拉开宽度冲刺，摸半场线与边线交界处，再冲刺回同侧底角，接教练传球，完成指定投篮。另一队的队员紧接着出发。后卫跑动时拉开宽度，接球即可投篮。"},{"key":"U16|compete|GUARDS: Pick & Roll Situational Shooting","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"guards","group":"GUARDS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"GUARDS: Pick & Roll Situational Shooting","nameZh":"后卫：挡拆情境投篮","howItRuns":"Every player has a ball, inside half court on one side; a chair or cone is the screener and the coach plays the screener's defender. The player dribbles in, signals for the ball screen, sets it up and comes off it, expecting the on-ball defender to go over the top and get caught. The coach hedges, drops back or plays between the two. The player reads the coach and takes the appropriate shot.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，在半场一侧；用一把椅子或一个标志桶当掩护人，教练扮演掩护人的防守人。球员运球推进，示意要持球掩护，做好准备动作后借掩护而出，假定持球防守人从掩护上方追防并被挡住。教练可以上前延误（hedge）、后撤，或站在两者之间。球员观察教练的选择，完成相应的投篮。"},{"key":"U16|compete|GUARDS: Pick & Roll Reads-On Ball","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"guards","group":"GUARDS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"GUARDS: Pick & Roll Reads-On Ball","nameZh":"后卫：挡拆阅读——持球防守人","howItRuns":"Every guard has a ball, high on the wing; a cone or chair is the screener and the coach is the on-ball defender. If the coach goes over the screen, the guard dribbles off it for a pull-up jump shot. If the coach goes under, the guard can stop behind the screen and shoot, or fake a re-screen and come off the other way for a jump shot. Work both sides.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名后卫一球，站在侧翼高位；用标志桶或椅子当掩护人，教练扮演持球防守人。教练从掩护上方追防，后卫就借掩护运球后急停跳投。教练从掩护下方绕过，后卫可以在掩护后面停球投篮，或假装再要一次掩护，然后从另一侧借掩护而出跳投。两侧都练。"},{"key":"U16|compete|GUARDS: Pick & Roll Reads – Second Defender","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"guards","group":"GUARDS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"GUARDS: Pick & Roll Reads – Second Defender","nameZh":"后卫：挡拆阅读——第二防守人","howItRuns":"Every guard has a ball, high on the wing; a cone or chair is the screener and the coach plays the screener's defender. If the coach hard-hedges, the guard splits for a shot. If the coach sits back, the guard comes off the screen and shoots, or freezes the coach and attacks the basket.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每名后卫一球，站在侧翼高位；用标志桶或椅子当掩护人，教练扮演掩护人的防守人。教练强力上前延误（hard hedge），后卫就从两人中间切开投篮。教练退守不上前，后卫就借掩护而出投篮，或用节奏定住教练后攻击篮筐。"},{"key":"U16|compete|BIGS: Catch it High, Keep it High","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"BIGS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"BIGS: Catch it High, Keep it High","nameZh":"内线：高接高保护","howItRuns":"Pairs, one ball, several pairs per basket. The shooter stands in the paint around the block. The partner tosses the ball high; the shooter jumps, catches with arms outstretched, keeps the ball high on landing, then immediately jumps back up and shoots. The partner rebounds and repeats until the shooter makes 5, then they switch. The ball must not come down on the catch.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组一个球，每个篮架安排几组。投篮人站在限制区内低位卡位点附近。搭档把球高抛；投篮人起跳，双臂伸直接球，落地时球保持在高处，随即再次起跳投篮。搭档抢篮板继续抛球，直到投篮人投进5球，然后交换。接球时球不能放低。"},{"key":"U16|compete|BIGS: Dribble. Bump. Balance.","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"BIGS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"BIGS: Dribble. Bump. Balance.","nameZh":"内线：运球·顶人·平衡","howItRuns":"Pairs, one ball. The attacker starts with the ball under the backboard, with the defender directly behind, between the attacker and the basket. The attacker takes one dribble, bumps the defender back, balances on two feet and goes up strong to finish. Repeat to the set number of makes, then switch roles; work both sides. Key points from the plan: create space with a power dribble and a strong bump, stay low, strong and balanced, and set a good angle for the shot.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 1](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组，一个球。进攻人持球从篮板下开始，防守人站在他正后方，位于进攻人与篮筐之间。进攻人运一次球，把防守人顶开，双脚站稳保持平衡，然后强力起跳完成终结。重复到规定的投进次数后交换角色；两侧都练。教案要点：用强力运球和有力的顶人创造空间；重心低、身体强硬、保持平衡；找好投篮角度。"},{"key":"U16|compete|BIGS: Rebound, Sprint & Seal","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"BIGS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"BIGS: Rebound, Sprint & Seal","nameZh":"内线：篮板冲刺封位要球","howItRuns":"Post players in a line with a ball at one basket; a coach. The first player bounces the ball off the backboard, rebounds, makes a good outlet pass to the coach, sprints to half court and back to the paint. The next player defends in the paint, holding a ball overhead with both hands. The first player seals the defender, catches the coach's pass and finishes. The defender then does the backboard toss and the pattern repeats. Run it from both sides.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 7](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/7/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"内线队员在一个篮架前排成一路纵队，持一个球；一名教练。第一人把球打板，抢下篮板，给教练一个好的一传，冲刺到半场再跑回限制区。下一人在限制区内防守，双手把一个球举过头顶。第一人封住（卡住）防守人，接教练的传球完成终结。然后由防守人去做打板抛球，如此循环。两侧都练。"},{"key":"U16|compete|BIGS: Defending Post Cross Screen","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"BIGS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"BIGS: Defending Post Cross Screen","nameZh":"内线：防守内线横掩护","howItRuns":"One offensive and one defensive post on each block; the coach has the ball on the wing. First teach how to defend a big-to-big post screen without switching. The ball-side player sets a cross screen for the opposite big. Run several reps of defending the screen before adding the pass. The offence rotates to defence and two new attackers come in; with few posts, rotate one spot at a time.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧低位卡位点各有一名进攻内线和一名防守内线；教练在侧翼持球。先教如何在不换防的情况下防守内线之间的掩护。强侧（有球一侧）队员给对侧内线做横掩护。先练几次防掩护，再加入传球。进攻方轮换到防守，换两名新的进攻人上场；内线人少时，每次只轮换一个位置。"},{"key":"U16|compete|BIGS: Pick & Roll Reads-Rotation","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"BIGS (position-specific)","kind":"activity","name":"BIGS: Pick & Roll Reads-Rotation","nameZh":"内线：挡拆阅读——补防轮转","howItRuns":"Posts in a line on the baseline; one player in the corner with a defender; the coach in the opposite slot. The first post screens for the coach, who goes away from the corner player and passes to the rolling post. On the catch, the roller reads the corner defender: if the defender helps, pass to the corner for a shot; if not, finish at the basket. Rotate: roller to corner shooter, corner shooter to defender, defender to the end of the line.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 4](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/4/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"内线在底线排成一路纵队；一名球员在底角，配一名防守人；教练在对侧弧顶与侧翼之间（slot位）。第一名内线给教练做掩护，教练向远离底角队员的方向运球，传给顺下的内线。顺下内线接球时观察底角防守人：防守人补防，就传给底角投篮；不补防，就直接攻筐终结。轮换：顺下内线→底角投篮人→防守人→队尾。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Pass & Up & Under Drill","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"Pass & Up & Under Drill","nameZh":"传球接上下步","howItRuns":"One player on each block, with a line on the wing in front of each block; the first players in each line have a ball. The first player makes a post entry pass to the post on the block. The post catches, makes an up-and-under move, rebounds and goes to the back of the line. The passer runs to the block, posts up and gets ready for the next pass. Then switch sides.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧低位卡位点各站一人，每个卡位点前方的侧翼各排一路纵队；每队排头持球。排头给低位队员做一次内线入球传球。低位队员接球后做上下步（投篮假动作后跨步上篮），自抢篮板后回到队尾。传球人跑到低位卡位点，背身要位，准备接下一次传球。然后换另一侧。"},{"key":"U16|compete|4-5-4 Drop Step Drill","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"4-5-4 Drop Step Drill","nameZh":"4-5-4低位撤步练习","howItRuns":"Groups of 3 at a basket with 2 balls, one on each block. One player rebounds and quickly puts each ball back on its block. The shooter goes block to block making a drop step and finish each time. After the 4th drop step, the player on the other side switches in and does 5, then the last player does 4. The plan says the 4-5-4 count keeps the changeovers quick and smooth.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一组一个篮架，2个球，两侧低位卡位点各放一个。一人抢篮板，并迅速把每个球放回原来的卡位点。投篮人在两个卡位点之间来回，每次都做撤步并完成终结。第4次撤步后，另一侧的队员换上做5次，最后一人做4次。教案说明，4-5-4的计数方式能让换人快速顺畅。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Spin 5 Series","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"Spin 5 Series","nameZh":"转身五式","howItRuns":"A ball each, starting on the baseline along the lane line; coach at the top. In turn, players pass to the coach, flash to the same-side elbow and make the move, until each has done all 5: turn and rip baseline with 1 dribble, quick spin back to the middle; the same with 2 hard dribbles and a big spin (both finish with no more dribbles); rip baseline with 2 hard dribbles, half spin toward the middle, turn back baseline for a shot; catch with the back to the basket, quick spin off an imagined defender for a shot of choice; one dribble with the back to the basket, quick spin into a shot of choice. Then the other elbow.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"每人一球，从底线沿限制区边线排队；教练在弧顶。球员依次传球给教练，闪切到同侧肘区接球做动作，直到每人完成全部5种：①转身向底线方向用力抢拉（rip）突破，运1次球，快速转身回中路；②同样动作，改为用力运2次球，做大幅度转身（①②转身后都不再运球，直接终结）；③向底线抢拉突破，用力运2次球，向中路做半转身，再转回底线方向投篮；④背对篮筐接球，想象有防守人，快速转身摆脱后自选方式投篮；⑤背对篮筐运一次球，快速转身接自选方式投篮。然后换另一侧肘区。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Post Pass Shooting Drill","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"Post Pass Shooting Drill","nameZh":"内线传球投篮","howItRuns":"A line at the top with a couple of balls; one player on the post and one on the wing. The top player passes to the wing; the wing passes to the post and cuts; the post passes to the cutter for an open jump shot. The shooter rebounds and goes to the back of the line. The post flashes to the wing and takes a pass from the next player at the top, while the previous top player sprints to the baseline, then back to the block to post up. The pattern repeats to the set makes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 12](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/12/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"弧顶排一路纵队，备几个球；低位一人，侧翼一人。弧顶队员传给侧翼；侧翼传给低位后切入；低位传给切入者，切入者空位跳投。投篮人自抢篮板后排到队尾。低位队员闪到侧翼，接弧顶下一人的传球；刚才弧顶的队员冲刺到底线，再回到低位卡位点背身要位。如此循环，直到投进规定球数。"},{"key":"U16|compete|High Low Passing Drill","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"High Low Passing Drill","nameZh":"高低位传球练习","howItRuns":"The coach on the wing; a post player and a defender on the ball-side block; a line on the opposite block, each player with a ball. The first player in line passes to the coach. The coach looks into the post, where the defender is fronting, which signals the opposite-block player to flash to the high post. The coach passes to the high post, who makes a high-low pass to the post player to finish. Rotate: flasher to block defender, defender to block attacker, attacker to the back of the line. 4 each side.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练在侧翼；强侧低位卡位点有一名内线和一名防守人；对侧低位卡位点排一路纵队，每人一球。排头传球给教练。教练看向内线，防守人在绕前防守，这就是信号：对侧低位的队员闪切到高位。教练传给高位，高位给低位内线一记高低位传球，内线终结。轮换：闪切者→低位防守人，防守人→低位进攻人，进攻人→队尾。每侧4次。"},{"key":"U16|compete|2 on 2 From High Low Flash","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"2 on 2 From High Low Flash","nameZh":"高低位闪切2对2","howItRuns":"The coach on the wing; an attacking post and a defender on the ball-side block; an attacker and a defender on the opposite block; the others wait in pairs. The coach looks into the post, where the defender is fronting, and the opposite-block player flashes to the high post. The coach passes to the high post and the game is live for one possession. After the shot or turnover, players rotate. Games to 4.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练在侧翼；强侧低位卡位点有一名进攻内线和一名防守人；对侧低位卡位点有一名进攻人和一名防守人；其余人两两一组等候。教练看向内线，防守人在绕前，对侧低位队员闪切到高位。教练传给高位，开始实战一个回合。投篮或失误后轮换。先到4分者胜。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Low-post decision 3 on 3","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"post","group":"Post play","kind":"activity","name":"Low-post decision 3 on 3","nameZh":"低位决策3对3","howItRuns":"3 on 3 on one basket for 10 minutes; a team that scores keeps the ball. A basket counts only after a correct pass into the low post: from below the extended free-throw line, with the post defender behind (later also three-quarter fronting on the side away from the passer). Perimeter defenders may not intercept the pass into the post. A pass from above the line, or into a fronted post, is a wrong decision; a basket scored without a correct post pass does not count, and the other team gets the ball. Next step: the post with the ball passes out if a perimeter defender helps and plays 1 on 1 if not; perimeter players move to an open passing lane when their defender helps. +1 for each correct decision, −1 for a wrong one.","source":"[FIBA, Basketball for Young Players (2000)](<https://kki.is/library/Skrar/07.CAPITULO%207%20(Ingles).pdf>) ch.8, about p.298–304","sourceUrl":"https://kki.is/library/Skrar/07.CAPITULO%207%20(Ingles).pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"一个篮架打3对3，10分钟；得分的队继续持球。只有在正确地把球传进低位之后得分才算：传球点在罚球线延长线以下，且低位防守人在身后（后期，低位防守人在远离传球人一侧做四分之三绕前时传入也算正确）。外围防守人不得拦截传入低位的球。从罚球线延长线以上传球，或传给被绕前的低位，都是错误决策；没有经过正确低位传球的得分不算，球权交给对方。进阶：持球的低位队员遇到外围防守人协防就分球出来，没有协防就打1对1；外围队员的防守人去协防时，移动到空出的传球线路上。每个正确决策+1分，每个错误决策−1分。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Digging in the Post","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Post defence","kind":"activity","name":"Digging in the Post","nameZh":"外线下沉干扰低位","howItRuns":"A line on the wing; the coach on the same-side block. The first player in line defends the next. The attacker makes a post entry pass to the coach, and the defender digs down to force a pass back out. After 3 reps the defender goes to the back of the line, the attacker becomes the defender and the next player attacks. Digging, as the plan defines it: the wing defender jabs and fakes down into the post, facing the court with long arms, one hand digging and the other trying for deflections.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"在侧翼排一路纵队；教练在同侧低位卡位点。排头防守下一人。进攻人给教练做内线入球传球，防守人下沉干扰（dig），逼教练把球传回外线。做3次后，防守人回到队尾，进攻人转为防守人，下一人进攻。教案对“下沉干扰”的定义：侧翼防守人向低位做试探和假下沉动作，面向场内，手臂伸长，一只手下掏，另一只手争取碰球。"},{"key":"U16|compete|1 on 1 From Post Cross Screen","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Post defence","kind":"activity","name":"1 on 1 From Post Cross Screen","nameZh":"内线横掩护后1对1","howItRuns":"Partners. Two pairs start on offence and defence at the blocks; the coach has the ball on the wing. The ball-side player sets a cross screen for the other big, and defenders may not switch. Play is live when the coach passes into the post. After each possession the defence becomes the offence, the offence rotates off and a new pair defends. Games to 4.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 5](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/), 8, 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/5/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两人一组搭档。两组分别在两侧低位卡位点担任进攻和防守；教练在侧翼持球。强侧队员给另一名内线做横掩护，防守人不得换防。教练把球传进低位后开始实战。每回合结束后，防守方转为进攻，进攻方轮换下场，换一组新搭档防守。先到4分者胜。"},{"key":"U16|compete|3 on 3 Post Entry & Play","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Post defence","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 3 Post Entry & Play","nameZh":"3对3内线入球实战","howItRuns":"Teams of 3: one on offence, one on defence, extra teams behind the offence. The offence starts with a player at the top of the key with the ball, a post and a same-side wing. The wing gets open and makes a post entry pass; all passes are live and can be stolen. After the entry, guards may cut, screen or relocate while the ball is live, mostly staying on the same side. Defenders may dig in the post when it fits. Games to 3.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 8](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/8/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一队：一队进攻，一队防守，其余队伍在进攻方后面等候。进攻方起始站位：弧顶一人持球，一名内线，一名同侧侧翼。侧翼摆脱后给内线做入球传球；所有传球都是实战，可以被抢断。入球后，在活球状态下，后卫可以空切、掩护或换位，主要在同一侧活动。时机合适时，防守人可以下沉干扰低位。先到3分者胜。"},{"key":"U16|compete|Load to the Paint","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and closeouts","kind":"activity","name":"Load to the Paint","nameZh":"回收限制区","howItRuns":"Groups of 4 or 5 on the baseline; the coach has one ball. The first group runs in a small circle in the lane until the coach tosses the ball up, and all call \"shot.\" The players allowed to crash the offensive boards run to touch the backboard and sprint back; the guards, or others not allowed to crash, run back as soon as the ball is tossed. All sprint to load the paint, then turn and close out to the nearest perimeter spot calling \"Ball! Ball! Ball!\" The coach points in a couple of directions and players slide, then clap and hustle to the baseline at that end as the next group starts.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 11](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/11/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/11/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"4–5人一组站在底线；教练拿一个球。第一组在限制区内绕小圈跑，教练把球向上抛起，全体喊“投篮！”。允许冲抢前场篮板的队员跑去摸篮板再冲刺回防；后卫或其他不允许冲抢篮板的队员，球一抛起就立即回防。所有人冲刺回限制区收缩，然后转身扑防最近的外线位置，并喊“球！球！球！”。教练向几个方向指，球员滑步跟随，然后拍手，快速跑到那一端的底线，下一组开始。"},{"key":"U16|compete|1 on 1 – Stunt & Recover","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and closeouts","kind":"activity","name":"1 on 1 – Stunt & Recover","nameZh":"1对1：假协防与回位","howItRuns":"The coach has the ball on the wing; a line at the top of the key. The first player in line defends and the next attacks. The coach drives toward the middle and the defender stunts; the coach kicks to the attacker and the defender closes out. They play one 1 on 1 possession with a limit of 3 dribbles. Then the attacker becomes the defender and the defender leaves. Stunt, as the plan defines it: a defender one pass away fakes a hand and foot at the driver, then closes out on their own player when the ball is passed out.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 2](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/2/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"教练在侧翼持球；弧顶排一路纵队。排头防守，下一人进攻。教练向中路突破，防守人做假协防（stunt）；教练分球给进攻人，防守人扑防。两人打一个1对1回合，最多运3次球。然后进攻人转为防守人，原防守人离场。教案对“假协防”的定义：离球一传距离的防守人向突破者做手和脚的假动作，球传出后再扑防自己的人。"},{"key":"U16|compete|3 on 3 from Closeout","age":"U16","block":"compete","type":"defence","group":"Help defence and closeouts","kind":"activity","name":"3 on 3 from Closeout","nameZh":"扑防后3对3","howItRuns":"A player on each wing and one at the top; three lines on the baseline opposite them; the coach with one ball. When the coach passes to a perimeter player, the first three baseline players close out and play 3 on 3. Each team gets one shot. Then the next baseline group comes on. The plan stresses good closeouts and good defence. Games to 5.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两侧侧翼各一人，弧顶一人；对面底线排三路纵队；教练拿一个球。教练传给外线某一人时，底线三队的排头上前扑防，打3对3。每队各一次投篮机会。然后底线下一组上场。教案强调扑防到位、防守扎实。先到5分者胜。"},{"key":"U16|game|Additive Transition","age":"U16","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"Additive Transition","nameZh":"递增人数攻防转换","howItRuns":"Two teams, one at each end, full court. The advantage team starts 2 on 1 toward the other end. After a shot or turnover, the lone defender gets a teammate and they come back 2 on 2. Each later shot or turnover adds one player to the attacking side: 3 on 2, back 3 on 3, down 4 on 3, back 4 on 4, down 5 on 4, back 5 on 5. After the 5 on 5 possession the teams swap and the new advantage team restarts. First team to the set points wins.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 9](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/)","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/9/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"两队各站一端，全场。优势方先以2打1向另一端进攻。投篮或失误后，那名防守人加入一名队友，两人反攻回来打2对2。之后每次投篮或失误，进攻方都加一人：3打2过去，3对3回来，4打3过去，4对4回来，5打4过去，5对5回来。5对5回合结束后两队互换，新的优势方重新开始。先达到规定分数的队获胜。"},{"key":"U16|game|3 on 3 Dictated – Screen the Screener","age":"U16","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 Dictated – Screen the Screener","nameZh":"3对3指定开局：掩护掩护人","howItRuns":"Teams of 3; use both baskets with 4 or more teams. After every change of possession the ball goes back to the top of the key; a team that scores keeps the ball; no check ball. The coach starts with the ball on the wing. A guard on the ball-side block screens across the lane for a post coming to the ball side; then a player near the free-throw line screens for the guard, who comes off to the top. Then the ball is live. Games to 3 makes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一队；4队或以上时使用两个篮架。每次球权转换后，球回到弧顶；得分的队继续持球；不用交球确认（check）。教练在侧翼持球开始。强侧低位卡位点的一名后卫横穿限制区，为一名移向强侧的内线做掩护；接着罚球线附近的一名球员为这名后卫做掩护，后卫借掩护上到弧顶。之后进入实战。先投进3球者胜。"},{"key":"U16|game|3 on 3 Dictated – Elbow Pass","age":"U16","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"3 on 3 Dictated – Elbow Pass","nameZh":"3对3指定开局：肘区传球","howItRuns":"Teams of 3; use both baskets with 4 or more teams. After every change of possession the ball goes back to the top of the key; a team that scores keeps the ball; no check ball. Play starts with a pass from a guard at the top to the elbow. A second guard is on the same-side wing, so the two guards can run several cuts and screens on that side. Then the ball is live. Games to 3 makes.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 3](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/), 11","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/3/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"3人一队；4队或以上时使用两个篮架。每次球权转换后，球回到弧顶；得分的队继续持球；不用交球确认（check）。比赛由弧顶的后卫传球到肘区开始。第二名后卫在同侧侧翼，两名后卫可以在这一侧跑几次空切和掩护。之后进入实战。先投进3球者胜。"},{"key":"U16|game|5 on 5 Full Court Man to Man","age":"U16","block":"game","type":"games","group":null,"kind":"game","name":"5 on 5 Full Court Man to Man","nameZh":"5对5全场人盯人","howItRuns":"Balanced teams of 5, full court. Each player matches up with and guards one opponent full court. The coach stresses full-court pressure, with off-ball players staying on the line of the ball. Games to 5.","source":"[Jr. NBA MVP Plan 6](https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/), 12","sourceUrl":"https://jr.nba.com/basketball-practice-plans/mvp/page/6/","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"实力均衡的两队各5人，全场。每名球员对位一名对手，全场盯防。教练强调全场紧逼，无球防守人保持在球线上。先到5分者胜。"},{"key":"U16|game|24-second clock, 14 on a rebound","age":"U16","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U16","kind":"rule","name":"24-second clock, 14 on a rebound","nameZh":"24秒进攻计时，前场篮板14秒","howItRuns":"FIBA shot clock; reset to 14 seconds after an offensive rebound.","source":"[USA Basketball rules, grades 9–12](https://www.quickscores.com/downloads/mwrhuachucayouth_USA_Basketball_Youth_Guidelines__Rules_and_Standards.pdf)","sourceUrl":"https://www.quickscores.com/downloads/mwrhuachucayouth_USA_Basketball_Youth_Guidelines__Rules_and_Standards.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"采用FIBA进攻计时；抢到前场篮板后重置为14秒。"},{"key":"U16|game|Zone allowed, or not","age":"U16","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U16","kind":"rule","name":"Zone allowed, or not","nameZh":"是否允许区域防守","howItRuns":"FIBA allows zone from U16; New Zealand bans it at U16. Canada: bring in zone and presses only after basic skills hold up in games.","source":"Mini p.34; [Basketball New Zealand U16](https://nz.basketball/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BBNZ-Regs-Bk-3-Competition-as-of-5-Mar-2026.pdf); [Canada Basketball ADM](https://westvancouverschools.ca/docs/CanadaBasketballADM.pdf) p.46","sourceUrl":"https://nz.basketball/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BBNZ-Regs-Bk-3-Competition-as-of-5-Mar-2026.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"FIBA从U16开始允许区域防守；新西兰在U16禁止区域防守。加拿大：等基本技术在比赛中站得住了，再引入区域防守和紧逼。"},{"key":"U16|game|Four 8-minute quarters","age":"U16","block":"game","type":"rules","group":"Rule options added at U16","kind":"rule","name":"Four 8-minute quarters","nameZh":"四节×8分钟","howItRuns":"The length used in Ireland's U16 schools competition and China's junior high league; full FIBA is four 10-minute quarters.","source":"[Basketball Ireland schools](https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/2026/PPSC%20HANDBOOK%202026-2027.pdf); [Shaanxi notice](https://finance.sina.com.cn/wm/2026-05-25/doc-inhzchzh3486712.shtml)","sourceUrl":"https://ireland.basketball/uploads/ed/2026/PPSC%20HANDBOOK%202026-2027.pdf","fibaNameZh":null,"howItRunsZh":"这是爱尔兰U16校际比赛和中国初中联赛采用的时长；完整的FIBA规则为四节，每节10分钟。"}]}
"""#####
}
